(56791, 1359, 472, '<td valign="top">nice!  i like michelob dark.   should rotate the six pack so that the bottom is parallel wit the image frame.</td>', 'nice!  i like michelob dark.   should rotate the six pack so that the bottom is parallel wit the image frame.', '2002-05-08 08:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
