(56796, 1359, 878, '<td valign="top">Placement of the objects in this shot could of been better.  I would rather see the glass with nothing behind it to provide a clean shot of the product.   The lighting is fine but there are a bit too much reflections on the opened bottle.</td>', 'Placement of the objects in this shot could of been better.  I would rather see the glass with nothing behind it to provide a clean shot of the product.   The lighting is fine but there are a bit too much reflections on the opened bottle.', '2002-05-10 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
