(56805, 1361, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice layout... The lighting is a little weak and this photo seems a bit grainy...</td>', 'Nice layout... The lighting is a little weak and this photo seems a bit grainy...', '2002-05-06 05:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
