(56813, 1361, 888, '<td valign="top">focus could have been better, maybe it was too dark  though I guess a flash may have caused too much reflection</td>', 'focus could have been better, maybe it was too dark  though I guess a flash may have caused too much reflection', '2002-05-07 07:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56814, 1361, 428, '<td valign="top">This is blurry. Your set-up is good though, it highlights that one CD.</td>', 'This is blurry. Your set-up is good though, it highlights that one CD.', '2002-05-07 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56815, 1361, 536, '<td valign="top">A CD advert that looks like a CD advert should look.  I think the "suggestion" that of all the CDs around, I should check this one out. This photo isn''t weighted down with overly anal technical perfection.  It is what it is. And - it meets  the challenge by making me at least want to check out that CD. Excellent composition - imo.</td>', 'A CD advert that looks like a CD advert should look.  I think the "suggestion" that of all the CDs around, I should check this one out. This photo isn''t weighted down with overly anal technical perfection.  It is what it is. And - it meets  the challenge by making me at least want to check out that CD. Excellent composition - imo.', '2002-05-07 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56816, 1361, 656, '<td valign="top">good choice at least</td>', 'good choice at least', '2002-05-08 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56817, 1361, 1166, '<td valign="top">this SUX!<br/></td>', 'this SUX!', '2002-05-08 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56818, 1361, 1078, '<td valign="top">Without actually knowing what any of these covers look like in real life, it still seems to me like the colors aren''t right in this picture.  Did you try using either your camera''s color balance, or tweaking the color balance in your image editing software?</td>', 'Without actually knowing what any of these covers look like in real life, it still seems to me like the colors aren''t right in this picture.  Did you try using either your camera''s color balance, or tweaking the color balance in your image editing software?', '2002-05-08 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56819, 1361, 862, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this arrangement visually appealing.  Maybe having the CD sitting atop a pile of caseless CD''s would be more visually appealing.  Or maybe shoot from a higher angle with a little more light on the subject.</td>', 'I don''t find this arrangement visually appealing.  Maybe having the CD sitting atop a pile of caseless CD''s would be more visually appealing.  Or maybe shoot from a higher angle with a little more light on the subject.', '2002-05-08 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56820, 1361, 933, '<td valign="top">Lighting &amp; focus could be improved.</td>', 'Lighting & focus could be improved.', '2002-05-08 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
