(56824, 1361, 1510, '<td valign="top">are they all the same cd?  I like the layout but for advertising a band not too hot. your shadow on the wall is distracting and i am trying to figure out what the other cds are takes away from the main product.  it does not appear to have good focus either. <br/></td>', 'are they all the same cd?  I like the layout but for advertising a band not too hot. your shadow on the wall is distracting and i am trying to figure out what the other cds are takes away from the main product.  it does not appear to have good focus either. ', '2002-05-09 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56825, 1361, 878, '<td valign="top">The image is out of focus and the background and pile of cds make this looked like a rushed shot.</td>', 'The image is out of focus and the background and pile of cds make this looked like a rushed shot.', '2002-05-10 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
