(56855, 1363, 884, '<td valign="top">The "robot" isn''t very clear, but the photo is pretty nonetheless.</td>', 'The "robot" isn''t very clear, but the photo is pretty nonetheless.', '2002-05-09 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56856, 1363, 675, '<td valign="top">okay, so you want to sell robots? i''m not sure</td>', 'okay, so you want to sell robots? i''m not sure', '2002-05-09 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56857, 1363, 811, '<td valign="top">The only thing I would suggest, and this is just a personal preference, is that there would be something in the lower left OR the lights would be more in the upper right.   Since the lights cut across the mid-point line, it seems that there should be something there.  It is a cool picture, and I really like the effect of the overall lighting.</td>', 'The only thing I would suggest, and this is just a personal preference, is that there would be something in the lower left OR the lights would be more in the upper right.   Since the lights cut across the mid-point line, it seems that there should be something there.  It is a cool picture, and I really like the effect of the overall lighting.', '2002-05-09 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56858, 1363, 1510, '<td valign="top">what is this advertising?  That the robot can sling lights?  Now if it could do my yard work then I might buy it!</td>', 'what is this advertising?  That the robot can sling lights?  Now if it could do my yard work then I might buy it!', '2002-05-09 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56859, 1363, 875, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the blue highlights on the robot - very cute!</td>', 'I love the lighting and the blue highlights on the robot - very cute!', '2002-05-09 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56860, 1363, 543, '<td valign="top">Cool stuff.  I don''t know how well it works as an advertising image, but I like the lighitng you chose and you did a great job with the light trails in the bg.  On my monitor it looks like a small positive gamma adjustment would bring out more detail in the shadows, but it''s not absolutely necessary.  Well done!</td>', 'Cool stuff.  I don''t know how well it works as an advertising image, but I like the lighitng you chose and you did a great job with the light trails in the bg.  On my monitor it looks like a small positive gamma adjustment would bring out more detail in the shadows, but it''s not absolutely necessary.  Well done!', '2002-05-10 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56861, 1363, 878, '<td valign="top">Very cool, the blue / purple light makes this work even more for me.</td>', 'Very cool, the blue / purple light makes this work even more for me.', '2002-05-10 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56862, 1363, 1141, '<td valign="top">prettiful!</td>', 'prettiful!', '2002-05-11 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56863, 1363, 1, '<td valign="top">Very interesting background.  I think maybe showing what the robot can do or is used for would help (ie, will serve you coffee, or just something to play with (include a child)).</td>', 'Very interesting background.  I think maybe showing what the robot can do or is used for would help (ie, will serve you coffee, or just something to play with (include a child)).', '2002-05-12 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56864, 1363, 139, '<td valign="top">Where can I buy it?  Great shot.  I hope you write up a HOWTO for the site on this one.</td>', 'Where can I buy it?  Great shot.  I hope you write up a HOWTO for the site on this one.', '2002-05-12 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56865, 1364, 1360, '<td valign="top">This shot looks a little green</td>', 'This shot looks a little green', '2002-05-06 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56866, 1364, 536, '<td valign="top">Three things - first the nitpicking one.  Turn the apple sauce container a bit to the left.  2.  There seems to be a "fog" over the photo.  I copied it into software and ran auto levels. It brightened up and seemed more alive.  3.  Imo the composition is a big sterile.  Maybe a close up?  Something that adds drama and interest like stacking the apples behind the bowl of sauce and the product.</td>', 'Three things - first the nitpicking one.  Turn the apple sauce container a bit to the left.  2.  There seems to be a "fog" over the photo.  I copied it into software and ran auto levels. It brightened up and seemed more alive.  3.  Imo the composition is a big sterile.  Maybe a close up?  Something that adds drama and interest like stacking the apples behind the bowl of sauce and the product.', '2002-05-06 03:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56867, 1364, 1325, '<td valign="top">I look at your shot to see how it strikes me as a consumer.  It is simple and effective except for the product.  It is to small &amp; I would not remember the name when I got to the grocery store.  Your picture however is a lot better than some of the artsy ones that totally miss the point.  Keep it simple and with something the consumer will relate to which is what I think you were doing.</td>', 'I look at your shot to see how it strikes me as a consumer.  It is simple and effective except for the product.  It is to small & I would not remember the name when I got to the grocery store.  Your picture however is a lot better than some of the artsy ones that totally miss the point.  Keep it simple and with something the consumer will relate to which is what I think you were doing.', '2002-05-06 06:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
