(56954, 1368, 301, '<td valign="top">would love to know how you did this.  The IE window looks like it has been stretched to fit along the side of the photo ... maybe its just parallax error.<br/><br/>Oh well ... cool idea ... probably would''ve preferred a different background ... maybe a pic of a lemon with a darker background to give the bottle an even more ghostly look and keep the ad in line with the product.</td>', 'would love to know how you did this.  The IE window looks like it has been stretched to fit along the side of the photo ... maybe its just parallax error.Oh well ... cool idea ... probably would''ve preferred a different background ... maybe a pic of a lemon with a darker background to give the bottle an even more ghostly look and keep the ad in line with the product.', '2002-05-08 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56955, 1368, 472, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2002-05-08 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56956, 1368, 1523, '<td valign="top">The DP Challenge background is great.</td>', 'The DP Challenge background is great.', '2002-05-08 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56957, 1368, 543, '<td valign="top">"Gordon fell off the wagon, Gordon fell off the wagon..."  Flash for the bottle was a good choice, as you got that great, glowing logo working for you.  You raise the bar on submission technicality, for sure.  Don''t let the turkeys get you down.</td>', '"Gordon fell off the wagon, Gordon fell off the wagon..."  Flash for the bottle was a good choice, as you got that great, glowing logo working for you.  You raise the bar on submission technicality, for sure.  Don''t let the turkeys get you down.', '2002-05-09 05:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56958, 1368, 843, '<td valign="top">You don''t like taking the anonymous route do you! Nice double exposure. It''s nice the way the screen is blurred but the bottle is in focus.</td>', 'You don''t like taking the anonymous route do you! Nice double exposure. It''s nice the way the screen is blurred but the bottle is in focus.', '2002-05-09 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56959, 1368, 1540, '<td valign="top">The photographer must have drunk too much Absolut</td>', 'The photographer must have drunk too much Absolut', '2002-05-09 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56960, 1368, 813, '<td valign="top">very clever, you guys with camera''s that take multiple exposures make me jealous, nice concept and layout, i''m guessing you printed the webpage on paper for the background to be able to control the light. am i right? nice job</td>', 'very clever, you guys with camera''s that take multiple exposures make me jealous, nice concept and layout, i''m guessing you printed the webpage on paper for the background to be able to control the light. am i right? nice job', '2002-05-09 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56961, 1368, 889, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, it would be alot better if you did it from something that was more of a stable base.</td>', 'Very good idea, it would be alot better if you did it from something that was more of a stable base.', '2002-05-10 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56962, 1368, 1191, '<td valign="top">Brill</td>', 'Brill', '2002-05-10 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56963, 1368, 554, '<td valign="top">this is funny---good job</td>', 'this is funny---good job', '2002-05-11 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56964, 1368, 142, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done photo.  I don''t think it would make the greatest ad for alcohol but I love the photo.</td>', 'Beautifully done photo.  I don''t think it would make the greatest ad for alcohol but I love the photo.', '2002-05-11 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56965, 1368, 1031, '<td valign="top">Very nice multiple expoure/vision effect, but I''m not sure it''s a great recommendations for your target audience, "the members of DPChallenge" -- or. then again, maybe it is...at least for the Windows users...</td>', 'Very nice multiple expoure/vision effect, but I''m not sure it''s a great recommendations for your target audience, "the members of DPChallenge" -- or. then again, maybe it is...at least for the Windows users...', '2002-05-12 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56966, 1368, 1535, '<td valign="top">very original.....</td>', 'very original.....', '2002-05-12 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56967, 1368, 446, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to figure out what was going on here.  Nice effect with the shaking monitor.  The bottle almost looks like it is floating in air.  I like your technique here.  Good job.</td>', 'It took me a while to figure out what was going on here.  Nice effect with the shaking monitor.  The bottle almost looks like it is floating in air.  I like your technique here.  Good job.', '2002-05-12 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56968, 1368, 587, '<td valign="top">Inebriation or hallucination ;)</td>', 'Inebriation or hallucination ;)', '2002-05-12 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56969, 1368, 509, '<td valign="top">Cool effect with the bottle reflection, though the background blur (while fitting with the title), isn''t exactly easy on the eyes</td>', 'Cool effect with the bottle reflection, though the background blur (while fitting with the title), isn''t exactly easy on the eyes', '2002-05-12 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56970, 1368, 2, '<td valign="top">The talent in putting this shot together is just amazing.  You''ve stretched the camera-only side of this as far as you possible could.  Nicely done!</td>', 'The talent in putting this shot together is just amazing.  You''ve stretched the camera-only side of this as far as you possible could.  Nicely done!', '2002-05-12 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56971, 1368, 637, '<td valign="top">A parody, not an ad.  Hmmm is that 74 users/8.09 score on the ground up challenge?  Who could that be?</td>', 'A parody, not an ad.  Hmmm is that 74 users/8.09 score on the ground up challenge?  Who could that be?', '2002-05-12 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56972, 1368, 2, '<td valign="top">This photo would have done much better if I''d have had the time to add our ''admin note'' feature this week.  My sincere apologies.  I''ll have that feature up soon.</td>', 'This photo would have done much better if I''d have had the time to add our ''admin note'' feature this week.  My sincere apologies.  I''ll have that feature up soon.', '2002-05-13 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(56973, 1368, 255, '<td valign="top">gordon, this was my favorite picture--you were robbed! ;)</td>', 'gordon, this was my favorite picture--you were robbed! ;)', '2002-05-13 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(56974, 1368, 772, '<td valign="top">Gordon, your photos never cease to amaze me... Your photogrpahy is great... This is a sad representation of the voters, not the photographer... Keep up the outstanding work... :)</td>', 'Gordon, your photos never cease to amaze me... Your photogrpahy is great... This is a sad representation of the voters, not the photographer... Keep up the outstanding work... :)', '2002-05-13 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(56975, 1368, 544, '<td valign="top">You were definitely robbed. 43 5''s? 8 1''s??</td>', 'You were definitely robbed. 43 5''s? 8 1''s??', '2002-05-13 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(56976, 1368, 656, '<td valign="top">So this was ''legal'' and it was not a multiple exposure shot.  The scale is correct for the image and bottle as it was taken in one go and carefully lit.<br/><br/></td>', 'So this was ''legal'' and it was not a multiple exposure shot.  The scale is correct for the image and bottle as it was taken in one go and carefully lit.', '2002-05-13 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(56977, 1368, 4049, '<td valign="top">I loved reading the tutorial for this shot, really well done technique and interesting outcome.</td>', 'I loved reading the tutorial for this shot, really well done technique and interesting outcome.', '2002-09-20 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(56978, 1377, 1226, '<td valign="top">I like it. Maybe a glass of milk next to it would have been nice, or one bie out of one cookie, but this really makes ya want some cookies.</td>', 'I like it. Maybe a glass of milk next to it would have been nice, or one bie out of one cookie, but this really makes ya want some cookies.', '2002-05-06 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56979, 1377, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of background, makes the cookies appear very old fashioned. Jjust the way Mom made them...</td>', 'Nice choice of background, makes the cookies appear very old fashioned. Jjust the way Mom made them...', '2002-05-06 06:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56980, 1377, 92, '<td valign="top">No milk ? Where''s my milk ?!?!?! I think you did a great job. I wouldn''t have cut off the bottom of the plate. Maybe have torn a hot cookie in half to see the chocolate melty...but that is sooooo just a idea and nothing taken from your photo:) Nice !</td>', 'No milk ? Where''s my milk ?!?!?! I think you did a great job. I wouldn''t have cut off the bottom of the plate. Maybe have torn a hot cookie in half to see the chocolate melty...but that is sooooo just a idea and nothing taken from your photo:) Nice !', '2002-05-06 06:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56981, 1377, 327, '<td valign="top">This is nice but the white background is fried under your lights. The blue and yellow almost save it but don''t get there.<br/>The photo is clear, I like the simple set up too.</td>', 'This is nice but the white background is fried under your lights. The blue and yellow almost save it but don''t get there.The photo is clear, I like the simple set up too.', '2002-05-06 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56982, 1377, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good Advert!  I''m hungry!  The plate was a good choice, but the tablecloth "wierded" me out.  Photo 9 Advert 9 total 9</td>', 'Good Advert!  I''m hungry!  The plate was a good choice, but the tablecloth "wierded" me out.  Photo 9 Advert 9 total 9', '2002-05-06 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56983, 1377, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  however, I don''t think I can score this one before i do the taste test :)) nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!  however, I don''t think I can score this one before i do the taste test :)) nice shot!', '2002-05-06 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56984, 1377, 259, '<td valign="top">as many people are probably mentioning, the plate being cut off detracts from the overall picture.</td>', 'as many people are probably mentioning, the plate being cut off detracts from the overall picture.', '2002-05-06 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56985, 1377, 1485, '<td valign="top">color of the plate is very cool.  compo is nice, but I think cropped too close.  The entire plate should show.  Also, I''m bothered by the yellowish shadows on the left.  Looks like a mix of flourescent / incandescent lighting (sorry if the spelling is off).  Also, one cookie should have had a BIG BIG bit taken out.. or.. the picture should have been with one cookie, almost eaten.. and some crumbs.</td>', 'color of the plate is very cool.  compo is nice, but I think cropped too close.  The entire plate should show.  Also, I''m bothered by the yellowish shadows on the left.  Looks like a mix of flourescent / incandescent lighting (sorry if the spelling is off).  Also, one cookie should have had a BIG BIG bit taken out.. or.. the picture should have been with one cookie, almost eaten.. and some crumbs.', '2002-05-06 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56986, 1377, 459, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  The mat (is it a paper towel?) frames the shot nicely.  The product looks good, but the color in the cookies is kind of over done.  The shadows are really the problem.  How did you get a brown/yellow shadow on one side of the subject and a bluish one on the other?</td>', 'Great idea!  The mat (is it a paper towel?) frames the shot nicely.  The product looks good, but the color in the cookies is kind of over done.  The shadows are really the problem.  How did you get a brown/yellow shadow on one side of the subject and a bluish one on the other?', '2002-05-06 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56987, 1377, 428, '<td valign="top">I''d buy that!  Yummy!!!  Good focusing.  The only thing I can nit-pick on this one is that the package of cookies is a little bit tilted on the top, but gets a high score!</td>', 'I''d buy that!  Yummy!!!  Good focusing.  The only thing I can nit-pick on this one is that the package of cookies is a little bit tilted on the top, but gets a high score!', '2002-05-06 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56988, 1377, 1336, '<td valign="top">very vivid colors</td>', 'very vivid colors', '2002-05-06 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56989, 1377, 888, '<td valign="top">hmmmmm, dough boy.........  The cookies look gooood.  My only problem with the pic is the choice of plate, I don''t know why but to me the uyellow rim just doesn''t look right.</td>', 'hmmmmm, dough boy.........  The cookies look gooood.  My only problem with the pic is the choice of plate, I don''t know why but to me the uyellow rim just doesn''t look right.', '2002-05-07 04:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56990, 1377, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice, but a but too symmetrical.  Perhaps a glass of milk might have rounded this out?</td>', 'Nice, but a but too symmetrical.  Perhaps a glass of milk might have rounded this out?', '2002-05-07 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56991, 1377, 661, '<td valign="top">Too much glare or too bright?</td>', 'Too much glare or too bright?', '2002-05-07 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56992, 1377, 813, '<td valign="top">composition need work to be interesting, try shooting from a low angle with cookies in foreground and product package in background at an angle</td>', 'composition need work to be interesting, try shooting from a low angle with cookies in foreground and product package in background at an angle', '2002-05-07 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56993, 1377, 714, '<td valign="top">My favorite cookie.  Good job.  I like the colors.  The plate is cut off.  Was there a reason for that?  :)</td>', 'My favorite cookie.  Good job.  I like the colors.  The plate is cut off.  Was there a reason for that?  :)', '2002-05-07 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56994, 1377, 472, '<td valign="top">yum. i like this. weird how you have yellow and blue shadows. did u use gels on your lights?  straighten the dough so it''s parallel with the top of the frame and you have a winner here.  maybe use tracing paper or diffsuers so your shadows arent quite as heavy, and maybe a different background too. god job.</td>', 'yum. i like this. weird how you have yellow and blue shadows. did u use gels on your lights?  straighten the dough so it''s parallel with the top of the frame and you have a winner here.  maybe use tracing paper or diffsuers so your shadows arent quite as heavy, and maybe a different background too. god job.', '2002-05-08 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56995, 1377, 862, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes the cookies look distasteful.  Also, the shadows are distracting.</td>', 'The lighting makes the cookies look distasteful.  Also, the shadows are distracting.', '2002-05-08 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56996, 1377, 527, '<td valign="top">Yum, I want one. Nice choice of colors.</td>', 'Yum, I want one. Nice choice of colors.', '2002-05-08 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56997, 1377, 889, '<td valign="top">nice shot  and the plate is nicely set off from the tablecloth. the tablecloth is a bit washed out.</td>', 'nice shot  and the plate is nicely set off from the tablecloth. the tablecloth is a bit washed out.', '2002-05-08 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56998, 1377, 554, '<td valign="top">somewhat washed out</td>', 'somewhat washed out', '2002-05-08 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56999, 1377, 1209, '<td valign="top">I''d almost have guessed that this was from a magazine. High points for a well executed pic.</td>', 'I''d almost have guessed that this was from a magazine. High points for a well executed pic.', '2002-05-08 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57000, 1377, 884, '<td valign="top">Very nice layout, makes my tummy cry for some!</td>', 'Very nice layout, makes my tummy cry for some!', '2002-05-09 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57001, 1377, 675, '<td valign="top">the brilliant colors save this one</td>', 'the brilliant colors save this one', '2002-05-09 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57002, 1377, 142, '<td valign="top">They look good!.  Other than the tablecloth being a little too bright, it''s a nice photo.</td>', 'They look good!.  Other than the tablecloth being a little too bright, it''s a nice photo.', '2002-05-09 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57003, 1377, 543, '<td valign="top">Send a dozen and I''ll raise your score three points!  Very appealing colors.  The layout could be more interesting, but maybe that''s not necessary with this kind of product.  The lighting, while it worked pretty well on the cookies and dough, made some problematic double shadows and overexposure on the placemat.</td>', 'Send a dozen and I''ll raise your score three points!  Very appealing colors.  The layout could be more interesting, but maybe that''s not necessary with this kind of product.  The lighting, while it worked pretty well on the cookies and dough, made some problematic double shadows and overexposure on the placemat.', '2002-05-10 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57004, 1377, 878, '<td valign="top">Very basic shot but still effective</td>', 'Very basic shot but still effective', '2002-05-10 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57005, 1377, 1031, '<td valign="top">Please send yummy cookies to.....<br/><br/>I like that plate you found for this shot.</td>', 'Please send yummy cookies to.....I like that plate you found for this shot.', '2002-05-10 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57006, 1377, 1191, '<td valign="top">Well done, nice photo</td>', 'Well done, nice photo', '2002-05-10 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57007, 1377, 113, '<td valign="top">This is a good pic, but there is something about the coloring of the cookies.  I wish I could tell you how to do it different.</td>', 'This is a good pic, but there is something about the coloring of the cookies.  I wish I could tell you how to do it different.', '2002-05-11 07:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57008, 1377, 326, '<td valign="top">Now I have to run to the store....lol Good Job!</td>', 'Now I have to run to the store....lol Good Job!', '2002-05-11 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57009, 1377, 835, '<td valign="top">I like your color choice with the plate and I think the shadows help the product pop off the screen.  I think it would have been a nice touch to have a bite taken out of one of the cookies; too good to resist.</td>', 'I like your color choice with the plate and I think the shadows help the product pop off the screen.  I think it would have been a nice touch to have a bite taken out of one of the cookies; too good to resist.', '2002-05-11 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57010, 1377, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, on the verge of too bright.</td>', 'Nice pic, on the verge of too bright.', '2002-05-12 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57011, 1377, 811, '<td valign="top">I love chocolate chip cookies!!!!!!!!!!!!!<br/>One question -- the yellow reflection on the left, a nd the bluish-purple on the right, was that intentional, and if so, how did you do it?  Looks cool.</td>', 'I love chocolate chip cookies!!!!!!!!!!!!!One question -- the yellow reflection on the left, a nd the bluish-purple on the right, was that intentional, and if so, how did you do it?  Looks cool.', '2002-05-12 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57012, 1377, 587, '<td valign="top">what - no candle light? no rose? (jk) good clarity cookies seem a little bright, like the shadows........Got Milk? :)  sorry couldn''t help myself.</td>', 'what - no candle light? no rose? (jk) good clarity cookies seem a little bright, like the shadows........Got Milk? :)  sorry couldn''t help myself.', '2002-05-12 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57013, 1377, 1, '<td valign="top">A slight cropping problem it seems at the bottom.</td>', 'A slight cropping problem it seems at the bottom.', '2002-05-12 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57014, 1377, 509, '<td valign="top">mmm, looks good!  I like the ambience of the light here, really makes the image come alive</td>', 'mmm, looks good!  I like the ambience of the light here, really makes the image come alive', '2002-05-12 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57015, 1378, 441, '<td valign="top">difficult shot - good exposure</td>', 'difficult shot - good exposure', '2002-05-06 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57016, 1378, 142, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture.  It would not inspire me to on the purchasing side though.</td>', 'Pretty picture.  It would not inspire me to on the purchasing side though.', '2002-05-06 06:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57017, 1378, 570, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.</td>', 'I don''t get it.', '2002-05-06 08:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57018, 1378, 1024, '<td valign="top">The background is a little confusing... what is that back there?</td>', 'The background is a little confusing... what is that back there?', '2002-05-06 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57019, 1378, 772, '<td valign="top">The composition on this shot may have been a little better if the candles were on the lower portion of the frame rather than centered across the middle... Good job!</td>', 'The composition on this shot may have been a little better if the candles were on the lower portion of the frame rather than centered across the middle... Good job!', '2002-05-06 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57020, 1378, 835, '<td valign="top">I don''t have any suggestions but the arrangement seems off to me.  It doesn''t flow or feel balanced.  The candles are all in 2 lines in the middle and it seems like something should be more to the front.  I hope that makes some sense.</td>', 'I don''t have any suggestions but the arrangement seems off to me.  It doesn''t flow or feel balanced.  The candles are all in 2 lines in the middle and it seems like something should be more to the front.  I hope that makes some sense.', '2002-05-06 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57021, 1378, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, less than effective advert (so is mine!)  Photo 10 Advert 4 Creativitiy 5 total 6</td>', 'Nice photo, less than effective advert (so is mine!)  Photo 10 Advert 4 Creativitiy 5 total 6', '2002-05-06 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57022, 1378, 327, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry is this all candles? If the bottle at the back is the product I can''t see it to tell what it is?<br/></td>', 'I''m sorry is this all candles? If the bottle at the back is the product I can''t see it to tell what it is?', '2002-05-06 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57023, 1378, 259, '<td valign="top">yes candles</td>', 'yes candles', '2002-05-06 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57024, 1378, 1204, '<td valign="top">Technically well done but I kind of miss the point - whate are you selling?  Candles?</td>', 'Technically well done but I kind of miss the point - whate are you selling?  Candles?', '2002-05-06 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57025, 1378, 888, '<td valign="top">but whats it advertising? Candles?  Nic epic but it seems you took a pic that you liked and then shoved it in the ad challenge without it realy being an advert<br/></td>', 'but whats it advertising? Candles?  Nic epic but it seems you took a pic that you liked and then shoved it in the ad challenge without it realy being an advert', '2002-05-06 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57026, 1378, 472, '<td valign="top">a lovely scene. woul dbe a good entry for a ''light'' challenge</td>', 'a lovely scene. woul dbe a good entry for a ''light'' challenge', '2002-05-08 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57027, 1378, 1, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''ve seen too many candle ads in my lifetime, so I guess you get points for originality.</td>', 'Not sure I''ve seen too many candle ads in my lifetime, so I guess you get points for originality.', '2002-05-08 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57028, 1378, 862, '<td valign="top">This advertisement reminds me that candles don''t shed very much light, and so I probably shouldn''t by any.</td>', 'This advertisement reminds me that candles don''t shed very much light, and so I probably shouldn''t by any.', '2002-05-08 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57029, 1378, 813, '<td valign="top">nice feel, i like the color and composition, wish it had a little more detail in the foreground, perhaps a reflector would help</td>', 'nice feel, i like the color and composition, wish it had a little more detail in the foreground, perhaps a reflector would help', '2002-05-08 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57030, 1378, 675, '<td valign="top">trying to sell all candles everywhere? i''m not interested</td>', 'trying to sell all candles everywhere? i''m not interested', '2002-05-09 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57031, 1378, 121, '<td valign="top">Is this an advert for candles or what?  Sorry I don''t get it</td>', 'Is this an advert for candles or what?  Sorry I don''t get it', '2002-05-09 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57032, 1378, 1510, '<td valign="top">advertisement?  where is it?</td>', 'advertisement?  where is it?', '2002-05-09 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57033, 1378, 811, '<td valign="top">very warm looking,  the candles make the lighting very soft and ambient -- good for this shot, I think.  Maybe needs to be cropped a little more on the right.</td>', 'very warm looking,  the candles make the lighting very soft and ambient -- good for this shot, I think.  Maybe needs to be cropped a little more on the right.', '2002-05-09 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57034, 1378, 1209, '<td valign="top">very effective picture; vivid coloring, but the composition seems a little busy on the left. Keeps drawing my eye over to that side, trying to decide what all the objects are. Otherwise this pic would be "simple elegance".</td>', 'very effective picture; vivid coloring, but the composition seems a little busy on the left. Keeps drawing my eye over to that side, trying to decide what all the objects are. Otherwise this pic would be "simple elegance".', '2002-05-10 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57035, 1378, 878, '<td valign="top">Pretty colorful for a dark shot.   The selling point is somewhat lost because all the candles are in glasses but a rather nice shot.</td>', 'Pretty colorful for a dark shot.   The selling point is somewhat lost because all the candles are in glasses but a rather nice shot.', '2002-05-10 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
