(57156, 1389, 428, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photograph! I love the reflections in the water. I''d take a ride on one of these in a minute!</td>', 'This is a beautiful photograph! I love the reflections in the water. I''d take a ride on one of these in a minute!', '2002-05-06 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
