(57158, 1389, 888, '<td valign="top">absolutely beatiful picture, but "I" feel its a bit too vague as an advert.  Just my opinion but I think this pic could have been taken and then titled to fit the challenge.<br/>Quite a high score for sheer beauty though</td>', 'absolutely beatiful picture, but "I" feel its a bit too vague as an advert.  Just my opinion but I think this pic could have been taken and then titled to fit the challenge.Quite a high score for sheer beauty though', '2002-05-07 07:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57159, 1389, 1037, '<td valign="top">People probably don''t think this meets the challenge criteria, but I think it''s beautiful, and it definitely makes me want to go midnight sailing in Vancouver :)</td>', 'People probably don''t think this meets the challenge criteria, but I think it''s beautiful, and it definitely makes me want to go midnight sailing in Vancouver :)', '2002-05-07 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57160, 1389, 446, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Looks like you were pushing the limits of resolution here for a 640X480 shot.  I rate this picture very high.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Looks like you were pushing the limits of resolution here for a 640X480 shot.  I rate this picture very high.  Keep up the good work.', '2002-05-07 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
