(57174, 1389, 889, '<td valign="top">wow that water is so smooth, unfortuanly no one there is sailing. otherwise it is a beautiflul shot. was the watter really that calm or did the long time exposure cover up the reflection?</td>', 'wow that water is so smooth, unfortuanly no one there is sailing. otherwise it is a beautiflul shot. was the watter really that calm or did the long time exposure cover up the reflection?', '2002-05-08 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
