(57179, 1389, 543, '<td valign="top">A really nice picture, if a little oversharpened (jaggies in the rigging show it best).  Can''t for the life of me find a product here, though.  Whatcha selling?</td>', 'A really nice picture, if a little oversharpened (jaggies in the rigging show it best).  Can''t for the life of me find a product here, though.  Whatcha selling?', '2002-05-10 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
