(57189, 1391, 1360, '<td valign="top">I love this.  I obsessed all week trying to come up with something.  I zereoed out, and I wish I could have thought of this...</td>', 'I love this.  I obsessed all week trying to come up with something.  I zereoed out, and I wish I could have thought of this...', '2002-05-06 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
