(57200, 1391, 1357, '<td valign="top">Ah! I recognise that familiar screen. And yes, by the way it does still appear in windows XP. I know, i`ve seen it enough.</td>', 'Ah! I recognise that familiar screen. And yes, by the way it does still appear in windows XP. I know, i`ve seen it enough.', '2002-05-06 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
