(57214, 1391, 714, '<td valign="top">Boy, there is alot of who drink this stuff.  Never even heard of it.  :)  I like it and didn''t even have to read the title to figure it out,  But I don''t think it is wise to drink when you get frustrated. ;)  Great picture.</td>', 'Boy, there is alot of who drink this stuff.  Never even heard of it.  :)  I like it and didn''t even have to read the title to figure it out,  But I don''t think it is wise to drink when you get frustrated. ;)  Great picture.', '2002-05-07 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57215, 1391, 656, '<td valign="top">must have taken a long time to get the background set up:)  Nicely done, well focused - might have prefered the whole seal in the shot.</td>', 'must have taken a long time to get the background set up:)  Nicely done, well focused - might have prefered the whole seal in the shot.', '2002-05-08 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57216, 1391, 301, '<td valign="top">he he ... I''m sure we''re all with you there :)  Being an advertisement though, I''d rather see the full label of the bottle</td>', 'he he ... I''m sure we''re all with you there :)  Being an advertisement though, I''d rather see the full label of the bottle', '2002-05-08 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57217, 1391, 527, '<td valign="top">Excellent!! Very creative. I think I will buy some. I might have shown a little more of the word ''Vodka'' and minimized the reflection behind that word. Very good all the same.</td>', 'Excellent!! Very creative. I think I will buy some. I might have shown a little more of the word ''Vodka'' and minimized the reflection behind that word. Very good all the same.', '2002-05-08 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57218, 1391, 543, '<td valign="top">Did you try any with the text visible through the bottle?  Might have been interesting.  Loads of blue channel noise made more evident by the sharpening - reduces the clarity of the glass.  Actually, there''s what''s bothering me - between the noise and not being able to see anything but blue screen behind the glass, the bottle could almost be opaqe.  Still in my top 10.  Nice work.</td>', 'Did you try any with the text visible through the bottle?  Might have been interesting.  Loads of blue channel noise made more evident by the sharpening - reduces the clarity of the glass.  Actually, there''s what''s bothering me - between the noise and not being able to see anything but blue screen behind the glass, the bottle could almost be opaqe.  Still in my top 10.  Nice work.', '2002-05-09 05:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57219, 1391, 107, '<td valign="top">fantastic</td>', 'fantastic', '2002-05-09 06:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57220, 1391, 675, '<td valign="top">you should have tried to get the whole absolut name in the picture, and maybe tried to get a clearer image of the blue screen. i like it though, especially the pissed old man</td>', 'you should have tried to get the whole absolut name in the picture, and maybe tried to get a clearer image of the blue screen. i like it though, especially the pissed old man', '2002-05-09 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
