(57272, 1393, 459, '<td valign="top">Tim - You were robbed!  Your photo really belongs in the top three.  Everything about it is well done.  And the text in the upper left absolutely should be there.  It''s an ad for a video game input device, for crying out loud!</td>', 'Tim - You were robbed!  Your photo really belongs in the top three.  Everything about it is well done.  And the text in the upper left absolutely should be there.  It''s an ad for a video game input device, for crying out loud!', '2002-05-13 08:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(57273, 1393, 47, '<td valign="top">i definitely thought this was going to win. i like the inclusion of the ''spacebar'' text. its important to advertise something clearly, after all, ''giving it away'' is what beer ads are all about, and anyone that thinks the alcohol industry isnt a big fat moneygrubbing whore is kidding themselves. you gave away that this was a computer game and you still managed to do a good job of putting the viewer where they belong in the ad - a position in which they desire the marketed product. inclusiveness is how ads appeal to people.<br/><br/>absolutely, positively, definitely, robbed.</td>', 'i definitely thought this was going to win. i like the inclusion of the ''spacebar'' text. its important to advertise something clearly, after all, ''giving it away'' is what beer ads are all about, and anyone that thinks the alcohol industry isnt a big fat moneygrubbing whore is kidding themselves. you gave away that this was a computer game and you still managed to do a good job of putting the viewer where they belong in the ad - a position in which they desire the marketed product. inclusiveness is how ads appeal to people.absolutely, positively, definitely, robbed.', '2002-05-14 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
