(57323, 1396, 1336, '<td valign="top">this photo is only 62k.  maybe if you would have saved it at a higher quality jpeg, you wouldnt have the problem with the for sale sign.  also, this photo just doesnt look like an advertisement.  it''s cute, but it would have been more appropriate to have the house in view and get rid of the dog.</td>', 'this photo is only 62k.  maybe if you would have saved it at a higher quality jpeg, you wouldnt have the problem with the for sale sign.  also, this photo just doesnt look like an advertisement.  it''s cute, but it would have been more appropriate to have the house in view and get rid of the dog.', '2002-05-06 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57324, 1396, 1037, '<td valign="top">More of a jokey snapshot than an advertisement.</td>', 'More of a jokey snapshot than an advertisement.', '2002-05-07 05:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57325, 1396, 1041, '<td valign="top">And I''ve always been thinking these signs were for the houses . . . ;o)  Interesting take on the challenge, cute dog.  Picture feels a little fuzzy and the dog''s paws are cut off, though.</td>', 'And I''ve always been thinking these signs were for the houses . . . ;o)  Interesting take on the challenge, cute dog.  Picture feels a little fuzzy and the dog''s paws are cut off, though.', '2002-05-07 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
