(57329, 1396, 714, '<td valign="top">It is great how you thought of the dog to put in front of the number.  Cute puppy. <br/>How many bedrooms?  I need 4 bedrooms and 2 baths.  Great yard.</td>', 'It is great how you thought of the dog to put in front of the number.  Cute puppy. How many bedrooms?  I need 4 bedrooms and 2 baths.  Great yard.', '2002-05-07 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57330, 1396, 1078, '<td valign="top">It seems a tad unfocused -- I think maybe a vertical shot, taken at more of a top down angle would have helped you lose all that "empty space" on the sides of the image and removed the roofs of the houses in the background</td>', 'It seems a tad unfocused -- I think maybe a vertical shot, taken at more of a top down angle would have helped you lose all that "empty space" on the sides of the image and removed the roofs of the houses in the background', '2002-05-08 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57331, 1396, 813, '<td valign="top">I like idea but  wish the photo were stronger, ie, sharper, better contrast, level, better compostion</td>', 'I like idea but  wish the photo were stronger, ie, sharper, better contrast, level, better compostion', '2002-05-08 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57332, 1396, 811, '<td valign="top">Ha Ha.  Poor dog, it''s cute, though.  maybe cropping both the left and right more tightly, or putting the dog a little more to the right (off-center), or taking the picture from an angle would have given this picture a little more interest.  I know that may not have been possible, though.</td>', 'Ha Ha.  Poor dog, it''s cute, though.  maybe cropping both the left and right more tightly, or putting the dog a little more to the right (off-center), or taking the picture from an angle would have given this picture a little more interest.  I know that may not have been possible, though.', '2002-05-09 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
