(57430, 1401, 156, '<td valign="top">the background detracts from the wonderful lines, a solid windowless building wall would have worked great, as would an empty parking lot to eliminate reflections of neighboring cars (someone holding a large solid sheet open at reflective points would do the same thing) ...also, remove the bug guts</td>', 'the background detracts from the wonderful lines, a solid windowless building wall would have worked great, as would an empty parking lot to eliminate reflections of neighboring cars (someone holding a large solid sheet open at reflective points would do the same thing) ...also, remove the bug guts', '2002-05-06 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
