(57436, 1401, 1204, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  I was going to downgrade for the background but on second thought it adds to the reality and tells you it is not a matchbox.  8 from me.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  I was going to downgrade for the background but on second thought it adds to the reality and tells you it is not a matchbox.  8 from me.', '2002-05-06 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
