(57442, 1401, 509, '<td valign="top">Cool use of B&amp;W. I like the perspective, would have also worked for the previous challenge</td>', 'Cool use of B&W. I like the perspective, would have also worked for the previous challenge', '2002-05-06 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57443, 1401, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very slick and commercial, and even beyond that a nice photo because of the lighting and composition. It''s a shame though that in this challenge, although people can imitate commercial photography, without lots of post production they can''t really get there. The scratches and dust on this car''s paintwork would be completely airbrushed out if it was a real advertisement.</td>', 'Very slick and commercial, and even beyond that a nice photo because of the lighting and composition. It''s a shame though that in this challenge, although people can imitate commercial photography, without lots of post production they can''t really get there. The scratches and dust on this car''s paintwork would be completely airbrushed out if it was a real advertisement.', '2002-05-07 03:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57444, 1401, 780, '<td valign="top">Great angle.   I really like the b&amp;w effect, too.  I would have rather the car reflected in the turn signal be an ''old style'' beetle (or not there at all)</td>', 'Great angle.   I really like the b&w effect, too.  I would have rather the car reflected in the turn signal be an ''old style'' beetle (or not there at all)', '2002-05-07 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
