(57446, 1401, 215, '<td valign="top">Why B&amp;W? The angle is wonderful, as is the framing. But the Beatle is meant to be colorful and fun... Making it B&amp;W mutes that.</td>', 'Why B&W? The angle is wonderful, as is the framing. But the Beatle is meant to be colorful and fun... Making it B&W mutes that.', '2002-05-07 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
