(57456, 1401, 811, '<td valign="top">A little heavy with the lighting on the left, but otherwise, I thought this was a really good picture.</td>', 'A little heavy with the lighting on the left, but otherwise, I thought this was a really good picture.', '2002-05-09 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57457, 1401, 543, '<td valign="top">The new bug is a great subject, but you haven''t made the most of it here.  The low angle is cool, but the flash glare on the bumper and washed out fender detract.  I''d have cropped off the very bottom, as well, since it makes the tires look truncated.  The trees in the background don''t do much for me, and interfere with the outline of the car.  Maybe color would have worked better in that regard.</td>', 'The new bug is a great subject, but you haven''t made the most of it here.  The low angle is cool, but the flash glare on the bumper and washed out fender detract.  I''d have cropped off the very bottom, as well, since it makes the tires look truncated.  The trees in the background don''t do much for me, and interfere with the outline of the car.  Maybe color would have worked better in that regard.', '2002-05-10 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57458, 1401, 889, '<td valign="top">interesting reflection of the other car in directional light. Im not sure if it was intentiaonl. it is centered very nicely though, so probably.<br/>are you implying that the Bug is the rreflection of an economy car? Very nice symitry and use of the camera flash</td>', 'interesting reflection of the other car in directional light. Im not sure if it was intentiaonl. it is centered very nicely though, so probably.are you implying that the Bug is the rreflection of an economy car? Very nice symitry and use of the camera flash', '2002-05-10 03:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57459, 1401, 131, '<td valign="top">The sky ruins the picture.  you need blue skies with moving clouds.</td>', 'The sky ruins the picture.  you need blue skies with moving clouds.', '2002-05-10 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
