(57513, 1403, 509, '<td valign="top">Ha, very cute.  I think that the effect might be better achieved following some marketing techniques of "Super-soakers" - maybe actually have the gun in the water, if possible, light the image from the bottom so that the water has some light shining through.  This would be difficult probably, but may also look cool.  Nice job!</td>', 'Ha, very cute.  I think that the effect might be better achieved following some marketing techniques of "Super-soakers" - maybe actually have the gun in the water, if possible, light the image from the bottom so that the water has some light shining through.  This would be difficult probably, but may also look cool.  Nice job!', '2002-05-06 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
