(57555, 1404, 875, '<td valign="top">Frosting the bottle is a nice touch.  I think I''d be nice to have a little more light on the bottle and a little less on the flowers.  The background at the upper left and the table edge at the lower left are a little distracting.  The note is cute!</td>', 'Frosting the bottle is a nice touch.  I think I''d be nice to have a little more light on the bottle and a little less on the flowers.  The background at the upper left and the table edge at the lower left are a little distracting.  The note is cute!', '2002-05-09 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
