(57559, 1404, 811, '<td valign="top">nice composition--i really like the colors that the flowers add.  The note is a nice touch</td>', 'nice composition--i really like the colors that the flowers add.  The note is a nice touch', '2002-05-09 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57560, 1404, 1510, '<td valign="top">its not wine...  flowers look too fake and i don''t have emotional attachment to this product. a dry bottle would have worked better and not get water on your note distracting.</td>', 'its not wine...  flowers look too fake and i don''t have emotional attachment to this product. a dry bottle would have worked better and not get water on your note distracting.', '2002-05-09 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57561, 1404, 543, '<td valign="top">You did a lot right here.  The lighting on the bottle is very slick and professional, and the note and flowers add story to the image.  Using a cold bottle for condensation was good thinking, too.  On the downside, the flowers go from underlit at the bottom to overexposed at the top, the whole needs some CW rotation, and the idea of screwcap malt liquor as an anniversary present probably won''t fly with the missus.  Kind of wonder about the two torn and one cut edges on the note, as well.  Tough call.  What''s good is very good, but there are elements that detract in a big (to me) way.</td>', 'You did a lot right here.  The lighting on the bottle is very slick and professional, and the note and flowers add story to the image.  Using a cold bottle for condensation was good thinking, too.  On the downside, the flowers go from underlit at the bottom to overexposed at the top, the whole needs some CW rotation, and the idea of screwcap malt liquor as an anniversary present probably won''t fly with the missus.  Kind of wonder about the two torn and one cut edges on the note, as well.  Tough call.  What''s good is very good, but there are elements that detract in a big (to me) way.', '2002-05-10 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57562, 1404, 889, '<td valign="top">The slight tip to the left is destracting<br/>We are allowed to rotate in photoshop, and you can do partial degrees this is like a 1 or 1.5 clockwise and it woud be execelent..</td>', 'The slight tip to the left is destractingWe are allowed to rotate in photoshop, and you can do partial degrees this is like a 1 or 1.5 clockwise and it woud be execelent..', '2002-05-10 02:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57563, 1404, 1191, '<td valign="top">Great image that works well</td>', 'Great image that works well', '2002-05-10 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
