(57587, 1406, 878, '<td valign="top">Hot damn nice loooooking girly.  You needed to tell the fat ass in the background to get out of the shot or gotten closer to the subject, actaully I wouldnt mind getting closer to the subject.  Of course this would mean the item dead center in the shot would have to be something else.</td>', 'Hot damn nice loooooking girly.  You needed to tell the fat ass in the background to get out of the shot or gotten closer to the subject, actaully I wouldnt mind getting closer to the subject.  Of course this would mean the item dead center in the shot would have to be something else.', '2002-05-06 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
