(57592, 1406, 1485, '<td valign="top">funny idea.. and she is definitely hot (did you get her number??)  but I''m sorry.. the mere booby factor doesn''t make this an ad...  even tho Hooters is not REALLY about the food..</td>', 'funny idea.. and she is definitely hot (did you get her number??)  but I''m sorry.. the mere booby factor doesn''t make this an ad...  even tho Hooters is not REALLY about the food..', '2002-05-07 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
