(57595, 1406, 344, '<td valign="top">Nice tits..!</td>', 'Nice tits..!', '2002-05-07 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57596, 1406, 446, '<td valign="top">This is almost cheating :&amp;gt;).  Great idea.  A pretty girl never hurts in advertising.  The shot would have been even more effective if taken in front of a more appealing background in the restaurant.  I rate this photo high.  Good job.</td>', 'This is almost cheating :&gt;).  Great idea.  A pretty girl never hurts in advertising.  The shot would have been even more effective if taken in front of a more appealing background in the restaurant.  I rate this photo high.  Good job.', '2002-05-07 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57597, 1406, 430, '<td valign="top">although this seems like a snapshot rather than a planned photo, the subject warrants a high score!</td>', 'although this seems like a snapshot rather than a planned photo, the subject warrants a high score!', '2002-05-07 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57598, 1406, 1054, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a tighter crop on the merchandise (and the shirts, too) would have been better here.</td>', 'Perhaps a tighter crop on the merchandise (and the shirts, too) would have been better here.', '2002-05-07 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57599, 1406, 1233, '<td valign="top">Very appealling ... I suppose.</td>', 'Very appealling ... I suppose.', '2002-05-07 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57600, 1406, 748, '<td valign="top">A neat idea.  Even though my eyes are drawn to the center of the shot, I can''t help but notice the flourescence of the guy''s tennis shoes! (Or should I have said that the other way around?!?).  Good work!</td>', 'A neat idea.  Even though my eyes are drawn to the center of the shot, I can''t help but notice the flourescence of the guy''s tennis shoes! (Or should I have said that the other way around?!?).  Good work!', '2002-05-07 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57601, 1406, 656, '<td valign="top">how we suffer for our art.    Good exposure!  - like how you''ve got the whole ''hooters'' name on the tiles too, otherwise I think I''d prefer to be closer...</td>', 'how we suffer for our art.    Good exposure!  - like how you''ve got the whole ''hooters'' name on the tiles too, otherwise I think I''d prefer to be closer...', '2002-05-08 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57602, 1406, 301, '<td valign="top">the lighting you''ve used for this is nice and even.  I would have liked this better if you had cropped the image to get rid of the guys in the background, and maybe opened up one of the t-shirts that had a big hooters sign on it at the front of the display</td>', 'the lighting you''ve used for this is nice and even.  I would have liked this better if you had cropped the image to get rid of the guys in the background, and maybe opened up one of the t-shirts that had a big hooters sign on it at the front of the display', '2002-05-08 05:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57603, 1406, 472, '<td valign="top">yum. I like you (the hooter girl). you obviously have a winning personality and a great pair .. of eyes that is.  oh the big guy on the left kind of takes away. . .   here''s what I would have done, if possible. convinced hooter girl to come and stand in her hooter garb in front of some white paper or a sheet, because the bg is too busy.</td>', 'yum. I like you (the hooter girl). you obviously have a winning personality and a great pair .. of eyes that is.  oh the big guy on the left kind of takes away. . .   here''s what I would have done, if possible. convinced hooter girl to come and stand in her hooter garb in front of some white paper or a sheet, because the bg is too busy.', '2002-05-08 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57604, 1406, 1410, '<td valign="top">What is she selling</td>', 'What is she selling', '2002-05-08 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57605, 1406, 1078, '<td valign="top">I think I would have gone for a vertical to crop out the guys at the bar on the left and the cook on the right.  As I look at the products on the table, I can only tell that three of them are Hooters gear -- maybe a little more arrangement of the products to show them off a bit more</td>', 'I think I would have gone for a vertical to crop out the guys at the bar on the left and the cook on the right.  As I look at the products on the table, I can only tell that three of them are Hooters gear -- maybe a little more arrangement of the products to show them off a bit more', '2002-05-08 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57606, 1406, 527, '<td valign="top">It would have been better if you would have zoomed in more to eliminate the distracting backgound.</td>', 'It would have been better if you would have zoomed in more to eliminate the distracting backgound.', '2002-05-08 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57607, 1406, 813, '<td valign="top">oh how much this could be improved by cropping out the fat guy in the background, perhaps a strong vertical right around the girl</td>', 'oh how much this could be improved by cropping out the fat guy in the background, perhaps a strong vertical right around the girl', '2002-05-08 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
