(57609, 1406, 142, '<td valign="top">This would be much more effective if you cropped out the two guys at the bar.  I know they probably don''t distract the men any but they do me.</td>', 'This would be much more effective if you cropped out the two guys at the bar.  I know they probably don''t distract the men any but they do me.', '2002-05-09 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
