(57636, 1407, 543, '<td valign="top">If you''d found a patch of open shade you could have avoided the overexposure on the head of the driver and cover logo, and the colors might have snapped a little better.  The patch of grass you chose doesn''t look too well tended, and the white glare at R of the bg and dark area at L (interferes with the shaft) are unfortunate.  It''s a good composition, but would have benefited from a bit more care in the execution.</td>', 'If you''d found a patch of open shade you could have avoided the overexposure on the head of the driver and cover logo, and the colors might have snapped a little better.  The patch of grass you chose doesn''t look too well tended, and the white glare at R of the bg and dark area at L (interferes with the shaft) are unfortunate.  It''s a good composition, but would have benefited from a bit more care in the execution.', '2002-05-10 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57637, 1407, 554, '<td valign="top">very good---I would have tried to light the top of club head more to better enhance the size</td>', 'very good---I would have tried to light the top of club head more to better enhance the size', '2002-05-10 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
