(57639, 1407, 835, '<td valign="top">Product shows off well but the background needs improvement.  Greener grass, minus the leaves, better focus in the background or have it arranged in such a manner so it''s less obvious(more sky).  Overall, I like it.</td>', 'Product shows off well but the background needs improvement.  Greener grass, minus the leaves, better focus in the background or have it arranged in such a manner so it''s less obvious(more sky).  Overall, I like it.', '2002-05-11 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
