(57678, 1408, 1584, '<td valign="top">Feel the tension!! Very cool.</td>', 'Feel the tension!! Very cool.', '2002-05-13 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57679, 1408, 1707, '<td valign="top">Love the photograph (Exceptional creativity!), but I also have to agree it''s too blurry.  Hint: For action, try your best to focus on the EYES of animals. You''ll have a better chance the camera will focus correctly.  It seems your camera focused on the tags instead.</td>', 'Love the photograph (Exceptional creativity!), but I also have to agree it''s too blurry.  Hint: For action, try your best to focus on the EYES of animals. You''ll have a better chance the camera will focus correctly.  It seems your camera focused on the tags instead.', '2002-05-19 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
