(57686, 1409, 862, '<td valign="top">Use fill flash to eliminate shadows on the subject.</td>', 'Use fill flash to eliminate shadows on the subject.', '2002-05-06 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57687, 1409, 1, '<td valign="top">Poorly lit -- you should have had her turn to the right so that the sun was more-so on her.  The Pepsi itself is too small to really portray your meaning.  This seems like a snapshot.</td>', 'Poorly lit -- you should have had her turn to the right so that the sun was more-so on her.  The Pepsi itself is too small to really portray your meaning.  This seems like a snapshot.', '2002-05-06 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57688, 1409, 715, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the picture is focused enough on the bottle of Pepsi to make it an advertisement.</td>', 'I don''t think the picture is focused enough on the bottle of Pepsi to make it an advertisement.', '2002-05-06 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57689, 1409, 327, '<td valign="top">Humm, we read her tshirt and can''t see the bottle clearly.<br/>Shot is somewhat dark, her pretty face is hidden. Top needs some crop.<br/></td>', 'Humm, we read her tshirt and can''t see the bottle clearly.Shot is somewhat dark, her pretty face is hidden. Top needs some crop.', '2002-05-06 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57690, 1409, 156, '<td valign="top">for me, there''s no appeal, the pepsi looks warm on a hot summer day ...but if she was sitting on the rocks or the rise and facing the sun without those awful shadows on her face (and wearing sunglasses) with a cool breeze blowing thru her hair, thoroughly enjoying her solitary moment with the pepsi...that would be different, because i''d wish it was me!</td>', 'for me, there''s no appeal, the pepsi looks warm on a hot summer day ...but if she was sitting on the rocks or the rise and facing the sun without those awful shadows on her face (and wearing sunglasses) with a cool breeze blowing thru her hair, thoroughly enjoying her solitary moment with the pepsi...that would be different, because i''d wish it was me!', '2002-05-06 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57691, 1409, 1005, '<td valign="top">Almost great!  Is this an advertisement for EPSI?  Good thing the logo is recognizable!  Also, turn your subject 20 degrees into the sun.  Let''s see her whole face.<br/>Photo 9 Advert 8 Creativity 7 total 8</td>', 'Almost great!  Is this an advertisement for EPSI?  Good thing the logo is recognizable!  Also, turn your subject 20 degrees into the sun.  Let''s see her whole face.Photo 9 Advert 8 Creativity 7 total 8', '2002-05-06 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57692, 1409, 1485, '<td valign="top">this looks like someone''s vacation shot.. sorta dull.</td>', 'this looks like someone''s vacation shot.. sorta dull.', '2002-05-06 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57693, 1409, 259, '<td valign="top">too much like a snapshot</td>', 'too much like a snapshot', '2002-05-06 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57694, 1409, 813, '<td valign="top">It would be better if she was either seen drinking it or at least happy to be holding it. Photographically, the shot is well composed but the strong shadows detract for me. Would a fill flash have been possible?</td>', 'It would be better if she was either seen drinking it or at least happy to be holding it. Photographically, the shot is well composed but the strong shadows detract for me. Would a fill flash have been possible?', '2002-05-06 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57695, 1409, 878, '<td valign="top">In most cases a gorgeous woman can sell anything however, this photo lacks focus on the product.  Using the flash may of brighten up the harsh shdows on her face.  The background is a bit distracting. I guess the shooting was going a bit hard it looks like some of the pop was drank as well :)</td>', 'In most cases a gorgeous woman can sell anything however, this photo lacks focus on the product.  Using the flash may of brighten up the harsh shdows on her face.  The background is a bit distracting. I guess the shooting was going a bit hard it looks like some of the pop was drank as well :)', '2002-05-06 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
