(57701, 1409, 428, '<td valign="top">The only problem I can see with this is that the girls face is too shaded. Even though you are outside, if you have a fill flash on your camera try that.</td>', 'The only problem I can see with this is that the girls face is too shaded. Even though you are outside, if you have a fill flash on your camera try that.', '2002-05-06 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57702, 1409, 1336, '<td valign="top">i think your product should have had a larger role in this photo.  the bottle should have at least been turned so it doesnt look like "epsi"</td>', 'i think your product should have had a larger role in this photo.  the bottle should have at least been turned so it doesnt look like "epsi"', '2002-05-06 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57703, 1409, 1344, '<td valign="top">Looks like she prefers Coke..</td>', 'Looks like she prefers Coke..', '2002-05-07 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57704, 1409, 301, '<td valign="top">You probably don''t need all of the background in this photo.  Cropping would have helped.  Also ... get in closer to your subject and watch out for shadows cast by the sun.</td>', 'You probably don''t need all of the background in this photo.  Cropping would have helped.  Also ... get in closer to your subject and watch out for shadows cast by the sun.', '2002-05-07 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
