(57707, 1409, 651, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea but it is a bit dark on the left side.. I think a Lightdisc would have helped..</td>', 'This is a great idea but it is a bit dark on the left side.. I think a Lightdisc would have helped..', '2002-05-07 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57708, 1409, 1054, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop and a fill flash would have helped this photo immensely.  This really should be portrait-mode, and with more light on the Pepsi.</td>', 'A tighter crop and a fill flash would have helped this photo immensely.  This really should be portrait-mode, and with more light on the Pepsi.', '2002-05-07 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57709, 1409, 441, '<td valign="top">get in closer and use  your to flashto fill those shadows - brighter more colourful background would help - and portrait rather than landsape</td>', 'get in closer and use  your to flashto fill those shadows - brighter more colourful background would help - and portrait rather than landsape', '2002-05-07 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57710, 1409, 656, '<td valign="top">lighting doesn''t help her much, too much from her left, almost a ''hatchet'' lighting, which doesn''t flatter.  Maybe a vertical framing would work better too ?</td>', 'lighting doesn''t help her much, too much from her left, almost a ''hatchet'' lighting, which doesn''t flatter.  Maybe a vertical framing would work better too ?', '2002-05-08 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57711, 1409, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think if you''re going to have a cute girl in an advertising photo, her face shouldn''t be almost completely in shadow. Also, the pepsi bottle isn''t as prominant as the logo on her shirt, which is confusing. The setting is interesting for a photo, but not enticing for an advertising shot.<br/><br/>Lastly, can I have a cute boy bring me my pepsi, please? :) Actually, I guess the rationale behind using girls in most advertising is because the males in the audience want her, and the girls in the audience want to be her, so it''s win-win.... somehow.</td>', 'I think if you''re going to have a cute girl in an advertising photo, her face shouldn''t be almost completely in shadow. Also, the pepsi bottle isn''t as prominant as the logo on her shirt, which is confusing. The setting is interesting for a photo, but not enticing for an advertising shot.Lastly, can I have a cute boy bring me my pepsi, please? :) Actually, I guess the rationale behind using girls in most advertising is because the males in the audience want her, and the girls in the audience want to be her, so it''s win-win.... somehow.', '2002-05-08 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57712, 1409, 1078, '<td valign="top">For a product ad, like this, I think you might want to try to make sure that all the product''s name is in the shot.  Also, the bottle of Pepsi is really small in the shot -- a tighter crop on the girl could help that some.  While the lighting is great for the rocks behind her, it really shadows the right side of her face.  It''s kind of typical, but I think I would have had her drinking from the bottle, faced a little more toward the sun, and zoomed in a bit.  That way you could still have the nice background, but with a little more on the proudct placement.</td>', 'For a product ad, like this, I think you might want to try to make sure that all the product''s name is in the shot.  Also, the bottle of Pepsi is really small in the shot -- a tighter crop on the girl could help that some.  While the lighting is great for the rocks behind her, it really shadows the right side of her face.  It''s kind of typical, but I think I would have had her drinking from the bottle, faced a little more toward the sun, and zoomed in a bit.  That way you could still have the nice background, but with a little more on the proudct placement.', '2002-05-08 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57713, 1409, 527, '<td valign="top">The backgound blends too much with the girl so she doesn''t stand out. Maybe if she was wearing a red or yellow shirt without lettering. You also need some better lighting, too many dark shadows. And perhaps if she was looking down at the Pepsi bottle like she was really interested in it instead of you.</td>', 'The backgound blends too much with the girl so she doesn''t stand out. Maybe if she was wearing a red or yellow shirt without lettering. You also need some better lighting, too many dark shadows. And perhaps if she was looking down at the Pepsi bottle like she was really interested in it instead of you.', '2002-05-08 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57714, 1409, 554, '<td valign="top">should be able to read PEPSI</td>', 'should be able to read PEPSI', '2002-05-08 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57715, 1409, 1164, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl, what''s her name?</td>', 'Pretty girl, what''s her name?', '2002-05-09 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57716, 1409, 843, '<td valign="top">Her or the drink? Um...kidding of course. Good attempt, left side is a bit too dark. Maybe you could have taken it from a lower angle to get more sky and less rock.</td>', 'Her or the drink? Um...kidding of course. Good attempt, left side is a bit too dark. Maybe you could have taken it from a lower angle to get more sky and less rock.', '2002-05-09 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57717, 1409, 811, '<td valign="top">the colors are kinda flat and it makes it difficult to get the details.  Also, all the greens and grays say cool early spring day instead of warm summer day.</td>', 'the colors are kinda flat and it makes it difficult to get the details.  Also, all the greens and grays say cool early spring day instead of warm summer day.', '2002-05-09 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57718, 1409, 1191, '<td valign="top">Too much background, a tighter crop would have worked?</td>', 'Too much background, a tighter crop would have worked?', '2002-05-10 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57719, 1409, 714, '<td valign="top">I feel like you are trying to advertise her and not pepsi,  Maybe if you had her drinking it and take the picture closer up and from the side.  Just a thought</td>', 'I feel like you are trying to advertise her and not pepsi,  Maybe if you had her drinking it and take the picture closer up and from the side.  Just a thought', '2002-05-10 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57720, 1409, 543, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl and a nice setting.  The hard side lighting would be improved with some fill, or a reflector, or turning the whole scene so the subjects faced in to the sun.  I''d have asked her to hold the bottle with more of the logo on the label showing, as well, and maybe used a bottle with more Pepsi inside.  Do they really have green labels, or is that a WB issue (I live at the edge of the earth)?</td>', 'Pretty girl and a nice setting.  The hard side lighting would be improved with some fill, or a reflector, or turning the whole scene so the subjects faced in to the sun.  I''d have asked her to hold the bottle with more of the logo on the label showing, as well, and maybe used a bottle with more Pepsi inside.  Do they really have green labels, or is that a WB issue (I live at the edge of the earth)?', '2002-05-11 05:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57721, 1409, 113, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a pretty good photo.  1.  She is not looking very enthused or looking at the camera and 2.  All I can see is the psi on the bottle.  Maybe turning her more towards the sun?</td>', 'I think this could have been a pretty good photo.  1.  She is not looking very enthused or looking at the camera and 2.  All I can see is the psi on the bottle.  Maybe turning her more towards the sun?', '2002-05-11 06:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57722, 1409, 142, '<td valign="top">You need more focus on the product.  Perhaps if you had a closeup of the woman drinking the Pepsi, you would project more attention on the product.  The photo is in a nice setting.</td>', 'You need more focus on the product.  Perhaps if you had a closeup of the woman drinking the Pepsi, you would project more attention on the product.  The photo is in a nice setting.', '2002-05-11 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57723, 1409, 835, '<td valign="top">too many shadows on the girl and the Pepsi bottle is not prominently displayed(the ''P'' in Pepsi is not even in view).</td>', 'too many shadows on the girl and the Pepsi bottle is not prominently displayed(the ''P'' in Pepsi is not even in view).', '2002-05-11 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57724, 1409, 1031, '<td valign="top">What, no navel?</td>', 'What, no navel?', '2002-05-12 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57725, 1409, 544, '<td valign="top">Cute model :) but the picture lacks focus. If the target of the picture is the pepsi bottle, then it might have been nice to have at least made sure the bottle was well-lit and facing front. The whole left-side of the model is in shadow, and I think it would have been better served (the picture) to have her turn, or take the picture at a different time of day, or bring your own lights, so that this wasn''t the case. A much-tighter zoom would have been good, too. This might be nitpicky (even more than the rest of this) but her outfit is itself an ad that only distracts. In other words, you have 4 separate focal points (the bottle, the girl, the clothes, and the background), and toning that down a bit would have served this photo well. Still, I gave it a higher score, if only for the overall effort, and having a live model :)</td>', 'Cute model :) but the picture lacks focus. If the target of the picture is the pepsi bottle, then it might have been nice to have at least made sure the bottle was well-lit and facing front. The whole left-side of the model is in shadow, and I think it would have been better served (the picture) to have her turn, or take the picture at a different time of day, or bring your own lights, so that this wasn''t the case. A much-tighter zoom would have been good, too. This might be nitpicky (even more than the rest of this) but her outfit is itself an ad that only distracts. In other words, you have 4 separate focal points (the bottle, the girl, the clothes, and the background), and toning that down a bit would have served this photo well. Still, I gave it a higher score, if only for the overall effort, and having a live model :)', '2002-05-12 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57726, 1409, 587, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see her whole face and just better lighting all over. and what is this ad for?</td>', 'I would have liked to see her whole face and just better lighting all over. and what is this ad for?', '2002-05-12 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57727, 1409, 689, '<td valign="top">Not sure what is being advertised here ....</td>', 'Not sure what is being advertised here ....', '2002-05-12 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
