(57741, 1410, 1041, '<td valign="top">Good photo, those letters realy do stand out against the rest of the photo (the HT is almost too white though).  I would''ve expected something different than a shot of an advertisement for this challenge.</td>', 'Good photo, those letters realy do stand out against the rest of the photo (the HT is almost too white though).  I would''ve expected something different than a shot of an advertisement for this challenge.', '2002-05-07 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57742, 1410, 656, '<td valign="top">amazing contrast in the light - how did you get that ?</td>', 'amazing contrast in the light - how did you get that ?', '2002-05-08 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57743, 1410, 1523, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph. I''d listen.</td>', 'Wonderful photograph. I''d listen.', '2002-05-08 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57744, 1410, 107, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  The radio station logo stands out really well, but the rest of the image is slightly dark...but at the same time, it brings out the logo very well..</td>', 'I like this picture.  The radio station logo stands out really well, but the rest of the image is slightly dark...but at the same time, it brings out the logo very well..', '2002-05-09 06:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57745, 1410, 675, '<td valign="top">kinda cool how it''s obviously dark outside, but those letters are so damn bright i''m being blinded</td>', 'kinda cool how it''s obviously dark outside, but those letters are so damn bright i''m being blinded', '2002-05-09 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57746, 1410, 142, '<td valign="top">Good photo except it needs a little more lighing.</td>', 'Good photo except it needs a little more lighing.', '2002-05-09 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57747, 1410, 1510, '<td valign="top">Not sure that you created this from your imagination but it lacks interest.  I am not drawn to it but I would rather not listen this station based upon this picture.  You did use good use of lighting to make it scale dak to light. That I do like</td>', 'Not sure that you created this from your imagination but it lacks interest.  I am not drawn to it but I would rather not listen this station based upon this picture.  You did use good use of lighting to make it scale dak to light. That I do like', '2002-05-09 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57748, 1410, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The angle is nice and the darkness serves this pic well</td>', 'Nice shot.  The angle is nice and the darkness serves this pic well', '2002-05-09 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57749, 1410, 543, '<td valign="top">The way the flash worked on the lettering is interesting, a little, and there''s a bit of sunrise or sunset reflected in the window (albeit with utility lines and poles).  Don''t see much else to recommend this, though.</td>', 'The way the flash worked on the lettering is interesting, a little, and there''s a bit of sunrise or sunset reflected in the window (albeit with utility lines and poles).  Don''t see much else to recommend this, though.', '2002-05-10 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57750, 1410, 878, '<td valign="top">Not sure if a flash was used on this one but it lookts a bit over saturated / expeposed at the tail end of the letters.  The concept of advertisement is there.</td>', 'Not sure if a flash was used on this one but it lookts a bit over saturated / expeposed at the tail end of the letters.  The concept of advertisement is there.', '2002-05-10 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57751, 1410, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing secondary content in the reflections.</td>', 'Nice job capturing secondary content in the reflections.', '2002-05-10 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57752, 1410, 554, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2002-05-11 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57753, 1410, 835, '<td valign="top">I really like how the "94.9 ZHT" pops off the vehiclee but I think it came at too much an expense to the rest of the writing.  The "Proud...." just gets lost in the darkness.  Could you have moved the vehicle to get better lighting?  I like the reflection of trees and sky in the windows but not the power lines.</td>', 'I really like how the "94.9 ZHT" pops off the vehiclee but I think it came at too much an expense to the rest of the writing.  The "Proud...." just gets lost in the darkness.  Could you have moved the vehicle to get better lighting?  I like the reflection of trees and sky in the windows but not the power lines.', '2002-05-11 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57754, 1410, 587, '<td valign="top">would have liked to see this with better lighting</td>', 'would have liked to see this with better lighting', '2002-05-12 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57755, 1410, 637, '<td valign="top">Clever idea... would like a daylight shot or a full night shot.</td>', 'Clever idea... would like a daylight shot or a full night shot.', '2002-05-12 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57756, 1411, 142, '<td valign="top">This is cute.</td>', 'This is cute.', '2002-05-06 06:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57757, 1411, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute, love cats!  Does she like Spaghetti Os?  Photo 9 Advert 7 total 8</td>', 'Cute, love cats!  Does she like Spaghetti Os?  Photo 9 Advert 7 total 8', '2002-05-06 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57758, 1411, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty kitty, clean, sharp shot.<br/>Could of cropped the bottom and we miss seeing the cats face.</td>', 'Pretty kitty, clean, sharp shot.Could of cropped the bottom and we miss seeing the cats face.', '2002-05-06 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57759, 1411, 715, '<td valign="top">Very funny picture and well executed, but I think it would have been more suitable as advertisment if it was a can of catfood.</td>', 'Very funny picture and well executed, but I think it would have been more suitable as advertisment if it was a can of catfood.', '2002-05-06 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57760, 1411, 1485, '<td valign="top">cute concept.. but a little bland.  colors are crisp.  One of the most exciting elements is the wall color.  this might have done well in sepia / B&amp;W too.</td>', 'cute concept.. but a little bland.  colors are crisp.  One of the most exciting elements is the wall color.  this might have done well in sepia / B&W too.', '2002-05-06 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57761, 1411, 259, '<td valign="top">uh-oh there goes your score</td>', 'uh-oh there goes your score', '2002-05-06 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57762, 1411, 772, '<td valign="top">This stuff is almost as cheap as cat food!  I''m not sure that watchin a cat sniff at this can is perking my interest to purchase this product.</td>', 'This stuff is almost as cheap as cat food!  I''m not sure that watchin a cat sniff at this can is perking my interest to purchase this product.', '2002-05-06 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57763, 1411, 878, '<td valign="top">a bit dark on the cats face but a good concept</td>', 'a bit dark on the cats face but a good concept', '2002-05-06 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57764, 1411, 459, '<td valign="top">Great set up.  I like the narrow depth of field so the floor doesn''t get in the way, but the specs are distracting.  I like the product positioning and the fact that the green in the label matches the bacground.  I wish we could see the cat''s eyes.</td>', 'Great set up.  I like the narrow depth of field so the floor doesn''t get in the way, but the specs are distracting.  I like the product positioning and the fact that the green in the label matches the bacground.  I wish we could see the cat''s eyes.', '2002-05-06 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57765, 1411, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s cute and nicely composed. The colours of the bakcground and the floor seem a bit dull to me, and the reflections on the floor are distracting.</td>', 'It''s cute and nicely composed. The colours of the bakcground and the floor seem a bit dull to me, and the reflections on the floor are distracting.', '2002-05-07 05:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57766, 1411, 1054, '<td valign="top">Cute, but I''m not sure this would compel me to by SpaghettiO''s.</td>', 'Cute, but I''m not sure this would compel me to by SpaghettiO''s.', '2002-05-07 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57767, 1411, 661, '<td valign="top">Gotta love cats.</td>', 'Gotta love cats.', '2002-05-07 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57768, 1411, 813, '<td valign="top">Spaghetti-O''s, Cats Love It!!  nice photo concept and well photographed, i love the simplicity of the composition, bravo!</td>', 'Spaghetti-O''s, Cats Love It!!  nice photo concept and well photographed, i love the simplicity of the composition, bravo!', '2002-05-07 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57769, 1411, 215, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been even nicer if she got her nose in the can... Hehe...</td>', 'Would''ve been even nicer if she got her nose in the can... Hehe...', '2002-05-07 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57770, 1411, 671, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture.  Better if it had been a cat food can.  But I like it.  Nice placement, good focus.</td>', 'Really nice picture.  Better if it had been a cat food can.  But I like it.  Nice placement, good focus.', '2002-05-07 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57771, 1411, 527, '<td valign="top">It''s funny but it doesn''t really make me want to buy Spaghettios. Maybe it should have been a can of cat food instead.</td>', 'It''s funny but it doesn''t really make me want to buy Spaghettios. Maybe it should have been a can of cat food instead.', '2002-05-08 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57772, 1411, 811, '<td valign="top">Uh-Oh Spaghettios!  How long since I''ve heard that one:-)  The only thing that bothers me is the background.  It reflects onto the table and almost glows.  Obviously, you can''t paint the wall everytime you want to take a picture, but could you have shot the pic from a different angle?</td>', 'Uh-Oh Spaghettios!  How long since I''ve heard that one:-)  The only thing that bothers me is the background.  It reflects onto the table and almost glows.  Obviously, you can''t paint the wall everytime you want to take a picture, but could you have shot the pic from a different angle?', '2002-05-09 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57773, 1411, 675, '<td valign="top">uh oh, your concept is weird</td>', 'uh oh, your concept is weird', '2002-05-09 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57774, 1411, 1510, '<td valign="top">cute!  picture is nice however more focus on the product may make it the most important part.</td>', 'cute!  picture is nice however more focus on the product may make it the most important part.', '2002-05-09 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57775, 1411, 1191, '<td valign="top">Is the cat for sale also??</td>', 'Is the cat for sale also??', '2002-05-10 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57776, 1411, 554, '<td valign="top">I like the lack of background here</td>', 'I like the lack of background here', '2002-05-10 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57777, 1411, 1031, '<td valign="top">Is that nice cat for sale too?</td>', 'Is that nice cat for sale too?', '2002-05-11 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57778, 1411, 1580, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Cats are always good.  I don''t particularly like the background color, nor the fact that the table is a bit on the dull side and kind of dirty or maybe scratched.  Also, it might be a little blurry or need a little more contrast, but that could easily be that cat''s fluffy fur playing tricks on me.  I might have zoomed and centered the product a little more as well, but I do like the idea a lot though.  I seem to be picking a lot of things apart in this challenge, but I think they are things that would be different if it were a real, professional advertisement for a product.</td>', 'Cute.  Cats are always good.  I don''t particularly like the background color, nor the fact that the table is a bit on the dull side and kind of dirty or maybe scratched.  Also, it might be a little blurry or need a little more contrast, but that could easily be that cat''s fluffy fur playing tricks on me.  I might have zoomed and centered the product a little more as well, but I do like the idea a lot though.  I seem to be picking a lot of things apart in this challenge, but I think they are things that would be different if it were a real, professional advertisement for a product.', '2002-05-12 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57779, 1411, 1202, '<td valign="top">If it were cat food it would be great, but the pic doesn''t sell the Spaghettios for me.</td>', 'If it were cat food it would be great, but the pic doesn''t sell the Spaghettios for me.', '2002-05-12 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57780, 1411, 587, '<td valign="top">Franco-American would be pleased to know that even though the kids won''t eat it, the cat loves it! :) This is cute.</td>', 'Franco-American would be pleased to know that even though the kids won''t eat it, the cat loves it! :) This is cute.', '2002-05-12 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57781, 1411, 1, '<td valign="top">Not sure that the cat helps sell the spaghettio''s very well.  He/she seems out of place.</td>', 'Not sure that the cat helps sell the spaghettio''s very well.  He/she seems out of place.', '2002-05-12 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57782, 1411, 637, '<td valign="top">I never met a cat who liked spaghetti, much less spaghettios.  Nevertheless, a cute idea, well done.</td>', 'I never met a cat who liked spaghetti, much less spaghettios.  Nevertheless, a cute idea, well done.', '2002-05-12 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57783, 1411, 139, '<td valign="top">It would have been a better ad with cat food, but great shot anyway.</td>', 'It would have been a better ad with cat food, but great shot anyway.', '2002-05-12 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57784, 1411, 689, '<td valign="top">New cat food? I am not sure Franco-American would like it ... but I do!</td>', 'New cat food? I am not sure Franco-American would like it ... but I do!', '2002-05-13 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57785, 1415, 1175, '<td valign="top">Good image.  I like the lighting but I would have switched the candle and the package of cookies so that the packakage has more direct light and therefore is more readable.  With the current setup its difficult to read the package.</td>', 'Good image.  I like the lighting but I would have switched the candle and the package of cookies so that the packakage has more direct light and therefore is more readable.  With the current setup its difficult to read the package.', '2002-05-06 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57786, 1415, 1344, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done -- Would have liked a little more lighting on the actual packaging though.  And more light from the candle -- longer exposure?</td>', 'Very nicely done -- Would have liked a little more lighting on the actual packaging though.  And more light from the candle -- longer exposure?', '2002-05-06 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57787, 1415, 536, '<td valign="top">I take great pride in baking my own cookies but you sold me!  I''m not sure if the candle is needed in this story. imo the lighting show be increased.  Maybe just a little soft light on the left side? Great photo. I want a cookie.</td>', 'I take great pride in baking my own cookies but you sold me!  I''m not sure if the candle is needed in this story. imo the lighting show be increased.  Maybe just a little soft light on the left side? Great photo. I want a cookie.', '2002-05-06 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57788, 1415, 862, '<td valign="top">Nice, but needs more light on the bag and cookies.</td>', 'Nice, but needs more light on the bag and cookies.', '2002-05-06 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57789, 1415, 1024, '<td valign="top">Somehow I do not associate cookies with elegance.  A different subject would have worked better in the photo.</td>', 'Somehow I do not associate cookies with elegance.  A different subject would have worked better in the photo.', '2002-05-06 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57790, 1415, 1, '<td valign="top">The darkness fits the mood, but the light flooding in from the right is a little awkard.  I think a dimly lit overhead light would''ve worked out better.</td>', 'The darkness fits the mood, but the light flooding in from the right is a little awkard.  I think a dimly lit overhead light would''ve worked out better.', '2002-05-06 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57791, 1415, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition.  It has a nice touch of confections and romance all rolled into one.  I think an additional glass of milk would have really topped off this already excellent photo...</td>', 'I really like this composition.  It has a nice touch of confections and romance all rolled into one.  I think an additional glass of milk would have really topped off this already excellent photo...', '2002-05-06 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(57792, 1415, 1325, '<td valign="top">The rose and candy represent the love that the cookies were baked with.  The candle does not shed quite enough light on the brand name of product but I think this is good.</td>', 'The rose and candy represent the love that the cookies were baked with.  The candle does not shed quite enough light on the brand name of product but I think this is good.', '2002-05-06 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57793, 1415, 327, '<td valign="top">Set up but is too dark and too much going on. It''s busy. What are you selling? Roses, romance, cookies, mix? Sorry I just think it''s ''over'' done.</td>', 'Set up but is too dark and too much going on. It''s busy. What are you selling? Roses, romance, cookies, mix? Sorry I just think it''s ''over'' done.', '2002-05-06 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57794, 1415, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, good advert (but you need more light on the cookie bag).  Photo 9 Advert 9 Creativity 8 total 9</td>', 'Nice photo, good advert (but you need more light on the cookie bag).  Photo 9 Advert 9 Creativity 8 total 9', '2002-05-06 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57795, 1415, 156, '<td valign="top">EXcellent clarity!! the shadows appear too deep tho...perhaps a mirror used (off camera) on the left to reflect some of the light on the right...</td>', 'EXcellent clarity!! the shadows appear too deep tho...perhaps a mirror used (off camera) on the left to reflect some of the light on the right...', '2002-05-06 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57796, 1415, 1485, '<td valign="top">cool idea.. needs better lighting</td>', 'cool idea.. needs better lighting', '2002-05-06 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57797, 1415, 259, '<td valign="top">way too dark, the effect of the lighting is too extreme</td>', 'way too dark, the effect of the lighting is too extreme', '2002-05-06 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57798, 1415, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement of the product and other items.  Needed one more soft light on the left side to give it a pro shoot look.</td>', 'Nice arrangement of the product and other items.  Needed one more soft light on the left side to give it a pro shoot look.', '2002-05-06 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57799, 1415, 1226, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The lighting is a bit off for my taste however. not enough detail on the package face. Enhacing the light from the left ot give the candle a warmer glow to cover the scene would have been nice to me. Very well done though.</td>', 'Very nice. The lighting is a bit off for my taste however. not enough detail on the package face. Enhacing the light from the left ot give the candle a warmer glow to cover the scene would have been nice to me. Very well done though.', '2002-05-06 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57800, 1415, 1233, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, however whole picture is way too dark.</td>', 'Nice set up, however whole picture is way too dark.', '2002-05-06 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57801, 1415, 459, '<td valign="top">The product is covered by the shadow!  Madison Ave is safe.</td>', 'The product is covered by the shadow!  Madison Ave is safe.', '2002-05-06 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57802, 1415, 724, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting should have been directed more to the label of the cookies to highlight the product more.  Great Idea!</td>', 'I think the lighting should have been directed more to the label of the cookies to highlight the product more.  Great Idea!', '2002-05-06 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57803, 1415, 301, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, but a little too dark around the cookies and packaging for my liking. It makes the milk stand out too much and take away from the actual product</td>', 'Nice set up, but a little too dark around the cookies and packaging for my liking. It makes the milk stand out too much and take away from the actual product', '2002-05-07 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57804, 1415, 446, '<td valign="top">Super photo.  Very inviting late night snack.  The only flaw to my eye is the reflection on the upper right of the glass.  I realize how tough it is to shoot reflective surfaces.  I rate this photo a 10 nontheless.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Super photo.  Very inviting late night snack.  The only flaw to my eye is the reflection on the upper right of the glass.  I realize how tough it is to shoot reflective surfaces.  I rate this photo a 10 nontheless.  Keep up the good work.', '2002-05-07 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57805, 1415, 975, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, just a tad dark, would like to see the bag just a little better.  Yummy!</td>', 'Nicely done, just a tad dark, would like to see the bag just a little better.  Yummy!', '2002-05-07 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57806, 1415, 436, '<td valign="top">I love the idea, but there''s just not enough light in this photo. tip of rose lost, etc.</td>', 'I love the idea, but there''s just not enough light in this photo. tip of rose lost, etc.', '2002-05-07 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57807, 1415, 780, '<td valign="top">Not enough light on the product name - maybe if you switched the candle and the package it''d be easier to read it.    What a great romantic dinner, though!</td>', 'Not enough light on the product name - maybe if you switched the candle and the package it''d be easier to read it.    What a great romantic dinner, though!', '2002-05-07 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57808, 1415, 1054, '<td valign="top">The lighting in the picture seems to draw attention away from the cookies being advertised.  Perhaps if the milk and the cookies had been switched (or the light source were on the other side) the cookies might have been more noticeable.</td>', 'The lighting in the picture seems to draw attention away from the cookies being advertised.  Perhaps if the milk and the cookies had been switched (or the light source were on the other side) the cookies might have been more noticeable.', '2002-05-07 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57809, 1415, 1503, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but the lighting could be better.</td>', 'I like the concept but the lighting could be better.', '2002-05-07 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57810, 1415, 280, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little awkward.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little awkward.', '2002-05-07 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57811, 1415, 671, '<td valign="top">For me, this was a near perfect picture!  It needed to be just a teeny bit lighter.  Not very much.  The shadows lend drama.  Just a touch.</td>', 'For me, this was a near perfect picture!  It needed to be just a teeny bit lighter.  Not very much.  The shadows lend drama.  Just a touch.', '2002-05-07 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57812, 1415, 1211, '<td valign="top">mmm....makes me hungry.  Love the concept.  I think the rose could have done without the baby''s breath.  Otherwise, great composition.</td>', 'mmm....makes me hungry.  Love the concept.  I think the rose could have done without the baby''s breath.  Otherwise, great composition.', '2002-05-07 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57813, 1415, 656, '<td valign="top">not sure these elements work together, the milk &amp; cookies yes, but the candle and rose ?  Seems like two dfferent sets of things being pushed together.</td>', 'not sure these elements work together, the milk & cookies yes, but the candle and rose ?  Seems like two dfferent sets of things being pushed together.', '2002-05-08 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57814, 1415, 748, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, but think a little more light on the subject would have had a bit more punch.</td>', 'Nicely done, but think a little more light on the subject would have had a bit more punch.', '2002-05-08 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57815, 1415, 415, '<td valign="top">Love the set up on this photo, maybe a bit more lighting.  But really great idea!  Good job!</td>', 'Love the set up on this photo, maybe a bit more lighting.  But really great idea!  Good job!', '2002-05-08 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57816, 1415, 472, '<td valign="top">ah yes, tollhouse cookies, milk, and Romance.  ; ) creative, ill give it that.  recommend a reflector on the left side to fill in the shadows over there a bit.  even a piece of white posterboard or a piece of white paper would do it.  move it in as close as you can without it being in the scene.</td>', 'ah yes, tollhouse cookies, milk, and Romance.  ; ) creative, ill give it that.  recommend a reflector on the left side to fill in the shadows over there a bit.  even a piece of white posterboard or a piece of white paper would do it.  move it in as close as you can without it being in the scene.', '2002-05-08 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57817, 1415, 527, '<td valign="top">Nice setup. You obviously took time to do this. I think I would have moved the rose more to the left about 5 inches to balance things a bit more and not be so centered with the cookies. This voting is making me hungry.</td>', 'Nice setup. You obviously took time to do this. I think I would have moved the rose more to the left about 5 inches to balance things a bit more and not be so centered with the cookies. This voting is making me hungry.', '2002-05-08 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57818, 1415, 813, '<td valign="top">good idea, need help inseveral areas, better composition (too much going on, try it with just the milk the cookies and the bag), better lighting (more light on the product.</td>', 'good idea, need help inseveral areas, better composition (too much going on, try it with just the milk the cookies and the bag), better lighting (more light on the product.', '2002-05-08 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57819, 1415, 554, '<td valign="top">perfect</td>', 'perfect', '2002-05-08 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57820, 1415, 330, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that elegance is the best way to sell cookies, but it''s still a nice picture.</td>', 'I''m not sure that elegance is the best way to sell cookies, but it''s still a nice picture.', '2002-05-09 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(57821, 1415, 714, '<td valign="top">Those cookies look soooo good.</td>', 'Those cookies look soooo good.', '2002-05-09 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
