(57836, 1415, 811, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  I learned alot from this one picture, and look forward to taking more pictures.  :-)<br/><br/>To address some of the general comments:<br/>1)  Yes, it was a touch dark on the left side.  I know now how to lighten that up.  However, I did want a "dark, romantic" mood.  Maybe just more uniform darkness.<br/>2)  Elegance and romance really don''t go with chocolate chip cookies and milk.  That was exactly why I did that.  I was hoping the juxtaposition of the elements would catch attention.<br/><br/>Anyway, it was a fun picture to eat, I mean take, and in looking at it again, I think I have some more in the fridge I can bake up real fast.  Thanks again!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  I learned alot from this one picture, and look forward to taking more pictures.  :-)To address some of the general comments:1)  Yes, it was a touch dark on the left side.  I know now how to lighten that up.  However, I did want a "dark, romantic" mood.  Maybe just more uniform darkness.2)  Elegance and romance really don''t go with chocolate chip cookies and milk.  That was exactly why I did that.  I was hoping the juxtaposition of the elements would catch attention.Anyway, it was a fun picture to eat, I mean take, and in looking at it again, I think I have some more in the fridge I can bake up real fast.  Thanks again!', '2002-05-14 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
