(57913, 1420, 675, '<td valign="top">no, this doesn''t work...the beads of water or whatever all over the glass are distracting, and if you are going to use absolut, there has to be some resemblence of a bottle somewhere</td>', 'no, this doesn''t work...the beads of water or whatever all over the glass are distracting, and if you are going to use absolut, there has to be some resemblence of a bottle somewhere', '2002-05-09 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
