(57920, 1420, 668, '<td valign="top">this was supposed to be a SPOOFon Absolut Vodka ads. <br/>many people passed comments on how the trademark bottle was not apparent in my photo. <br/>I had no bottles on hand so I resorted to this plastic cup - of which is what they serve alcoholic beverages in when you go clubbing (maybe it''s different from where you''re from) .<br/>the main idea was to portray alcoholism - drowning in your drink.. hoping to be rescued from your pathetic sorrows.. etc. <br/>i must admit that the technical side of my photo is not perfect. <br/>que se foda.</td>', 'this was supposed to be a SPOOFon Absolut Vodka ads. many people passed comments on how the trademark bottle was not apparent in my photo. I had no bottles on hand so I resorted to this plastic cup - of which is what they serve alcoholic beverages in when you go clubbing (maybe it''s different from where you''re from) .the main idea was to portray alcoholism - drowning in your drink.. hoping to be rescued from your pathetic sorrows.. etc. i must admit that the technical side of my photo is not perfect. que se foda.', '2002-05-13 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
