(58001, 1422, 2, '<td valign="top">I love it.  So very well done.</td>', 'I love it.  So very well done.', '2002-05-13 00:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58002, 1422, 2, '<td valign="top">I''m really disappointed this one didn''t do better.  I think the only thing I didn''t like about the picture was the dirty window... but just an awesome shot otherwise.</td>', 'I''m really disappointed this one didn''t do better.  I think the only thing I didn''t like about the picture was the dirty window... but just an awesome shot otherwise.', '2002-05-13 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(58003, 1422, 1128, '<td valign="top">Thanks Drew...<br/>Actually, this was my first entry and I am SO pleased that lots of people liked it.  It''s funny... I went back and forth on whether or not I should clean the window and decided in the end that it wasn''t that big a deal and sort of added to the composition, so I left it.  (Also, I slashed my leg on a piece of nearby furniture as I was stepping back from the window, so my priority was not quite with the photo at the time.)  Thanks for all nice comments!  :)</td>', 'Thanks Drew...Actually, this was my first entry and I am SO pleased that lots of people liked it.  It''s funny... I went back and forth on whether or not I should clean the window and decided in the end that it wasn''t that big a deal and sort of added to the composition, so I left it.  (Also, I slashed my leg on a piece of nearby furniture as I was stepping back from the window, so my priority was not quite with the photo at the time.)  Thanks for all nice comments!  :)', '2002-05-13 05:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(58004, 1422, 1066, '<td valign="top">It''s perfection.<br/><br/>Every element works.  The light, the imperfectins, the window.<br/><br/>It makes me feel as if its the anti-ad ad and if this was your intention it is perfect.<br/><br/>Now I want to see more of what you can do to make sure this wasn''t a fluke ;-)</td>', 'It''s perfection.Every element works.  The light, the imperfectins, the window.It makes me feel as if its the anti-ad ad and if this was your intention it is perfect.Now I want to see more of what you can do to make sure this wasn''t a fluke ;-)', '2002-05-13 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(58005, 1422, 387, '<td valign="top">the dirty window is the key to this shot. it holds the subject in and keeps the background from being a distraction.</td>', 'the dirty window is the key to this shot. it holds the subject in and keeps the background from being a distraction.', '2002-05-14 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(58006, 1422, 47, '<td valign="top">i still dont understand how this didnt even make top 10 when it should have won.</td>', 'i still dont understand how this didnt even make top 10 when it should have won.', '2002-05-19 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(58007, 1424, 1226, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Would have placed it a tad bit higher, except I think I can make out the photographer in the reflection on the bottie! :)</td>', 'Very nice. Would have placed it a tad bit higher, except I think I can make out the photographer in the reflection on the bottie! :)', '2002-05-06 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58008, 1424, 441, '<td valign="top">difficult subject - needs name of product to be clear as priority to sell - colours and subject good but composition wrong - waiting for something to fill void on right.</td>', 'difficult subject - needs name of product to be clear as priority to sell - colours and subject good but composition wrong - waiting for something to fill void on right.', '2002-05-06 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58009, 1424, 92, '<td valign="top">Great choice for the background:) The only thing that I think needs change is the name on the bottle. It''s the main thing that says what you are selling and some of it can''t be seen. Great set up and placement.</td>', 'Great choice for the background:) The only thing that I think needs change is the name on the bottle. It''s the main thing that says what you are selling and some of it can''t be seen. Great set up and placement.', '2002-05-06 06:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58010, 1424, 1, '<td valign="top">The "L" in Realm and the "E" in Women seems to be poorly lit.  The background works great though.</td>', 'The "L" in Realm and the "E" in Women seems to be poorly lit.  The background works great though.', '2002-05-06 07:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58011, 1424, 1175, '<td valign="top">Its a nice photo, I don''t agree that the rule of thirds applies to this type of advertisement and your product off to the left looks kinda weird.  If you would have made your title "Realm, second to nothing" then that would have been cool, but you didn''t.</td>', 'Its a nice photo, I don''t agree that the rule of thirds applies to this type of advertisement and your product off to the left looks kinda weird.  If you would have made your title "Realm, second to nothing" then that would have been cool, but you didn''t.', '2002-05-06 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58012, 1424, 327, '<td valign="top">Light and lack of contrast failed you here. Looks like it says REA M. Nice try and I love the lower half of the bottle.</td>', 'Light and lack of contrast failed you here. Looks like it says REA M. Nice try and I love the lower half of the bottle.', '2002-05-06 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58013, 1424, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition here.  Very nice job... This particular photo leave room for some ad copy if necessary... I hope that was the intention here, otherwise, I would have framed it a little differently... The only thing i dont like here is that the text on the bottle is not nice and clear agains teh background.  Good job!</td>', 'Beautiful composition here.  Very nice job... This particular photo leave room for some ad copy if necessary... I hope that was the intention here, otherwise, I would have framed it a little differently... The only thing i dont like here is that the text on the bottle is not nice and clear agains teh background.  Good job!', '2002-05-06 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58014, 1424, 835, '<td valign="top">Overall, I really like the idea and I like the positioning of the bottle.  But, I think it is really important that the name of the fragrance shows up well since it is supposed to be an advertisement for that product.  You needed to somehow do the lighting differently.</td>', 'Overall, I really like the idea and I like the positioning of the bottle.  But, I think it is really important that the name of the fragrance shows up well since it is supposed to be an advertisement for that product.  You needed to somehow do the lighting differently.', '2002-05-06 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58015, 1424, 885, '<td valign="top">It might be a carpeted stair but it does a good job of looking like suede.</td>', 'It might be a carpeted stair but it does a good job of looking like suede.', '2002-05-06 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58016, 1424, 1005, '<td valign="top">You missed the "L" and part of the "E".  Good photo.  Photo 9 Advert 8 Creativity 8 total 8</td>', 'You missed the "L" and part of the "E".  Good photo.  Photo 9 Advert 8 Creativity 8 total 8', '2002-05-06 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58017, 1424, 715, '<td valign="top">Nice refelections and colors. I think you should  have turned the bottle a little bit,  so that the name on the bottle would have been clearly visable.</td>', 'Nice refelections and colors. I think you should  have turned the bottle a little bit,  so that the name on the bottle would have been clearly visable.', '2002-05-06 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58018, 1424, 259, '<td valign="top">too bad the chrome caused such a glare.</td>', 'too bad the chrome caused such a glare.', '2002-05-06 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58019, 1424, 1233, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but can''t really read the text on the bottle.</td>', 'Nice idea, but can''t really read the text on the bottle.', '2002-05-06 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58020, 1424, 139, '<td valign="top">Nice background, and good use of space.  The lighting is not so good, though, as I can''t really see all of the letters on the bottle face.</td>', 'Nice background, and good use of space.  The lighting is not so good, though, as I can''t really see all of the letters on the bottle face.', '2002-05-06 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58021, 1424, 1046, '<td valign="top">the L in realm and the e in women don''t show up</td>', 'the L in realm and the e in women don''t show up', '2002-05-06 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58022, 1424, 459, '<td valign="top">Can''t read what is written on the bottle.  Violates the first law of advertising - "let em know what the product is"!</td>', 'Can''t read what is written on the bottle.  Violates the first law of advertising - "let em know what the product is"!', '2002-05-06 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58023, 1424, 1336, '<td valign="top">the product name needs to be clearer for this to be a good advertisement photo.</td>', 'the product name needs to be clearer for this to be a good advertisement photo.', '2002-05-06 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58024, 1424, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think the colour of the background is a bit dull to give the impression of richness and luxury you were after, although the variations in the colour and the overall texture is nice. Nevertheless, it''s not nice enough to take up that much of the photo. The lighting is effective, but too strong, making the reflections on the lid blow out. The name of the product isn''t clear... I can work out what it is, but in an advertising shot it would have to be 100% readable.<br/><br/>Otherwise a nice imitation of a perfume ad.</td>', 'I think the colour of the background is a bit dull to give the impression of richness and luxury you were after, although the variations in the colour and the overall texture is nice. Nevertheless, it''s not nice enough to take up that much of the photo. The lighting is effective, but too strong, making the reflections on the lid blow out. The name of the product isn''t clear... I can work out what it is, but in an advertising shot it would have to be 100% readable.Otherwise a nice imitation of a perfume ad.', '2002-05-07 03:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58025, 1424, 797, '<td valign="top">i like the large void you leave on the right. the grainy fabric you chose for a background is also mysterious and warm.  the bright cap is interesting. only thing i feel wanting is the writing on the bottle.</td>', 'i like the large void you leave on the right. the grainy fabric you chose for a background is also mysterious and warm.  the bright cap is interesting. only thing i feel wanting is the writing on the bottle.', '2002-05-07 05:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58026, 1424, 301, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  I really like the texture of the background.  Goes very well with the colour of the perfume. My only gripe would be that the reflections don''t really fit in.  The top of the bottle has some quite large reflections which cause a distraction, and the product name is lost slightly ... it is quite hard to read the ''L'' and ''E'' of ''REALM'' and ''WOMEN'' respectively</td>', 'beautiful.  I really like the texture of the background.  Goes very well with the colour of the perfume. My only gripe would be that the reflections don''t really fit in.  The top of the bottle has some quite large reflections which cause a distraction, and the product name is lost slightly ... it is quite hard to read the ''L'' and ''E'' of ''REALM'' and ''WOMEN'' respectively', '2002-05-07 06:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58027, 1424, 661, '<td valign="top">Hard to read the writing on the bottle.</td>', 'Hard to read the writing on the bottle.', '2002-05-07 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58028, 1424, 813, '<td valign="top">dramatic composition, i like that you left space on the right to put ad copy, but it needs to have a little more care taken in lighting, specifically the product name is hard to read and the top is distractingly shiny</td>', 'dramatic composition, i like that you left space on the right to put ad copy, but it needs to have a little more care taken in lighting, specifically the product name is hard to read and the top is distractingly shiny', '2002-05-07 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58029, 1424, 536, '<td valign="top">Handsome bottle and rather difficult to shoot. It looks like you had a little problem with lighting but wellINSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(58192, 1433, 587, '<td valign="top">Scary that atleast 2 minds think that alike. Great clarity and color. grat photo!!</td>', 'Scary that atleast 2 minds think that alike. Great clarity and color. grat photo!!', '2002-05-12 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58193, 1434, 888, '<td valign="top">tut tut darned Americans, don''t they know its spelt TYRE? !?!?!?!<br/><br/>hehehehehe I really like this it has a nice bit of humour in it.  I think the wires are a bit distracting though</td>', 'tut tut darned Americans, don''t they know its spelt TYRE? !?!?!?!hehehehehe I really like this it has a nice bit of humour in it.  I think the wires are a bit distracting though', '2002-05-06 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58194, 1434, 772, '<td valign="top">This is not a good subject for an advertisement photo.. The poles, wires, the wire on your main sign, and the gas station sign in the background make this photo a little ''busy''....</td>', 'This is not a good subject for an advertisement photo.. The poles, wires, the wire on your main sign, and the gas station sign in the background make this photo a little ''busy''....', '2002-05-06 05:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58195, 1434, 570, '<td valign="top">well, this advert was setup by someone else.</td>', 'well, this advert was setup by someone else.', '2002-05-06 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58196, 1434, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious.  I have given it a high mark just because it made me laugh.  Tehcnically it is a little bit washed out.</td>', 'This is hilarious.  I have given it a high mark just because it made me laugh.  Tehcnically it is a little bit washed out.', '2002-05-06 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58197, 1434, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good focus and it does advertise, kinda boring.  Photo 8 Advert 6 total 7</td>', 'Good focus and it does advertise, kinda boring.  Photo 8 Advert 6 total 7', '2002-05-06 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58198, 1434, 1323, '<td valign="top">power lines are distracting</td>', 'power lines are distracting', '2002-05-06 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58199, 1434, 327, '<td valign="top">Too easy. Just a sign and dark too!<br/>The wires are more eye catching then the sign.<br/>Doesn''t make me want to buy these, but I will give ya it''s an ad!!<br/>Okay.</td>', 'Too easy. Just a sign and dark too!The wires are more eye catching then the sign.Doesn''t make me want to buy these, but I will give ya it''s an ad!!Okay.', '2002-05-06 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58200, 1434, 715, '<td valign="top">LOL I don''t think I''m gonna buy tires over there. But then again, the sign also says that his used tires are new :-)<br/>But seriously, I like this pictue a lot.</td>', 'LOL I don''t think I''m gonna buy tires over there. But then again, the sign also says that his used tires are new :-)But seriously, I like this pictue a lot.', '2002-05-06 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58201, 1434, 259, '<td valign="top">nice find</td>', 'nice find', '2002-05-06 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58202, 1434, 428, '<td valign="top">The idea of this is not too bad, but the execution leaves a little to be desired.  The wires and the poles really are distracting as is the gas sign in the back.  The only suggestion that I can offer, is to try and crop it more or get a tighter framing. Maybe you could try it from a different angle to counteract all the distracting elements.</td>', 'The idea of this is not too bad, but the execution leaves a little to be desired.  The wires and the poles really are distracting as is the gas sign in the back.  The only suggestion that I can offer, is to try and crop it more or get a tighter framing. Maybe you could try it from a different angle to counteract all the distracting elements.', '2002-05-06 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58203, 1434, 1336, '<td valign="top">i wish i had something good to say about this photo, but taking a picture of a billboard (with a ton of wires in the background), does not constitute an advertisement shot</td>', 'i wish i had something good to say about this photo, but taking a picture of a billboard (with a ton of wires in the background), does not constitute an advertisement shot', '2002-05-07 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58204, 1434, 139, '<td valign="top">Haha!  Where is this place?</td>', 'Haha!  Where is this place?', '2002-05-07 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58205, 1434, 1041, '<td valign="top">I want to move there - gas is much cheaper than here in Northern Virginia!  As for the photo, it has a snapshot feel to it with the wires and the cut-off gas sign.  Also only borderline fulfills the challenge (at least the way I interprete it) because you didn''t create your own ad.</td>', 'I want to move there - gas is much cheaper than here in Northern Virginia!  As for the photo, it has a snapshot feel to it with the wires and the cut-off gas sign.  Also only borderline fulfills the challenge (at least the way I interprete it) because you didn''t create your own ad.', '2002-05-07 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58206, 1434, 1054, '<td valign="top">ROFL!</td>', 'ROFL!', '2002-05-07 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58207, 1434, 142, '<td valign="top">Is this for real?  I don''t think I want any tires from this guy.</td>', 'Is this for real?  I don''t think I want any tires from this guy.', '2002-05-07 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58208, 1434, 472, '<td valign="top">not if it may pop!  : )</td>', 'not if it may pop!  : )', '2002-05-08 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58209, 1434, 1078, '<td valign="top">Such a busy background -- really makes it hard to pay attention to the sign.  Were there any signs on the building selling the tires?  Maybe using one of them, getting some tires in the shot.  The contrast here is also a little off -- the sign is darker than it should be -- like it''s been backlit.  Was the other side of the sign brighter?</td>', 'Such a busy background -- really makes it hard to pay attention to the sign.  Were there any signs on the building selling the tires?  Maybe using one of them, getting some tires in the shot.  The contrast here is also a little off -- the sign is darker than it should be -- like it''s been backlit.  Was the other side of the sign brighter?', '2002-05-08 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58210, 1434, 527, '<td valign="top">Did you make this up or is it it a well known sign in your area? In any case I can''t see it being used this way in an adverisement.</td>', 'Did you make this up or is it it a well known sign in your area? In any case I can''t see it being used this way in an adverisement.', '2002-05-08 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58211, 1434, 813, '<td valign="top">does a picture of an advertising sign constitute and advertising picture? even if it did this shot could be much improved by adjusting the brightness so the sign was easier  to see</td>', 'does a picture of an advertising sign constitute and advertising picture? even if it did this shot could be much improved by adjusting the brightness so the sign was easier  to see', '2002-05-08 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58212, 1434, 1209, '<td valign="top">How funny!  Contents are a little busy!</td>', 'How funny!  Contents are a little busy!', '2002-05-09 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58213, 1434, 675, '<td valign="top">funny, but very uncreative...also the power lines are just too much</td>', 'funny, but very uncreative...also the power lines are just too much', '2002-05-09 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58214, 1434, 1510, '<td valign="top">boring and ugly too many wires and not creative at all</td>', 'boring and ugly too many wires and not creative at all', '2002-05-09 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58215, 1434, 811, '<td valign="top">As a picture, you could have possibly changed the angle to make it more interesting or eliminated the gas sign.  As for humor:  it''s great.  Very possibly the funniest picture here.</td>', 'As a picture, you could have possibly changed the angle to make it more interesting or eliminated the gas sign.  As for humor:  it''s great.  Very possibly the funniest picture here.', '2002-05-09 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58216, 1434, 1191, '<td valign="top">Shame about the confusing background.  The cables detract from the sign.  Otherwise, nice shot</td>', 'Shame about the confusing background.  The cables detract from the sign.  Otherwise, nice shot', '2002-05-10 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58217, 1434, 554, '<td valign="top">If you could have gotten someone to kind of moved the wires and poles back a little-------this is funny!</td>', 'If you could have gotten someone to kind of moved the wires and poles back a little-------this is funny!', '2002-05-10 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58218, 1434, 543, '<td valign="top">Funny sign, but not really an appealing image of a product in any way that I can come up with... well, I guess there''s the image of the tire in the sign, but that''s as far as I can stretch.  There was a ''signs'' challenge a while back where this would have fit better, IMO.</td>', 'Funny sign, but not really an appealing image of a product in any way that I can come up with... well, I guess there''s the image of the tire in the sign, but that''s as far as I can stretch.  There was a ''signs'' challenge a while back where this would have fit better, IMO.', '2002-05-11 05:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58219, 1434, 1559, '<td valign="top">Rather humourous!</td>', 'Rather humourous!', '2002-05-11 07:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58220, 1434, 1031, '<td valign="top">Prices slashed...</td>', 'Prices slashed...', '2002-05-11 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58221, 1434, 1202, '<td valign="top">I''ve hears of May Pops for a long time, but now I know that they are available.   Where the heck do you live that gas is only $1.2? a gallon?   Not California for sure.</td>', 'I''ve hears of May Pops for a long time, but now I know that they are available.   Where the heck do you live that gas is only $1.2? a gallon?   Not California for sure.', '2002-05-12 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58222, 1434, 1, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, seems pretty snap shot though.</td>', 'Cute idea, seems pretty snap shot though.', '2002-05-12 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58223, 1434, 2, '<td valign="top">The gas sign and wires are reeally distracting.</td>', 'The gas sign and wires are reeally distracting.', '2002-05-12 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58224, 1434, 637, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I only see a snapshot here, with a distracting rope/cable/line down the middle.<br/></td>', 'Sorry, I only see a snapshot here, with a distracting rope/cable/line down the middle.', '2002-05-12 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58225, 1434, 1584, '<td valign="top">My kind of photo to save! I love humor in advertising.</td>', 'My kind of photo to save! I love humor in advertising.', '2002-05-13 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58226, 1435, 772, '<td valign="top">I, personally, would have tried to make the train cars a larger part of this photograph...</td>', 'I, personally, would have tried to make the train cars a larger part of this photograph...', '2002-05-06 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58227, 1435, 472, '<td valign="top">i think this would been stronger if you had zoomed in on the train car.  that would have ruled!</td>', 'i think this would been stronger if you had zoomed in on the train car.  that would have ruled!', '2002-05-06 08:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58228, 1435, 327, '<td valign="top">I think for the title we should of seen happy riders. However, I do understand your point. Nice clean photo but the W in Warminster is cut off. Good idea but if the title wasn''t there what would this photo say to someone?</td>', 'I think for the title we should of seen happy riders. However, I do understand your point. Nice clean photo but the W in Warminster is cut off. Good idea but if the title wasn''t there what would this photo say to someone?', '2002-05-06 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58229, 1435, 156, '<td valign="top">i keep reading this as septa: it''s better than drowning...<br/>This is a great public service statement, but as far as ''ad'' impact or appeal, it''s lacking and i can''t really explain why other than to say that an ad depicting one of these flying past say, a bumper to bumper highway ''parking lot'' would work better...</td>', 'i keep reading this as septa: it''s better than drowning...This is a great public service statement, but as far as ''ad'' impact or appeal, it''s lacking and i can''t really explain why other than to say that an ad depicting one of these flying past say, a bumper to bumper highway ''parking lot'' would work better...', '2002-05-06 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58230, 1435, 1005, '<td valign="top">Get the people to WAVE!  You need HAPPY commuters!  Photo 10 Advert 8 Creativity 9 total 9</td>', 'Get the people to WAVE!  You need HAPPY commuters!  Photo 10 Advert 8 Creativity 9 total 9', '2002-05-06 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58231, 1435, 1485, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I love trains so this immediately caught my eye. 2 negatives.  1.  The train is not standing out enough.. the balance is more on the empty loading area.  Maybe that could be solved with different lighting?  Or different angle?.   2.  The picture should have been taken with a crowded platform.</td>', 'Good composition.  I love trains so this immediately caught my eye. 2 negatives.  1.  The train is not standing out enough.. the balance is more on the empty loading area.  Maybe that could be solved with different lighting?  Or different angle?.   2.  The picture should have been taken with a crowded platform.', '2002-05-06 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58232, 1435, 801, '<td valign="top">good idea, but not very good photo</td>', 'good idea, but not very good photo', '2002-05-06 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58233, 1435, 259, '<td valign="top">i don''t want to sound too harsh, but this photo just doesn''t have an advertisment feel to it without being told so.</td>', 'i don''t want to sound too harsh, but this photo just doesn''t have an advertisment feel to it without being told so.', '2002-05-06 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58234, 1435, 1233, '<td valign="top">What are we selling here, what is appealing? Sorry :(, I don''t get it.</td>', 'What are we selling here, what is appealing? Sorry :(, I don''t get it.', '2002-05-06 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58235, 1435, 1336, '<td valign="top">kind of just a plain photo here.  doesnt look very much like an advertisement</td>', 'kind of just a plain photo here.  doesnt look very much like an advertisement', '2002-05-06 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58236, 1435, 441, '<td valign="top">superb detailed shot and good subject.</td>', 'superb detailed shot and good subject.', '2002-05-07 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58237, 1435, 656, '<td valign="top">different take on the challenge, but I think I''d want something that implies more motion and getting there on time...</td>', 'different take on the challenge, but I think I''d want something that implies more motion and getting there on time...', '2002-05-08 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
