(58274, 1440, 536, '<td valign="top">Composition and lighting.  I think you may have to many items or too much space between them.  Imo a close-up of Hershey produce and the mug setup would have made a stronger picture.  Maybe the milk in the background? This photo reminds me of something from an old issue of a woman''s magazine.  I almost can imagine the hot cocoa recipe printed to the side.  You may not have sold me any cocoa but you did a great joke on meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Composition and lighting.  I think you may have to many items or too much space between them.  Imo a close-up of Hershey produce and the mug setup would have made a stronger picture.  Maybe the milk in the background? This photo reminds me of something from an old issue of a woman''s magazine.  I almost can imagine the hot cocoa recipe printed to the side.  You may not have sold me any cocoa but you did a great joke on meeting the challenge.', '2002-05-06 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58275, 1440, 92, '<td valign="top">I like this. I like the lighting. I like the natural at home feel to it. That goes well with the product ! This is well done:)</td>', 'I like this. I like the lighting. I like the natural at home feel to it. That goes well with the product ! This is well done:)', '2002-05-06 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
