(58327, 1442, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this photograph.  I can tell that a lot of people put a lot of thought into this challenge.  "Don''t Mess with Texas!"<br/></td>', 'I like the composition on this photograph.  I can tell that a lot of people put a lot of thought into this challenge.  "Don''t Mess with Texas!"', '2002-05-06 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
