(58329, 1442, 327, '<td valign="top">Not too bad.<br/>I would of liked the can lit up so that it''s not just a black hole with JR in the center.<br/>Also the hat looks too flat, maybe tilted up higher or up against the can?</td>', 'Not too bad.I would of liked the can lit up so that it''s not just a black hole with JR in the center.Also the hat looks too flat, maybe tilted up higher or up against the can?', '2002-05-06 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58330, 1442, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Beer was very popular!  Better "gotcha" value than many.  Photo 9 Advert 9 Creativity 8 total 9</td>', 'Good photo.  Beer was very popular!  Better "gotcha" value than many.  Photo 9 Advert 9 Creativity 8 total 9', '2002-05-06 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58331, 1442, 156, '<td valign="top">JR beer, what a hoot! and why the unopened can? i think the ''ad'' would say a lot more if the can that was used to fill the mug was next to it, also think the hat placed on the table, as if one could barely wait to remove the hat before refreshing oneself, works better than it does propped up...</td>', 'JR beer, what a hoot! and why the unopened can? i think the ''ad'' would say a lot more if the can that was used to fill the mug was next to it, also think the hat placed on the table, as if one could barely wait to remove the hat before refreshing oneself, works better than it does propped up...', '2002-05-06 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58332, 1442, 813, '<td valign="top">Good concept, there are several improvements that could be made: 1) level the horizon line, 2) put more light on the product, 3) light the beer from behind to make it look wetter (this can be done with a mirror behind the glass turned at a 45 degree angle and light thrown into it), 3) frost the mug before shooting, 4) be ready to trip the shutter immediately after dumping a full can of beer into the glass to catch the head bubbling up over the rim. Beer is hard to shoot and you did a pretty good job of catching it foaming up, but it needs to be more to sell.</td>', 'Good concept, there are several improvements that could be made: 1) level the horizon line, 2) put more light on the product, 3) light the beer from behind to make it look wetter (this can be done with a mirror behind the glass turned at a 45 degree angle and light thrown into it), 3) frost the mug before shooting, 4) be ready to trip the shutter immediately after dumping a full can of beer into the glass to catch the head bubbling up over the rim. Beer is hard to shoot and you did a pretty good job of catching it foaming up, but it needs to be more to sell.', '2002-05-06 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58333, 1442, 259, '<td valign="top">i hate the americanism, just kidding</td>', 'i hate the americanism, just kidding', '2002-05-06 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58334, 1442, 428, '<td valign="top">Great shot! The glass looks so cold and frosty! I like the contrast of the white table cloth with the black background.  LIghting, focusing and composition, excellent! The only nit-picky thing I can say is the black cloth in the back is a little wrinkled, but I still rate it high!</td>', 'Great shot! The glass looks so cold and frosty! I like the contrast of the white table cloth with the black background.  LIghting, focusing and composition, excellent! The only nit-picky thing I can say is the black cloth in the back is a little wrinkled, but I still rate it high!', '2002-05-06 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58335, 1442, 459, '<td valign="top">Best beer ad of the chalenge!  It looks appetizing and really has a "Western" feel to it.  I even like the lace!</td>', 'Best beer ad of the chalenge!  It looks appetizing and really has a "Western" feel to it.  I even like the lace!', '2002-05-06 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58336, 1442, 1128, '<td valign="top">Haven''t seen a whole lot of cowboys with doilies around the house!   :)</td>', 'Haven''t seen a whole lot of cowboys with doilies around the house!   :)', '2002-05-06 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58337, 1442, 1037, '<td valign="top">The lighting is nice, but somehow a lace tablecloth seems inappropriate. The camera angle is a bit awkward, too.</td>', 'The lighting is nice, but somehow a lace tablecloth seems inappropriate. The camera angle is a bit awkward, too.', '2002-05-07 07:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58338, 1442, 215, '<td valign="top">The table cloth is very distracting as it is in strong contrast against the black background.</td>', 'The table cloth is very distracting as it is in strong contrast against the black background.', '2002-05-07 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58339, 1442, 446, '<td valign="top">Well exposed shot.  Nice and sharp.  The lace background seems to be quite distracting for this type of shot to my eye.  Good effort, I rated this photo high.</td>', 'Well exposed shot.  Nice and sharp.  The lace background seems to be quite distracting for this type of shot to my eye.  Good effort, I rated this photo high.', '2002-05-07 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58340, 1442, 527, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I don''t like how it is skewed. I also think the hat competes with the beer a little to much. Maybe if you could have blurred it someone.</td>', 'Nice, but I don''t like how it is skewed. I also think the hat competes with the beer a little to much. Maybe if you could have blurred it someone.', '2002-05-08 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58341, 1442, 1523, '<td valign="top">Very good ! **Humming the theme song to Dallas**</td>', 'Very good ! **Humming the theme song to Dallas**', '2002-05-08 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58342, 1442, 301, '<td valign="top">Very nice and sharp, and good lighting.  I like the hat creating a country feel, but I''m not so sure about the lacy table cloth you''ve used ... doesn''t really sit right in my mind.  The beer seems a little tilted too.</td>', 'Very nice and sharp, and good lighting.  I like the hat creating a country feel, but I''m not so sure about the lacy table cloth you''ve used ... doesn''t really sit right in my mind.  The beer seems a little tilted too.', '2002-05-09 05:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58343, 1442, 811, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the hat and the black background is nice, and I like the texture the "tablecloth" gives to the picture.  Is it just me or is the mug and can tilted slightly to the right?  Kinda makes it feel lke it is going to slide off of the table.  Also, cropped a little to tightly on the right side.</td>', 'The contrast of the hat and the black background is nice, and I like the texture the "tablecloth" gives to the picture.  Is it just me or is the mug and can tilted slightly to the right?  Kinda makes it feel lke it is going to slide off of the table.  Also, cropped a little to tightly on the right side.', '2002-05-09 08:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58344, 1442, 675, '<td valign="top">damn straight, and if this photo wasn''t tilted it would have been great</td>', 'damn straight, and if this photo wasn''t tilted it would have been great', '2002-05-09 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58345, 1442, 121, '<td valign="top">...all our beer is passed by Mr Ewing himself."     Well it certainly looks like it.<br/>Nicely shot though, like the strond contrast background.</td>', '...all our beer is passed by Mr Ewing himself."     Well it certainly looks like it.Nicely shot though, like the strond contrast background.', '2002-05-09 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58346, 1442, 543, '<td valign="top">I suppose that black space would be good for putting copy, but for posting here I''d like to see the composition tighter.  It isn''t really necessary to show all of the hat - just enough to make it recognizeable.  Looks like both your table and tripod were not level, which makes for a very after-several-beers feeling in the viewer.</td>', 'I suppose that black space would be good for putting copy, but for posting here I''d like to see the composition tighter.  It isn''t really necessary to show all of the hat - just enough to make it recognizeable.  Looks like both your table and tripod were not level, which makes for a very after-several-beers feeling in the viewer.', '2002-05-10 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58347, 1442, 1191, '<td valign="top">Would have been a good photo had it been straight!!The whole image is slanting right</td>', 'Would have been a good photo had it been straight!!The whole image is slanting right', '2002-05-10 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58348, 1442, 554, '<td valign="top">good one---they still sell that stuff?</td>', 'good one---they still sell that stuff?', '2002-05-11 08:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58349, 1442, 142, '<td valign="top">Well done.  The beer looks good.</td>', 'Well done.  The beer looks good.', '2002-05-11 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58350, 1442, 1031, '<td valign="top">Have a hidden stash of Billy Beer anywhere? (Or maybe a Reggie Bar?)<br/><br/>I like lacy patterns in general, but I''m not sue it goes so well with Texas beer</td>', 'Have a hidden stash of Billy Beer anywhere? (Or maybe a Reggie Bar?)I like lacy patterns in general, but I''m not sue it goes so well with Texas beer', '2002-05-11 19:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58351, 1442, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice clear picture which tells about and sells the product.</td>', 'Nice clear picture which tells about and sells the product.', '2002-05-12 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58352, 1442, 587, '<td valign="top">Great ad! Great photo!</td>', 'Great ad! Great photo!', '2002-05-12 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58353, 1442, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice little setup, though there''s an odd tilt / slight angle problem.</td>', 'Nice little setup, though there''s an odd tilt / slight angle problem.', '2002-05-12 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58354, 1442, 2, '<td valign="top">Cold beer, cowboy hats, and doilies?</td>', 'Cold beer, cowboy hats, and doilies?', '2002-05-12 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58355, 1442, 933, '<td valign="top">ugh!  you call that swill beer?!?  well, reagrdless of the shortcomings of the product, your photo was well done...</td>', 'ugh!  you call that swill beer?!?  well, reagrdless of the shortcomings of the product, your photo was well done...', '2002-05-12 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58356, 1442, 748, '<td valign="top">After many attempts at drinking off the top to make room for more, I really started having fun!  With the shot taken outside and my one and only beer glass not being level itself, made levelling a real challenge.  If I had shot another 20 shots, I may have been level myself.  I really had fun with this one, but wasn''t drinking JR!</td>', 'After many attempts at drinking off the top to make room for more, I really started having fun!  With the shot taken outside and my one and only beer glass not being level itself, made levelling a real challenge.  If I had shot another 20 shots, I may have been level myself.  I really had fun with this one, but wasn''t drinking JR!', '2002-05-13 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(58357, 1443, 1226, '<td valign="top">The text is a bit hard to read under this lighting, but I can see this in a home journal mag now... very nice.</td>', 'The text is a bit hard to read under this lighting, but I can see this in a home journal mag now... very nice.', '2002-05-06 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58358, 1443, 1360, '<td valign="top">Just curious!  Is this a real product?</td>', 'Just curious!  Is this a real product?', '2002-05-06 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58359, 1443, 205, '<td valign="top">Are you shitting me?</td>', 'Are you shitting me?', '2002-05-06 03:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58360, 1443, 536, '<td valign="top">Nice. good colors. Good use of Lilac :)</td>', 'Nice. good colors. Good use of Lilac :)', '2002-05-06 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58361, 1443, 885, '<td valign="top">creative</td>', 'creative', '2002-05-06 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58362, 1443, 1, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, done very well.</td>', 'Cute idea, done very well.', '2002-05-06 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58363, 1443, 884, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, creative idea. Nice setup. Good job!</td>', 'Lovely photo, creative idea. Nice setup. Good job!', '2002-05-06 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58364, 1443, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice work!  Is this a real product or did you make the label yourself?  Either way, its excellent!  Since there is one petal detached and on the base, I actually think a few more like it could have been nice too!  Very nice work!</td>', 'Nice work!  Is this a real product or did you make the label yourself?  Either way, its excellent!  Since there is one petal detached and on the base, I actually think a few more like it could have been nice too!  Very nice work!', '2002-05-06 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58365, 1443, 1005, '<td valign="top">(Did you make the can label?)  Simple, effective advert.  Looks great.   Photo 10 Advert 9 Creativity 9 total 9</td>', '(Did you make the can label?)  Simple, effective advert.  Looks great.   Photo 10 Advert 9 Creativity 9 total 9', '2002-05-06 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58366, 1443, 327, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all. Nice job.</td>', 'Not bad at all. Nice job.', '2002-05-06 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58367, 1443, 259, '<td valign="top">you took too much time comming up with that</td>', 'you took too much time comming up with that', '2002-05-06 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58368, 1443, 1209, '<td valign="top">I can even smell the lilacs! Good job.</td>', 'I can even smell the lilacs! Good job.', '2002-05-06 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58369, 1443, 888, '<td valign="top">ha ha is that a real produc to r did you print he label yourself?<br/>nice colour</td>', 'ha ha is that a real produc to r did you print he label yourself?nice colour', '2002-05-06 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58370, 1443, 459, '<td valign="top">Nice set up</td>', 'Nice set up', '2002-05-06 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58371, 1443, 509, '<td valign="top">Colors seem a bit pale, did you make the label on your computer?  If so, I think a glossy paper might have reflected light better, and given more texture to the shot</td>', 'Colors seem a bit pale, did you make the label on your computer?  If so, I think a glossy paper might have reflected light better, and given more texture to the shot', '2002-05-06 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58372, 1443, 1037, '<td valign="top">Well, I think all the components are there for an advertisement, but it''s not very pleasing to the eye, and the lighting is very dim.</td>', 'Well, I think all the components are there for an advertisement, but it''s not very pleasing to the eye, and the lighting is very dim.', '2002-05-07 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58373, 1443, 651, '<td valign="top">Nice job..</td>', 'Nice job..', '2002-05-07 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58374, 1443, 472, '<td valign="top">oh man, i need this stuff for my coworker. she stinks!  i feel the colors are a bit flat and washed out.  how could you improve this?  maybe not use on camera flash, rather use some desk lamps to get some specific directional lighting on the subject and highlight the colors of specific areas.  maybe play with the white balance some, too.</td>', 'oh man, i need this stuff for my coworker. she stinks!  i feel the colors are a bit flat and washed out.  how could you improve this?  maybe not use on camera flash, rather use some desk lamps to get some specific directional lighting on the subject and highlight the colors of specific areas.  maybe play with the white balance some, too.', '2002-05-07 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58375, 1443, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice work!</td>', 'Nice work!', '2002-05-07 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58376, 1443, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2002-05-07 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58377, 1443, 715, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea and nicely executed. Just wished the label was a bit more in focus.</td>', 'Very clever idea and nicely executed. Just wished the label was a bit more in focus.', '2002-05-08 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58378, 1443, 889, '<td valign="top">I can see this was cropped out of a larger picture, getting  the subject better lit from the left and not shot down on would have helped. Also the can appers slightly canted to the side.<br/>I think it is nice that there is one flower on the table by the can is a nice touch intentionally or not.<br/>Not your fault, but the yellow can lid donesnt make me think of  lilac''s.</td>', 'I can see this was cropped out of a larger picture, getting  the subject better lit from the left and not shot down on would have helped. Also the can appers slightly canted to the side.I think it is nice that there is one flower on the table by the can is a nice touch intentionally or not.Not your fault, but the yellow can lid donesnt make me think of  lilac''s.', '2002-05-08 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58379, 1443, 527, '<td valign="top">This is great. Did you create the label?</td>', 'This is great. Did you create the label?', '2002-05-08 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58380, 1443, 875, '<td valign="top">Cute idea!.  I find the shadows a little distracting, especially the dark one on the left.</td>', 'Cute idea!.  I find the shadows a little distracting, especially the dark one on the left.', '2002-05-08 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58381, 1443, 441, '<td valign="top">you need to get way back on full tele to avoid distortion, lovely lilac colours - not keen on their choice of light yellow can top &amp; graphic - I think you would have chosen a better colour combination! had same problem with my shot with shadows.</td>', 'you need to get way back on full tele to avoid distortion, lovely lilac colours - not keen on their choice of light yellow can top & graphic - I think you would have chosen a better colour combination! had same problem with my shot with shadows.', '2002-05-09 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58382, 1443, 811, '<td valign="top">Heck, at least I wouldn''t kill these flowers!!!  Nice composition.  A little too tight at the top.</td>', 'Heck, at least I wouldn''t kill these flowers!!!  Nice composition.  A little too tight at the top.', '2002-05-09 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58383, 1443, 446, '<td valign="top">Way to go.  Nice effort.</td>', 'Way to go.  Nice effort.', '2002-05-10 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58384, 1443, 554, '<td valign="top">perfect match.  I deducted one point for the stray flower.</td>', 'perfect match.  I deducted one point for the stray flower.', '2002-05-11 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58385, 1443, 142, '<td valign="top">Nice job except the lighting needs to be different.  I wish I could offer you some advice but I''m having the same problem with my entry.</td>', 'Nice job except the lighting needs to be different.  I wish I could offer you some advice but I''m having the same problem with my entry.', '2002-05-11 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58386, 1443, 326, '<td valign="top">I like this one alot....Nice job!</td>', 'I like this one alot....Nice job!', '2002-05-11 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58387, 1443, 1031, '<td valign="top">Uh-roma therapy?</td>', 'Uh-roma therapy?', '2002-05-11 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58388, 1443, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good advertisement.   Great color and composition.</td>', 'Good advertisement.   Great color and composition.', '2002-05-12 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58389, 1443, 587, '<td valign="top">I like this, I would have made it look more "woodsy" though - lose the vase and white background - add more flowers and make it look like it''s fresh lilacs in a can. Maybe a little less shadow on left, but the clarity is good. Nice photo.</td>', 'I like this, I would have made it look more "woodsy" though - lose the vase and white background - add more flowers and make it look like it''s fresh lilacs in a can. Maybe a little less shadow on left, but the clarity is good. Nice photo.', '2002-05-12 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58390, 1443, 637, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I especially like the fallen petal</td>', 'Very nicely done. I especially like the fallen petal', '2002-05-12 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58391, 1445, 92, '<td valign="top">VERY nice ! I can see this being in a magazine without a doubt.</td>', 'VERY nice ! I can see this being in a magazine without a doubt.', '2002-05-06 06:39:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(58392, 1445, 142, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Classy looking and well lit.  Okay, I see the subliminal image.  I love it.  How did you do it?  You have my admiration as an excellent photogarpher.</td>', 'Very nice.  Classy looking and well lit.  Okay, I see the subliminal image.  I love it.  How did you do it?  You have my admiration as an excellent photogarpher.', '2002-05-06 07:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58393, 1445, 472, '<td valign="top">very pretty shot.  i like the colors in the fabric</td>', 'very pretty shot.  i like the colors in the fabric', '2002-05-06 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58394, 1445, 1024, '<td valign="top">nice subtle lighting</td>', 'nice subtle lighting', '2002-05-06 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58395, 1445, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good photo, Advert O.K. (you got a light reflection on the bottle)  Photo 9 Advert 8 total 8</td>', 'Good photo, Advert O.K. (you got a light reflection on the bottle)  Photo 9 Advert 8 total 8', '2002-05-06 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58396, 1445, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  I can definitely see this one in a magazine... probalby with the little pull out flap that has the scent :) nice work!</td>', 'Very nicely done!  I can definitely see this one in a magazine... probalby with the little pull out flap that has the scent :) nice work!', '2002-05-06 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58397, 1445, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this. It''s a very nice shot except for the earrings and ?? in the lower left corner. If you had to have the earrings then they should of been something like jade, diamonds, pearls etc.<br/>The bottle is very nice.</td>', 'I like this. It''s a very nice shot except for the earrings and ?? in the lower left corner. If you had to have the earrings then they should of been something like jade, diamonds, pearls etc.The bottle is very nice.', '2002-05-06 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58398, 1445, 259, '<td valign="top">i dont get the whole an eye for detail thing, but i am sure it makes sence some how.  unless that thing is an eye behind the bottle.</td>', 'i dont get the whole an eye for detail thing, but i am sure it makes sence some how.  unless that thing is an eye behind the bottle.', '2002-05-06 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58399, 1445, 813, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and composition. I detect the work of someone who''s done this before (hence the eye for detail). Nice job. 10 for concept, and 10 for execution. Bravo</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and composition. I detect the work of someone who''s done this before (hence the eye for detail). Nice job. 10 for concept, and 10 for execution. Bravo', '2002-05-06 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58400, 1445, 888, '<td valign="top">not sure how the title fits but al the same a nice pic.  the tie is obviously colourful so i''d have liked to have seen more of it</td>', 'not sure how the title fits but al the same a nice pic.  the tie is obviously colourful so i''d have liked to have seen more of it', '2002-05-06 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58401, 1445, 933, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors &amp; composition, but that reflection on the corner of the botle is a bit distracting.  Diffused lighting might have helped.  Still, very nice photo.</td>', 'Very nice colors & composition, but that reflection on the corner of the botle is a bit distracting.  Diffused lighting might have helped.  Still, very nice photo.', '2002-05-06 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58402, 1445, 459, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, but the product has a cloudy look, there is a bubble in the label (kinda oof too) and the earrings are not in focus for sure.</td>', 'Nice setup, but the product has a cloudy look, there is a bubble in the label (kinda oof too) and the earrings are not in focus for sure.', '2002-05-06 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58403, 1445, 671, '<td valign="top">The earrings are a nice touch!  Looks like a pleasant evening ahead.</td>', 'The earrings are a nice touch!  Looks like a pleasant evening ahead.', '2002-05-06 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58404, 1445, 173, '<td valign="top">After shave and earrings? To each their own.</td>', 'After shave and earrings? To each their own.', '2002-05-06 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58405, 1445, 301, '<td valign="top">the lighting has created a wonderful mood for this photo.  Nicely done</td>', 'the lighting has created a wonderful mood for this photo.  Nicely done', '2002-05-07 07:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58406, 1445, 1037, '<td valign="top">I actually respond well to advertising photos like this one that tell a little story, even though I generally tune out ads. His tie, her earings.... well, maybe they''re not naked but they''re getting comfy on the couch in front of the fire :)<br/><br/>Very nicely lit, composed and photographed. I like it a lot :)</td>', 'I actually respond well to advertising photos like this one that tell a little story, even though I generally tune out ads. His tie, her earings.... well, maybe they''re not naked but they''re getting comfy on the couch in front of the fire :)Very nicely lit, composed and photographed. I like it a lot :)', '2002-05-07 08:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58407, 1445, 446, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and soft colors.  Very inviting to me.  The blown highlights may hurt you, unless some think if is part of the effect?  I rate this photo very high.  I think you are in contention for a ribbon.  Good job.</td>', 'Love the composition and soft colors.  Very inviting to me.  The blown highlights may hurt you, unless some think if is part of the effect?  I rate this photo very high.  I think you are in contention for a ribbon.  Good job.', '2002-05-07 09:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
