(58418, 1445, 543, '<td valign="top">I really like the warm tones here, and I finally found the #$%&amp; eye after reading a hint in the forums.  Pretty subtle - could be a fold in the necktie, and I''m not sure what subliminal effect an eye would have.  Now a jellybean, on the other hand...  The one thing that bugs me a little is the combination of the tie, aftershave and... earrings?  I guess it''s the old married couple''s dresser, but it could also be interpreted as a very bad fashion decision.  Also not wild about the lable on the bottle being turned quite so far right.  Probably better if the whole thing were legible.  All in all, and with a bonus for the reflection, a very nice image.</td>', 'I really like the warm tones here, and I finally found the #$%& eye after reading a hint in the forums.  Pretty subtle - could be a fold in the necktie, and I''m not sure what subliminal effect an eye would have.  Now a jellybean, on the other hand...  The one thing that bugs me a little is the combination of the tie, aftershave and... earrings?  I guess it''s the old married couple''s dresser, but it could also be interpreted as a very bad fashion decision.  Also not wild about the lable on the bottle being turned quite so far right.  Probably better if the whole thing were legible.  All in all, and with a bonus for the reflection, a very nice image.', '2002-05-10 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
