(58427, 1445, 637, '<td valign="top">Would like to see the entire label... what''s the thing in the lower right?</td>', 'Would like to see the entire label... what''s the thing in the lower right?', '2002-05-12 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58428, 1445, 1066, '<td valign="top">O.K....the background on this photo and stuff is a lot more interesting than the photo.  And if any of you have ever worked in advertising you know this is more the rule than the exception<br/>:-)<br/><br/>I have a female friend in Baltimore who runs a strip club.  The strip club owners face is in the bottle. Her eyes are stunning and I took a photo of her, pasted it to the back of the bottle and really hard lit the side of the bottle to get the photo to be clear enough.  I used the tie to obscure the eye a bit with reflections and curves that followed the face in the bottle...an old trick.<br/><br/>The "ear" rings are actually nipple rings, and the black background is a a velvet mini-dress used by one of the "working" girls..  <br/><br/>The aftershave was a gift from about 10 years ago ( I don''t even wear aftershave ) and I had to put some water in it becasue it was so old the fragrance has started to evaporate.  If you look real careful you can see the water and the alcohol fighting each other to mix.<br/><br/>When I worked in the graphics art department at Va Tech we used to hide all kinds of stuff in ad''s.  I was actually surprised no one else did any "sublimanal" stuff because subliminal messages are in so many national ad''s.</td>', 'O.K....the background on this photo and stuff is a lot more interesting than the photo.  And if any of you have ever worked in advertising you know this is more the rule than the exception:-)I have a female friend in Baltimore who runs a strip club.  The strip club owners face is in the bottle. Her eyes are stunning and I took a photo of her, pasted it to the back of the bottle and really hard lit the side of the bottle to get the photo to be clear enough.  I used the tie to obscure the eye a bit with reflections and curves that followed the face in the bottle...an old trick.The "ear" rings are actually nipple rings, and the black background is a a velvet mini-dress used by one of the "working" girls..  The aftershave was a gift from about 10 years ago ( I don''t even wear aftershave ) and I had to put some water in it becasue it was so old the fragrance has started to evaporate.  If you look real careful you can see the water and the alcohol fighting each other to mix.When I worked in the graphics art department at Va Tech we used to hide all kinds of stuff in ad''s.  I was actually surprised no one else did any "sublimanal" stuff because subliminal messages are in so many national ad''s.', '2002-05-13 08:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(58443, 1449, 441, '<td valign="top">focus looks to be out or maybe camera shake? did you use a tripod?</td>', 'focus looks to be out or maybe camera shake? did you use a tripod?', '2002-05-06 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
