(58503, 1452, 446, '<td valign="top">Absolutely outstanding creativity!!!  This is the toughest photo for me to evaluate.   I going back and forth on this one between a 9 and a 10.  Probably will not be able to settle on a score untill the very end.  Though the shot has good exposure, excellent focus for sharpness and detail,  and great composition,  I wish the shadow detail on the lower left and upper right sides would have been pulled out with fill lighting.  I''m not sure whether the shadow is the effect you were actually after?  Excellent effort.  I rate this one very high (9 or 10?).</td>', 'Absolutely outstanding creativity!!!  This is the toughest photo for me to evaluate.   I going back and forth on this one between a 9 and a 10.  Probably will not be able to settle on a score untill the very end.  Though the shot has good exposure, excellent focus for sharpness and detail,  and great composition,  I wish the shadow detail on the lower left and upper right sides would have been pulled out with fill lighting.  I''m not sure whether the shadow is the effect you were actually after?  Excellent effort.  I rate this one very high (9 or 10?).', '2002-05-07 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58504, 1452, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice use of B&amp;W.</td>', 'Nice use of B&W.', '2002-05-08 05:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
