(58530, 1455, 1175, '<td valign="top">Ug, all you light beer drinkers. Don''t worry I won''t hold it against you.  Its a good place to take a picture of a corono (the beach) but the the tree and the bottle is a bit too dark.</td>', 'Ug, all you light beer drinkers. Don''t worry I won''t hold it against you.  Its a good place to take a picture of a corono (the beach) but the the tree and the bottle is a bit too dark.', '2002-05-06 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
