(58588, 1456, 671, '<td valign="top">too much glare.</td>', 'too much glare.', '2002-05-06 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58589, 1456, 459, '<td valign="top">Good look, but foreground lighting is too bright and background is too dark.  Is the flag facing the right direction?</td>', 'Good look, but foreground lighting is too bright and background is too dark.  Is the flag facing the right direction?', '2002-05-06 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58590, 1456, 1344, '<td valign="top">LIghting on the hands is pretty harsh as is the shadow on the left guy''s neck.  And the flag''s backwards (yeah I know, no big deal -- but the Skoal marketing people aint gonna let that go in a magazine, etc..)  Oh yea, and the left guy''s fingers.</td>', 'LIghting on the hands is pretty harsh as is the shadow on the left guy''s neck.  And the flag''s backwards (yeah I know, no big deal -- but the Skoal marketing people aint gonna let that go in a magazine, etc..)  Oh yea, and the left guy''s fingers.', '2002-05-07 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58591, 1456, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m not American, so there could be a lot that I''m missing from this... but what does the flag have to do with whatever those Skoal things are? It''s just confusing to me.<br/><br/>There needs to be more light on the guys'' faces.</td>', 'I''m not American, so there could be a lot that I''m missing from this... but what does the flag have to do with whatever those Skoal things are? It''s just confusing to me.There needs to be more light on the guys'' faces.', '2002-05-07 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58592, 1456, 689, '<td valign="top">A little over exposed on the hands ... I would have lowered their hands slightly to get them off of their faces ... and I think the Skoal has had some adverse affects on the guy on the left ... he cant even put a cap on straight!</td>', 'A little over exposed on the hands ... I would have lowered their hands slightly to get them off of their faces ... and I think the Skoal has had some adverse affects on the guy on the left ... he cant even put a cap on straight!', '2002-05-07 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58593, 1456, 782, '<td valign="top">The flag is hung incorrectly, the union should always be to the upper left.  An advertisement shouldn''t miss a detail like that.</td>', 'The flag is hung incorrectly, the union should always be to the upper left.  An advertisement shouldn''t miss a detail like that.', '2002-05-07 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58594, 1456, 446, '<td valign="top">Nice try.  It appears the foreground is over exposed to the point of washing out the main subject.  There may be a different technique you might try for a similar shot in the future to get a more even exposure.</td>', 'Nice try.  It appears the foreground is over exposed to the point of washing out the main subject.  There may be a different technique you might try for a similar shot in the future to get a more even exposure.', '2002-05-07 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58595, 1456, 536, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of adverts I use to see in "local" papers and newletters when I lived in Texas.</td>', 'Reminds me of adverts I use to see in "local" papers and newletters when I lived in Texas.', '2002-05-08 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58596, 1456, 2, '<td valign="top">The flash is really harsh, as are the cast shadows.  Maybe some extra light to brighten up the flag, too?</td>', 'The flash is really harsh, as are the cast shadows.  Maybe some extra light to brighten up the flag, too?', '2002-05-08 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58597, 1456, 1523, '<td valign="top">An attnetion getter. I like the use of the flag.</td>', 'An attnetion getter. I like the use of the flag.', '2002-05-08 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58598, 1456, 1510, '<td valign="top">shadows distracting and not much depth.</td>', 'shadows distracting and not much depth.', '2002-05-09 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58599, 1456, 554, '<td valign="top">are those guys twins? good shot for a bad product ---used to love the wintergreen  --9, only because cans are different sizes.</td>', 'are those guys twins? good shot for a bad product ---used to love the wintergreen  --9, only because cans are different sizes.', '2002-05-10 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58600, 1456, 844, '<td valign="top">I was always taught the flag wasn''t supposed to be used in advertisement &amp;lt;shrug&amp;gt; call it a pet peeve.</td>', 'I was always taught the flag wasn''t supposed to be used in advertisement &lt;shrug&gt; call it a pet peeve.', '2002-05-10 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58601, 1456, 1467, '<td valign="top">Flag is backwards</td>', 'Flag is backwards', '2002-05-10 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58602, 1456, 811, '<td valign="top">If any advertisment would appeal to a target audience, this one would.  Only two recommendations:  wintergreen guy needs to put his finger down to get rid of the shadow on his neck, and mint guy''s hat needs to be a different color -- it blends with the flag.  Did you mean for the shirt to have a german word on it?  Good picture.</td>', 'If any advertisment would appeal to a target audience, this one would.  Only two recommendations:  wintergreen guy needs to put his finger down to get rid of the shadow on his neck, and mint guy''s hat needs to be a different color -- it blends with the flag.  Did you mean for the shirt to have a german word on it?  Good picture.', '2002-05-12 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58603, 1456, 509, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like this one.  I hate that stuff personally, and I don''t think the title is befitting.  Lighting also seems a bit bland</td>', 'I don''t really like this one.  I hate that stuff personally, and I don''t think the title is befitting.  Lighting also seems a bit bland', '2002-05-12 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58604, 1456, 587, '<td valign="top">I would have perhaps done a comparison for this ad - before and after lip and/or tongue cancer. Besides being nasty filthy disgusting habit, this ad could have used better lighting (too many shadows)</td>', 'I would have perhaps done a comparison for this ad - before and after lip and/or tongue cancer. Besides being nasty filthy disgusting habit, this ad could have used better lighting (too many shadows)', '2002-05-12 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58605, 1456, 1, '<td valign="top">The flash drowns out the picture.  I would like to have seen more symmetry.</td>', 'The flash drowns out the picture.  I would like to have seen more symmetry.', '2002-05-12 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(58606, 1456, 637, '<td valign="top">But made somewhere in Scandinavia???</td>', 'But made somewhere in Scandinavia???', '2002-05-12 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58607, 1459, 1360, '<td valign="top">the "SKYY" label looks a bit washed out.</td>', 'the "SKYY" label looks a bit washed out.', '2002-05-06 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58608, 1459, 472, '<td valign="top">your camera metered for the brightness of the scene, therefore rendering the objects of interest overly dark.</td>', 'your camera metered for the brightness of the scene, therefore rendering the objects of interest overly dark.', '2002-05-06 08:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58609, 1459, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely composed photo... I like it!  The lighting is just a *tad* harsh... the label on the Skyy bottle is a little hard to distinguish... good job!</td>', 'This is a nicely composed photo... I like it!  The lighting is just a *tad* harsh... the label on the Skyy bottle is a little hard to distinguish... good job!', '2002-05-06 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58610, 1459, 449, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2002-05-06 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58611, 1459, 327, '<td valign="top">I almost love this shot. The blue bottle is lost because of the light. I do love the natural light here. Also the glass in titlted which could of been okay with a different background. Good job all the same. LEJON is in nice focus.<br/>P.S. cute title too.</td>', 'I almost love this shot. The blue bottle is lost because of the light. I do love the natural light here. Also the glass in titlted which could of been okay with a different background. Good job all the same. LEJON is in nice focus.P.S. cute title too.', '2002-05-06 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58612, 1459, 813, '<td valign="top">The idea is on the right track. The image itself could be improved with better lighting, more diffuse. Also if you put a thin mirror behind the bottle and shine light into it at an angle you can effectively light the bottle from behind.</td>', 'The idea is on the right track. The image itself could be improved with better lighting, more diffuse. Also if you put a thin mirror behind the bottle and shine light into it at an angle you can effectively light the bottle from behind.', '2002-05-06 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58613, 1459, 1005, '<td valign="top">Better than most boozer adverts!  The SKYY bottle could be more clearly displayed, or at least I would hope so.  Photo 9  Advert 8 Creativity 9 total 9</td>', 'Better than most boozer adverts!  The SKYY bottle could be more clearly displayed, or at least I would hope so.  Photo 9  Advert 8 Creativity 9 total 9', '2002-05-06 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58614, 1459, 1357, '<td valign="top">Very nive photo but I don`t like olives.</td>', 'Very nive photo but I don`t like olives.', '2002-05-06 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58615, 1459, 878, '<td valign="top">The natural background and environment is tough to shoot on without artificial lighting sources.  The sky vodka is too dark and the tilted glass is a bit distracting.</td>', 'The natural background and environment is tough to shoot on without artificial lighting sources.  The sky vodka is too dark and the tilted glass is a bit distracting.', '2002-05-06 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58616, 1459, 1233, '<td valign="top">i think this pic. would have been more appealing under an indoor setting ... distracted by the surroundings.<br/></td>', 'i think this pic. would have been more appealing under an indoor setting ... distracted by the surroundings.', '2002-05-06 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58617, 1459, 459, '<td valign="top">Can''t read the Sky bottle and the vermouth label has a big shadow.</td>', 'Can''t read the Sky bottle and the vermouth label has a big shadow.', '2002-05-06 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58618, 1459, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and clarity, but the sunlight seems to wash this out a bit, however, it does make some nice sparkles in the glasses</td>', 'I like the subject and clarity, but the sunlight seems to wash this out a bit, however, it does make some nice sparkles in the glasses', '2002-05-06 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58619, 1459, 1485, '<td valign="top">Title is way too long.</td>', 'Title is way too long.', '2002-05-07 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58620, 1459, 888, '<td valign="top">shaken not stirred I hop<br/>nice setup though I think the blue bottle distracts as theres not enough detail on it</td>', 'shaken not stirred I hopnice setup though I think the blue bottle distracts as theres not enough detail on it', '2002-05-07 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58621, 1459, 797, '<td valign="top">Love the DRY background. And nice contrast of blue bottle and white label. Nicely done.</td>', 'Love the DRY background. And nice contrast of blue bottle and white label. Nicely done.', '2002-05-07 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58622, 1459, 1350, '<td valign="top">Wonderful choice of background and lighting...</td>', 'Wonderful choice of background and lighting...', '2002-05-07 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58623, 1459, 656, '<td valign="top">sky bottle is bit underexposed/ under lit</td>', 'sky bottle is bit underexposed/ under lit', '2002-05-08 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58624, 1459, 415, '<td valign="top">Great idea for a photo - It would have been nice to see a little bit more of the vodka bottle.  It''s a bit hard to read.   Nice set up though.</td>', 'Great idea for a photo - It would have been nice to see a little bit more of the vodka bottle.  It''s a bit hard to read.   Nice set up though.', '2002-05-08 08:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58625, 1459, 301, '<td valign="top">not sure I really like the martini glass tilted, and the Skyy bottle seems a bit too dark to me.</td>', 'not sure I really like the martini glass tilted, and the Skyy bottle seems a bit too dark to me.', '2002-05-08 09:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58626, 1459, 527, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea but I think it could have been executed better. It''s difficult to read the Skyy bottle and I think the arrangement could be improved.</td>', 'It''s a good idea but I think it could have been executed better. It''s difficult to read the Skyy bottle and I think the arrangement could be improved.', '2002-05-08 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58627, 1459, 554, '<td valign="top">should have shown the entire name</td>', 'should have shown the entire name', '2002-05-08 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58628, 1459, 142, '<td valign="top">Nice setting.  I like the sunlight on the Skyy bottle.</td>', 'Nice setting.  I like the sunlight on the Skyy bottle.', '2002-05-09 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58629, 1459, 1510, '<td valign="top">excellent idea but dont really like both bottles in the shot.  great use of lighting and glassware.  <br/></td>', 'excellent idea but dont really like both bottles in the shot.  great use of lighting and glassware.  ', '2002-05-09 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58630, 1459, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and good set-up.  Cropping the dark side of the rock/ledge from bottom would have made it better to me.</td>', 'Nice shot, and good set-up.  Cropping the dark side of the rock/ledge from bottom would have made it better to me.', '2002-05-09 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58631, 1459, 441, '<td valign="top">ok, get it now - on the rocks of course! - I''m a bit slow :&amp;gt;)</td>', 'ok, get it now - on the rocks of course! - I''m a bit slow :&gt;)', '2002-05-09 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58632, 1459, 674, '<td valign="top">I liked your concept but not your lighting it was abit dark</td>', 'I liked your concept but not your lighting it was abit dark', '2002-05-10 05:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58633, 1459, 1, '<td valign="top">Odd placement of items.  Alcohol + Sun = Sick.  :)  Also, are you selling the Skyy or the Lejon?</td>', 'Odd placement of items.  Alcohol + Sun = Sick.  :)  Also, are you selling the Skyy or the Lejon?', '2002-05-12 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58634, 1461, 117, '<td valign="top">too much sparkle</td>', 'too much sparkle', '2002-05-06 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58635, 1461, 142, '<td valign="top">Wow, how did you get those points of light in just the right places?  I love this.</td>', 'Wow, how did you get those points of light in just the right places?  I love this.', '2002-05-06 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58636, 1461, 1344, '<td valign="top">Holy star filter Batman!</td>', 'Holy star filter Batman!', '2002-05-06 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58637, 1461, 205, '<td valign="top">uneffective cant see the name</td>', 'uneffective cant see the name', '2002-05-06 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58638, 1461, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice concept but the lighting is a little harsh.. The watch is off center enough that it''s distracting...</td>', 'This is a nice concept but the lighting is a little harsh.. The watch is off center enough that it''s distracting...', '2002-05-06 04:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58639, 1461, 92, '<td valign="top">I like this. I think the one bright spot on the rim of the face at the top and all the sparkle don''t mix with the dullness around the rest of the face frame. It''s still up there with me.</td>', 'I like this. I think the one bright spot on the rim of the face at the top and all the sparkle don''t mix with the dullness around the rest of the face frame. It''s still up there with me.', '2002-05-06 06:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58640, 1461, 1040, '<td valign="top">Sparkle, sparkle, sparkle... Wher''d the watch go???<br/></td>', 'Sparkle, sparkle, sparkle... Wher''d the watch go???', '2002-05-06 06:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58641, 1461, 472, '<td valign="top">i would say overdone on the catchlights, but i think this is a great effort!</td>', 'i would say overdone on the catchlights, but i think this is a great effort!', '2002-05-06 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58642, 1461, 570, '<td valign="top">too dark, and the sparkles take away from the face of the watch.</td>', 'too dark, and the sparkles take away from the face of the watch.', '2002-05-06 08:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58643, 1461, 862, '<td valign="top">Use indirect light to avoid the reflections.</td>', 'Use indirect light to avoid the reflections.', '2002-05-06 08:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58644, 1461, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, harsh glare at the top of the face is distracting.<br/>Fine work here.</td>', 'Pretty shot, harsh glare at the top of the face is distracting.Fine work here.', '2002-05-06 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58645, 1461, 715, '<td valign="top">The sparks are very nice, but the watch seems to be out of focus.</td>', 'The sparks are very nice, but the watch seems to be out of focus.', '2002-05-06 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58646, 1461, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice advert, very shiny!  Nice use of starry filter.  Photo 9 Advert 9 Creativity 8  total 9  (what are the words on the face of the watch under Piere Cardin?)</td>', 'Nice advert, very shiny!  Nice use of starry filter.  Photo 9 Advert 9 Creativity 8  total 9  (what are the words on the face of the watch under Piere Cardin?)', '2002-05-06 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58647, 1461, 1485, '<td valign="top">very cool.. the only thing missing is the text to close the sale.</td>', 'very cool.. the only thing missing is the text to close the sale.', '2002-05-06 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58648, 1461, 259, '<td valign="top">the lighting is overdone</td>', 'the lighting is overdone', '2002-05-06 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58649, 1461, 1204, '<td valign="top">This filter you use doesn''t appeal to me... but I guess that''s only my oppinion...</td>', 'This filter you use doesn''t appeal to me... but I guess that''s only my oppinion...', '2002-05-06 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58650, 1461, 1226, '<td valign="top">Nice flares, but I woudl have liked to see a bit more detail on the face.</td>', 'Nice flares, but I woudl have liked to see a bit more detail on the face.', '2002-05-06 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58651, 1461, 139, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Maybe a little overdone.  Other than that, perfect!</td>', 'Wow!  Maybe a little overdone.  Other than that, perfect!', '2002-05-06 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58652, 1461, 459, '<td valign="top">I know you went for sparkle, but maybe overdone.  It makes the face of the watch illegible.  All advertisers want the product''s name to be readable.</td>', 'I know you went for sparkle, but maybe overdone.  It makes the face of the watch illegible.  All advertisers want the product''s name to be readable.', '2002-05-06 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58653, 1461, 1336, '<td valign="top">i think you overdid the "shining" effect.</td>', 'i think you overdid the "shining" effect.', '2002-05-06 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58654, 1461, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s too sparkly... kinda like an early 80s advertisement. I don''t think the blue background sets off the watch very well, it makes the silver seem harder and cold.</td>', 'It''s too sparkly... kinda like an early 80s advertisement. I don''t think the blue background sets off the watch very well, it makes the silver seem harder and cold.', '2002-05-07 04:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58655, 1461, 436, '<td valign="top">too much sparkle</td>', 'too much sparkle', '2002-05-07 09:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58656, 1461, 888, '<td valign="top">I htink the shiny bits are too shiny</td>', 'I htink the shiny bits are too shiny', '2002-05-07 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58657, 1461, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the reflection is a but much at this angle.</td>', 'Nice, but the reflection is a but much at this angle.', '2002-05-07 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58658, 1461, 280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but the star effect just seems a little too much.</td>', 'Nice shot but the star effect just seems a little too much.', '2002-05-07 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58659, 1461, 671, '<td valign="top">too shiny.<br/></td>', 'too shiny.', '2002-05-07 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58660, 1461, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice work, but think I would have tried to minimize the bright flash reflection at the 12 o'' clock position.  The rest of them make it look luxurious.</td>', 'Nice work, but think I would have tried to minimize the bright flash reflection at the 12 o'' clock position.  The rest of them make it look luxurious.', '2002-05-07 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58661, 1461, 714, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light sparkles, but I think it might be a bit much.  I would have liked to see the name on the watch and not the title.</td>', 'I like the way the light sparkles, but I think it might be a bit much.  I would have liked to see the name on the watch and not the title.', '2002-05-07 19:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58662, 1461, 656, '<td valign="top">the ''star filter'' effect works very well to make a feature out of the reflections.</td>', 'the ''star filter'' effect works very well to make a feature out of the reflections.', '2002-05-08 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58663, 1461, 301, '<td valign="top">it''s a great effect (star filter I assume), but I think that there you''ve ended up taking away from the actual watch face itself</td>', 'it''s a great effect (star filter I assume), but I think that there you''ve ended up taking away from the actual watch face itself', '2002-05-08 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58664, 1461, 527, '<td valign="top">This is really cool and I give it high marks for sure but I think it could be helped if it actually had a little less lighlights.</td>', 'This is really cool and I give it high marks for sure but I think it could be helped if it actually had a little less lighlights.', '2002-05-08 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58665, 1461, 661, '<td valign="top">The star pattern on the band is good.  Didn''t like the flare on the watch edge, definitely detracted.</td>', 'The star pattern on the band is good.  Didn''t like the flare on the watch edge, definitely detracted.', '2002-05-08 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58666, 1461, 554, '<td valign="top">i see your title but i can''t read it on the watch</td>', 'i see your title but i can''t read it on the watch', '2002-05-08 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58667, 1461, 843, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the twinkling, but it''s a bit off center.</td>', 'Nice effect with the twinkling, but it''s a bit off center.', '2002-05-09 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58668, 1461, 543, '<td valign="top">Your starlight filter has taken over.</td>', 'Your starlight filter has taken over.', '2002-05-10 03:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58669, 1461, 878, '<td valign="top">This is nice but the star filter is almost too much, an dthe image is a bit on the soft side.  The top of the watch is a bit too bright.</td>', 'This is nice but the star filter is almost too much, an dthe image is a bit on the soft side.  The top of the watch is a bit too bright.', '2002-05-10 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58670, 1461, 441, '<td valign="top">nice effects without losing watchface</td>', 'nice effects without losing watchface', '2002-05-10 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58671, 1461, 1191, '<td valign="top">Looks professional</td>', 'Looks professional', '2002-05-10 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58672, 1461, 1, '<td valign="top">Pierre Cardin ?  The bling-bling makes it look a little blurry.  You also cut off the bottom of the watch, which doesnt aid in the overall effect.  I don''t think the blue background works either.</td>', 'Pierre Cardin ?  The bling-bling makes it look a little blurry.  You also cut off the bottom of the watch, which doesnt aid in the overall effect.  I don''t think the blue background works either.', '2002-05-10 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58673, 1461, 901, '<td valign="top">bling bling</td>', 'bling bling', '2002-05-10 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58674, 1461, 1078, '<td valign="top">I like the starlight filter -- but the highlights are a little too bright, I think.  The fact that the watch is JUST off center bothers me, as do the crooked band skewed over to the left at the bottom and the way it''s cut off at the top (this only because it goes all the way off the image at the bottom).</td>', 'I like the starlight filter -- but the highlights are a little too bright, I think.  The fact that the watch is JUST off center bothers me, as do the crooked band skewed over to the left at the bottom and the way it''s cut off at the top (this only because it goes all the way off the image at the bottom).', '2002-05-12 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58675, 1461, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good concept, the focus on dial is lacking the detail needed to sell the product.   I don''t see the story that I feel is essential to sell.</td>', 'Good concept, the focus on dial is lacking the detail needed to sell the product.   I don''t see the story that I feel is essential to sell.', '2002-05-12 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
