(58763, 1463, 139, '<td valign="top">Nice green grass, and great angle, witht he ball coming up just above the horizon.  Great advertisement!  Nice attention to detail, choosing the number ''1'' ball.  My only complaint is the intrusion by the hill above the horizontal line on the left.</td>', 'Nice green grass, and great angle, witht he ball coming up just above the horizon.  Great advertisement!  Nice attention to detail, choosing the number ''1'' ball.  My only complaint is the intrusion by the hill above the horizontal line on the left.', '2002-05-12 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58764, 1464, 92, '<td valign="top">Now that looks cold ! The only flaw I see is the background in the top right. I would have cut that off. Nice work.</td>', 'Now that looks cold ! The only flaw I see is the background in the top right. I would have cut that off. Nice work.', '2002-05-06 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58765, 1464, 1325, '<td valign="top">Excellent<br/></td>', 'Excellent', '2002-05-06 06:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58766, 1464, 142, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and angle.</td>', 'Good lighting and angle.', '2002-05-06 09:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58767, 1464, 1175, '<td valign="top">Ug, horrible beer.  Don''t worry I won''t hold it against you. :)  I don''t like the really low angle you have here though.  The lighting may have just been a little too hard.  There is a spot on the glass at the base where its really bright and its distracting.</td>', 'Ug, horrible beer.  Don''t worry I won''t hold it against you. :)  I don''t like the really low angle you have here though.  The lighting may have just been a little too hard.  There is a spot on the glass at the base where its really bright and its distracting.', '2002-05-06 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58768, 1464, 1005, '<td valign="top">This works better than most boozer adverts, but I still want to "see the good times".  More action in the beer might have been nice, too.  Photo 10 Advert 9 Creativity 8<br/>total 9</td>', 'This works better than most boozer adverts, but I still want to "see the good times".  More action in the beer might have been nice, too.  Photo 10 Advert 9 Creativity 8total 9', '2002-05-06 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58769, 1464, 327, '<td valign="top">Rocky mountian high....<br/>nice light, good perspective.<br/>Small nit the glare at the bottom of the glass.<br/></td>', 'Rocky mountian high....nice light, good perspective.Small nit the glare at the bottom of the glass.', '2002-05-06 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58770, 1464, 259, '<td valign="top">very nice perspective</td>', 'very nice perspective', '2002-05-06 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58771, 1464, 772, '<td valign="top">Dude!!  This is a pilsner glass!!  Just kidding :)  i think that ALL beer ads should show a nice rich head on the beer.   On the top right side of this shot, there is a little background ''noise'' that possibly could have been cropped out for a higher impact shot.  The lighting here may be a tad strong but the overall quality of this photograph is very nice!  Good work!</td>', 'Dude!!  This is a pilsner glass!!  Just kidding :)  i think that ALL beer ads should show a nice rich head on the beer.   On the top right side of this shot, there is a little background ''noise'' that possibly could have been cropped out for a higher impact shot.  The lighting here may be a tad strong but the overall quality of this photograph is very nice!  Good work!', '2002-05-06 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58772, 1464, 878, '<td valign="top">You have the right idea on this shot however barrel distortion makes the glass and can look like they''re leaning in.  I like the water on the glass and the black background works pretty well too.  I wont judge you on the bla beer though :)</td>', 'You have the right idea on this shot however barrel distortion makes the glass and can look like they''re leaning in.  I like the water on the glass and the black background works pretty well too.  I wont judge you on the bla beer though :)', '2002-05-06 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58773, 1464, 888, '<td valign="top">nice but the glass, being so much taller than the can makes the two appear to be froma differnt perspective</td>', 'nice but the glass, being so much taller than the can makes the two appear to be froma differnt perspective', '2002-05-06 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58774, 1464, 459, '<td valign="top">Can looks good, glass and beer are unappetizing.</td>', 'Can looks good, glass and beer are unappetizing.', '2002-05-06 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58775, 1464, 509, '<td valign="top">Wow, nicely done, like the lighting and the water droplets on the glass and can</td>', 'Wow, nicely done, like the lighting and the water droplets on the glass and can', '2002-05-06 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58776, 1464, 255, '<td valign="top">very refreshing!</td>', 'very refreshing!', '2002-05-07 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58777, 1464, 1037, '<td valign="top">Bleh, American beer :P<br/><br/>Nice photo, but the lighting needs more control for this kind of thing, considering there are bright highlights on the front of the glass and the can. Advertising shots avoid that kind of distraction. The camera angle also makes the composition a little bit awkward, because the perspective makes the verticle lines slant a bit.</td>', 'Bleh, American beer :PNice photo, but the lighting needs more control for this kind of thing, considering there are bright highlights on the front of the glass and the can. Advertising shots avoid that kind of distraction. The camera angle also makes the composition a little bit awkward, because the perspective makes the verticle lines slant a bit.', '2002-05-07 07:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58778, 1464, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.  Maybe a little too much reflection from the flash.  I haven''t tried it myself, but have been told that you can deflect the flash with an index card to minimize the reflection.</td>', 'Nice angle.  Maybe a little too much reflection from the flash.  I haven''t tried it myself, but have been told that you can deflect the flash with an index card to minimize the reflection.', '2002-05-07 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58779, 1464, 215, '<td valign="top">I think the emphasis should be more on the beer can... Right now, the perspective makes the glass a lot more outstanding.</td>', 'I think the emphasis should be more on the beer can... Right now, the perspective makes the glass a lot more outstanding.', '2002-05-07 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58780, 1464, 2, '<td valign="top">Having just visited Colorado over sprint break, I became quite familiar with the silver rockies.  Did you try this shot with a background?  I just wonder if it would be distracting or helpful.</td>', 'Having just visited Colorado over sprint break, I became quite familiar with the silver rockies.  Did you try this shot with a background?  I just wonder if it would be distracting or helpful.', '2002-05-08 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58781, 1464, 472, '<td valign="top">pour me one.</td>', 'pour me one.', '2002-05-08 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58782, 1464, 527, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective but I would have placed it on a light colored surface, not neccessarily reflective, just something brighter so it doesn''t look like it is floating. Kind of miner though, I really like it.</td>', 'Excellent perspective but I would have placed it on a light colored surface, not neccessarily reflective, just something brighter so it doesn''t look like it is floating. Kind of miner though, I really like it.', '2002-05-08 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58783, 1464, 446, '<td valign="top">Nice inviting setup of the photo with the droplets on the can and glass.  I would have prefered a lighting technique that avoided the blown highlights and reflections.  The horizontal line just above the base of the subjects is also distracting?  You might want to consider a longer angle lens for a similar shot to avoid the converging perspective, unless this was your intended effect?  Good effort.</td>', 'Nice inviting setup of the photo with the droplets on the can and glass.  I would have prefered a lighting technique that avoided the blown highlights and reflections.  The horizontal line just above the base of the subjects is also distracting?  You might want to consider a longer angle lens for a similar shot to avoid the converging perspective, unless this was your intended effect?  Good effort.', '2002-05-09 08:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58784, 1464, 675, '<td valign="top">should have removed the condensation off of the can and maybe not used as strong of a flash oas you did, it looks pretty washed out</td>', 'should have removed the condensation off of the can and maybe not used as strong of a flash oas you did, it looks pretty washed out', '2002-05-09 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58785, 1464, 280, '<td valign="top">The top RHC looks a bit iffy maybe you could have cropped this out?</td>', 'The top RHC looks a bit iffy maybe you could have cropped this out?', '2002-05-09 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58786, 1464, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice height to the picture, my eye is really drawn upwards -- which led me to the top of your backdrop.  Oops.  Watch that crop.</td>', 'Nice height to the picture, my eye is really drawn upwards -- which led me to the top of your backdrop.  Oops.  Watch that crop.', '2002-05-09 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58787, 1464, 1209, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Both look a little tipsy!</td>', 'Nicely done. Both look a little tipsy!', '2002-05-09 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58788, 1464, 543, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Very clean and sharp, with no distracting elements aside from those reflections.  The upward angle has caused some perspective distortion - the can and glass lean towards eachother.  Not a big deal, but it does feel a little odd looking up through the glass.  That''s a wicked hotspot at the bottom.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Very clean and sharp, with no distracting elements aside from those reflections.  The upward angle has caused some perspective distortion - the can and glass lean towards eachother.  Not a big deal, but it does feel a little odd looking up through the glass.  That''s a wicked hotspot at the bottom.', '2002-05-10 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58789, 1464, 1191, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, shame that the sides of the can have converged</td>', 'Nice shot, shame that the sides of the can have converged', '2002-05-10 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58790, 1464, 554, '<td valign="top">I like your lighting.  This shot makes me want to try this and see if you can make the two items lean in the same direction.</td>', 'I like your lighting.  This shot makes me want to try this and see if you can make the two items lean in the same direction.', '2002-05-11 08:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58791, 1464, 326, '<td valign="top">I think you did a great job with this shot.</td>', 'I think you did a great job with this shot.', '2002-05-11 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58792, 1464, 1580, '<td valign="top">The glare and reflection on the front of the glass detract from it a bit.  I might have preferred if the glass was somehow lit from behind to show the contents sort of "glowing".   I don''t exactly know how this would have been done to preserve the stark black background, but I''m sure it is possible.  Maybe a concentrated light source shining right down into the glass from above, as to not disrupt the rest of the picture.  I must also say that it seems slightly uninteresting in my opinion, but I still like it.</td>', 'The glare and reflection on the front of the glass detract from it a bit.  I might have preferred if the glass was somehow lit from behind to show the contents sort of "glowing".   I don''t exactly know how this would have been done to preserve the stark black background, but I''m sure it is possible.  Maybe a concentrated light source shining right down into the glass from above, as to not disrupt the rest of the picture.  I must also say that it seems slightly uninteresting in my opinion, but I still like it.', '2002-05-12 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58793, 1464, 1202, '<td valign="top">Boy, that''s inviting.   Loks like an ad to me.</td>', 'Boy, that''s inviting.   Loks like an ad to me.', '2002-05-12 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58794, 1464, 587, '<td valign="top">great photo. fave of beer ad''s. appears to float and be larger than life. :)</td>', 'great photo. fave of beer ad''s. appears to float and be larger than life. :)', '2002-05-12 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58795, 1464, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice condensation going on, interesting angle -- though I would''ve chosen a more downward approach to show the top of the can that we all know so well.</td>', 'Nice condensation going on, interesting angle -- though I would''ve chosen a more downward approach to show the top of the can that we all know so well.', '2002-05-12 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58796, 1464, 637, '<td valign="top">The beer needs a head.  Perspective from the ground up is semi-effective.</td>', 'The beer needs a head.  Perspective from the ground up is semi-effective.', '2002-05-12 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58797, 1465, 441, '<td valign="top">cleverly done, nice colouring but pity about the burnt out white.</td>', 'cleverly done, nice colouring but pity about the burnt out white.', '2002-05-06 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58798, 1465, 117, '<td valign="top">the white is keeping it from a higher scrore</td>', 'the white is keeping it from a higher scrore', '2002-05-06 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58799, 1465, 1360, '<td valign="top">White is a bit washed out, but its still a beautifully done shot</td>', 'White is a bit washed out, but its still a beautifully done shot', '2002-05-06 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58800, 1465, 92, '<td valign="top">This is a winner ! I love it ! GREAT job !</td>', 'This is a winner ! I love it ! GREAT job !', '2002-05-06 06:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58801, 1465, 1175, '<td valign="top">Did you copy this out of a magazine?  That is really good.  Is that real grass? Was it shot in sunlight?  The only complaint I have is that there is too much light.  You can''t even see any texture on the front of that towel.</td>', 'Did you copy this out of a magazine?  That is really good.  Is that real grass? Was it shot in sunlight?  The only complaint I have is that there is too much light.  You can''t even see any texture on the front of that towel.', '2002-05-06 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58802, 1465, 1, '<td valign="top">Hehehe.  The snuggle bear FAKE on the right made me laugh a little bit.  Great shot, and the background you put up looks great too.</td>', 'Hehehe.  The snuggle bear FAKE on the right made me laugh a little bit.  Great shot, and the background you put up looks great too.', '2002-05-06 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58803, 1465, 570, '<td valign="top">is that snuggle''s cousin?</td>', 'is that snuggle''s cousin?', '2002-05-06 08:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58804, 1465, 813, '<td valign="top">Wow, it''s clear you went to quite some effort to make this shot; cloud background, well placed flowers, props, etc. It would be much better if the lighting was as soft as the the theme. The harsh blown out highlights kinda spoil it.</td>', 'Wow, it''s clear you went to quite some effort to make this shot; cloud background, well placed flowers, props, etc. It would be much better if the lighting was as soft as the the theme. The harsh blown out highlights kinda spoil it.', '2002-05-06 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58805, 1465, 1024, '<td valign="top">Great commercial.</td>', 'Great commercial.', '2002-05-06 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(58806, 1465, 327, '<td valign="top">Not sure of all that you''ve done here? Painted, and filters? It''s attractive, and it''s selling Snuggle.</td>', 'Not sure of all that you''ve done here? Painted, and filters? It''s attractive, and it''s selling Snuggle.', '2002-05-06 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58807, 1465, 835, '<td valign="top">I like</td>', 'I like', '2002-05-06 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58808, 1465, 1483, '<td valign="top">The snuggle imposter is pretty cool</td>', 'The snuggle imposter is pretty cool', '2002-05-06 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58809, 1465, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  The white towel is a bit overexposed, but otherwise great!!!  Photo 9 Advert 10 Creativity 8 total 9</td>', 'Great photo.  The white towel is a bit overexposed, but otherwise great!!!  Photo 9 Advert 10 Creativity 8 total 9', '2002-05-06 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58810, 1465, 772, '<td valign="top">I can smell this fabric softener as I look at this photo.  Nice job!</td>', 'I can smell this fabric softener as I look at this photo.  Nice job!', '2002-05-06 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58811, 1465, 459, '<td valign="top">Nice set up.  Towel is kind of blown out and dandelion in foreground out of focus.</td>', 'Nice set up.  Towel is kind of blown out and dandelion in foreground out of focus.', '2002-05-06 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58812, 1465, 671, '<td valign="top">nice idea, good colors, too much bright on the white.</td>', 'nice idea, good colors, too much bright on the white.', '2002-05-06 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58813, 1465, 173, '<td valign="top">Late at night, Snuggles bites!</td>', 'Late at night, Snuggles bites!', '2002-05-06 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58814, 1465, 1336, '<td valign="top">this is pretty good.  would have been better with the actual snuggle soft bear, but they''re probably not easy to come by.</td>', 'this is pretty good.  would have been better with the actual snuggle soft bear, but they''re probably not easy to come by.', '2002-05-06 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58815, 1465, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is well executed, especially the lighting. The white on the towel seems to have blown out a bit though. I don''t really think it''s very effective to just reproduce the imagery from the front of the product itself though... it''s kinda repetitive.</td>', 'This is well executed, especially the lighting. The white on the towel seems to have blown out a bit though. I don''t really think it''s very effective to just reproduce the imagery from the front of the product itself though... it''s kinda repetitive.', '2002-05-07 03:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58816, 1465, 1485, '<td valign="top">This is actually a very good shot.. but what kills it for me is that the bear is not the same bear.  You''ve chosen an easily recognizable subject.. and its done well.. but not seeing the bear I''m used to seeing makes this one a tough call.</td>', 'This is actually a very good shot.. but what kills it for me is that the bear is not the same bear.  You''ve chosen an easily recognizable subject.. and its done well.. but not seeing the bear I''m used to seeing makes this one a tough call.', '2002-05-07 07:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58817, 1465, 446, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  It looks like you have overexposed to the point of washing out much of the detail.  Keep up the effort.</td>', 'Great idea.  It looks like you have overexposed to the point of washing out much of the detail.  Keep up the effort.', '2002-05-07 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58818, 1465, 714, '<td valign="top">What''s up with all the squigles behind the cloud fabric?  Other then that I really like it.</td>', 'What''s up with all the squigles behind the cloud fabric?  Other then that I really like it.', '2002-05-07 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58819, 1465, 656, '<td valign="top">very set up, but very well done, with that.</td>', 'very set up, but very well done, with that.', '2002-05-08 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58820, 1465, 472, '<td valign="top">very very well done. the background is the coup de grace.  yeah it''s a little overly lit/pushed levels, and i understand you were going for clean and fresh but it''s still a bit much.  also too much space to the left of the jug.  should have gone in tighter.</td>', 'very very well done. the background is the coup de grace.  yeah it''s a little overly lit/pushed levels, and i understand you were going for clean and fresh but it''s still a bit much.  also too much space to the left of the jug.  should have gone in tighter.', '2002-05-08 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58821, 1465, 715, '<td valign="top">Very nice advertisement. The white towel seems to be overexposed though.</td>', 'Very nice advertisement. The white towel seems to be overexposed though.', '2002-05-08 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58822, 1465, 616, '<td valign="top">very sharp picture, the blanket seems a bit too white</td>', 'very sharp picture, the blanket seems a bit too white', '2002-05-08 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58823, 1465, 527, '<td valign="top">This is really nice but the towl is a little overexposed.</td>', 'This is really nice but the towl is a little overexposed.', '2002-05-08 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58824, 1465, 875, '<td valign="top">The photo does a nice job of duplicating the ad, but the towel is too bright and the details are washed out.  I love the dandelions!</td>', 'The photo does a nice job of duplicating the ad, but the towel is too bright and the details are washed out.  I love the dandelions!', '2002-05-08 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58825, 1465, 675, '<td valign="top">how did you get the towel and bear to look so fake? you must tell afterwards...this is a great ad</td>', 'how did you get the towel and bear to look so fake? you must tell afterwards...this is a great ad', '2002-05-09 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58826, 1465, 544, '<td valign="top">I think I gave this photo a high score because of the color in it, as well as the nicely in-focus grass. The only aspect of this photo that bugs me is the white blanket. You want really vibrant colors to show off how great the softener is, but here it is so white that it loses its texture. It might have been better to try other colors of blankets, if you had not done so. Maybe even a more "warm" color would have done well. Nice shot, though :)</td>', 'I think I gave this photo a high score because of the color in it, as well as the nicely in-focus grass. The only aspect of this photo that bugs me is the white blanket. You want really vibrant colors to show off how great the softener is, but here it is so white that it loses its texture. It might have been better to try other colors of blankets, if you had not done so. Maybe even a more "warm" color would have done well. Nice shot, though :)', '2002-05-09 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58827, 1465, 1510, '<td valign="top">is this called plagerism? creatitivity lacks photo lacks depth and contrast.</td>', 'is this called plagerism? creatitivity lacks photo lacks depth and contrast.', '2002-05-09 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58828, 1465, 1141, '<td valign="top">Cute!!!</td>', 'Cute!!!', '2002-05-09 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58829, 1465, 1209, '<td valign="top">Sure a bright, cheery picture, nice focus, and neat backdrop. The towel is a  little blownout though. A tad darker would probably cure that. But, good job.</td>', 'Sure a bright, cheery picture, nice focus, and neat backdrop. The towel is a  little blownout though. A tad darker would probably cure that. But, good job.', '2002-05-09 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58830, 1465, 543, '<td valign="top">Pretty wicked overexposure on the top of the bottle and the towel.  Nice colors, though.</td>', 'Pretty wicked overexposure on the top of the bottle and the towel.  Nice colors, though.', '2002-05-10 02:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58831, 1465, 878, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect reproduction, only problems is the white towel is overexposed.</td>', 'Almost perfect reproduction, only problems is the white towel is overexposed.', '2002-05-10 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58832, 1465, 1031, '<td valign="top">On my monitor the fabric the bear''s holding is blown-out. Otherwise, excellent composiional job replicating the layout on the bottle.</td>', 'On my monitor the fabric the bear''s holding is blown-out. Otherwise, excellent composiional job replicating the layout on the bottle.', '2002-05-10 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58833, 1465, 1191, '<td valign="top">Very well done..</td>', 'Very well done..', '2002-05-10 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58834, 1465, 554, '<td valign="top">very good idea  but a little washed out on my monitor.  you have Apple or PC?</td>', 'very good idea  but a little washed out on my monitor.  you have Apple or PC?', '2002-05-10 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58835, 1465, 901, '<td valign="top">i want to beat up snuggle.<br/>looks like a real advertisement though.</td>', 'i want to beat up snuggle.looks like a real advertisement though.', '2002-05-10 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58836, 1465, 142, '<td valign="top">Well done recreation of a popular ad campaign.  I love the colors.</td>', 'Well done recreation of a popular ad campaign.  I love the colors.', '2002-05-11 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58837, 1465, 1078, '<td valign="top">Like the way you used the fabric in the background -- it echoes the clouds on the product label nicely.  The only thing I think needs a bit of work is that the towel seems a little bit too bright.  I only get texure on it around the edges.</td>', 'Like the way you used the fabric in the background -- it echoes the clouds on the product label nicely.  The only thing I think needs a bit of work is that the towel seems a little bit too bright.  I only get texure on it around the edges.', '2002-05-12 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58838, 1465, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good job with quite a lot of set up work.   The white towel is kind of blown out losing the detail.   Too bad.</td>', 'Good job with quite a lot of set up work.   The white towel is kind of blown out losing the detail.   Too bad.', '2002-05-12 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58839, 1465, 587, '<td valign="top">cute idea, I would get rid of the swirl''s behind blue clouds, and tone down that towel.</td>', 'cute idea, I would get rid of the swirl''s behind blue clouds, and tone down that towel.', '2002-05-12 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58840, 1465, 2, '<td valign="top">Very clever recreation :)</td>', 'Very clever recreation :)', '2002-05-12 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58841, 1466, 1204, '<td valign="top">Extremely difficult to light a picture like this correctly.  Probably the best result possible without professional equipment though.</td>', 'Extremely difficult to light a picture like this correctly.  Probably the best result possible without professional equipment though.', '2002-05-06 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58842, 1466, 142, '<td valign="top">This is so cute!  I bet they find stuff in this statue''s hands all the time!</td>', 'This is so cute!  I bet they find stuff in this statue''s hands all the time!', '2002-05-06 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58843, 1466, 1, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  The angle works well, but there doesn''t seem to be enough light on the statue''s face... The glare on the bottle itself should''ve been removed as well.</td>', 'Great idea!  The angle works well, but there doesn''t seem to be enough light on the statue''s face... The glare on the bottle itself should''ve been removed as well.', '2002-05-06 07:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58844, 1466, 570, '<td valign="top">who is that anyway? good pic though</td>', 'who is that anyway? good pic though', '2002-05-06 08:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58845, 1466, 813, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Hilarious! I wish the exposure was better balanced, more light on the face of the statue, less on the hand and even light on the product.</td>', 'Great idea. Hilarious! I wish the exposure was better balanced, more light on the face of the statue, less on the hand and even light on the product.', '2002-05-06 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58846, 1466, 1024, '<td valign="top">This gave me a chuckle.</td>', 'This gave me a chuckle.', '2002-05-06 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58847, 1466, 189, '<td valign="top">funny.</td>', 'funny.', '2002-05-06 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58848, 1466, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a well thought out concept... I like it!  The lighting is a little harsh on the pepsi bottle and the face on the statue is a little dark.  I can''t tell if this is just sunlight or not, but a fill flash may have improved the overall image just a bit :)</td>', 'This is a well thought out concept... I like it!  The lighting is a little harsh on the pepsi bottle and the face on the statue is a little dark.  I can''t tell if this is just sunlight or not, but a fill flash may have improved the overall image just a bit :)', '2002-05-06 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58849, 1466, 327, '<td valign="top">Ha! Tree limb is distracting and the glare on the bottle.<br/>Still fine idea.</td>', 'Ha! Tree limb is distracting and the glare on the bottle.Still fine idea.', '2002-05-06 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58850, 1466, 718, '<td valign="top">Very neat!</td>', 'Very neat!', '2002-05-06 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58851, 1466, 259, '<td valign="top">one of the best photos as far as creativity.  the only draw back is the lighting on the bottle, which is hard to control in outdoor shots.  overall though this is a great picture.</td>', 'one of the best photos as far as creativity.  the only draw back is the lighting on the bottle, which is hard to control in outdoor shots.  overall though this is a great picture.', '2002-05-06 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58852, 1466, 1485, '<td valign="top">this one is very cute.. original... lighting would have made this much better.</td>', 'this one is very cute.. original... lighting would have made this much better.', '2002-05-06 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58853, 1466, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great use of a fixed asset!!!  The guy''s face is a little dark, otherwise, great advert!   Photo 9 Advert 10 Creativity 10 total 10</td>', 'Great use of a fixed asset!!!  The guy''s face is a little dark, otherwise, great advert!   Photo 9 Advert 10 Creativity 10 total 10', '2002-05-06 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
