(58855, 1466, 1233, '<td valign="top">Very Nice.  Should have whiped the pigeon poop off of his chin, but I won''t penalize you for it.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Very Nice.  Should have whiped the pigeon poop off of his chin, but I won''t penalize you for it.  One of my favorites.', '2002-05-06 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58856, 1466, 459, '<td valign="top">It would be WONDERFUL, if only his face were brighter!</td>', 'It would be WONDERFUL, if only his face were brighter!', '2002-05-06 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58857, 1466, 724, '<td valign="top">Super Idea! The lighting is a bit harsh on the bottle.</td>', 'Super Idea! The lighting is a bit harsh on the bottle.', '2002-05-06 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58858, 1466, 428, '<td valign="top">NIce set-up. There seems to be too much light on the Pepsi, maybe just a little adjustment in where you stand to take the pic.  Plus the tree branch on the top is just a bit too close to his head. Still a good shot!</td>', 'NIce set-up. There seems to be too much light on the Pepsi, maybe just a little adjustment in where you stand to take the pic.  Plus the tree branch on the top is just a bit too close to his head. Still a good shot!', '2002-05-06 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58859, 1466, 1336, '<td valign="top">it would be nice if the lighting on the pepsi bottle was better</td>', 'it would be nice if the lighting on the pepsi bottle was better', '2002-05-06 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58860, 1466, 686, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the ad. The only thing I didn''t like about this photo is the "S" in Pepsi is glared. If you''re trying to sell this product, the bottle of Pepsi is the most important focus of the picture.</td>', 'Good idea for the ad. The only thing I didn''t like about this photo is the "S" in Pepsi is glared. If you''re trying to sell this product, the bottle of Pepsi is the most important focus of the picture.', '2002-05-06 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58861, 1466, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very well set up, nice composition... the lighting is a bit harsh though, especially since the highlight on the pepsi bottle cuts through the logo. I really like the hands and how the bottle is positioned in them.</td>', 'Very well set up, nice composition... the lighting is a bit harsh though, especially since the highlight on the pepsi bottle cuts through the logo. I really like the hands and how the bottle is positioned in them.', '2002-05-07 04:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58862, 1466, 651, '<td valign="top">Great idea. There is a little too much glare on the Pepsi label and it could have used more light in the face area..  Keep up the good work... :)</td>', 'Great idea. There is a little too much glare on the Pepsi label and it could have used more light in the face area..  Keep up the good work... :)', '2002-05-07 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58863, 1466, 888, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2002-05-07 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58864, 1466, 1054, '<td valign="top">Very creative! I like it!</td>', 'Very creative! I like it!', '2002-05-07 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58865, 1466, 441, '<td valign="top">great imaginative setup!</td>', 'great imaginative setup!', '2002-05-07 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58866, 1466, 280, '<td valign="top">If only it was a coca cola bottle ;-)</td>', 'If only it was a coca cola bottle ;-)', '2002-05-07 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58867, 1466, 1350, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this pic. I like the angle and your choice of display of the product. Well done!</td>', 'I really enjoy this pic. I like the angle and your choice of display of the product. Well done!', '2002-05-07 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58868, 1466, 671, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I''m dying of thirst!  Dramatic framing.  I like the way you''ve got right up close, filling the screen with the image.</td>', 'Great idea, I''m dying of thirst!  Dramatic framing.  I like the way you''ve got right up close, filling the screen with the image.', '2002-05-07 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58869, 1466, 714, '<td valign="top">Very thoughtful,  good one.</td>', 'Very thoughtful,  good one.', '2002-05-07 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58870, 1466, 875, '<td valign="top">What a clever idea!  This made me laugh.</td>', 'What a clever idea!  This made me laugh.', '2002-05-08 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58871, 1466, 748, '<td valign="top">A little different angle for the Pepsi bottle may have helped reduced the glare, but I like the concept</td>', 'A little different angle for the Pepsi bottle may have helped reduced the glare, but I like the concept', '2002-05-08 05:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58872, 1466, 472, '<td valign="top">I think this pic is awesome!  very very funny.  you should send it to pepsi!</td>', 'I think this pic is awesome!  very very funny.  you should send it to pepsi!', '2002-05-08 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58873, 1466, 527, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny. Just a bit too much reflection in the label. It may have required shooting at a different time of day or blocking the bright sun a little. The branch is distracting, too.</td>', 'Pretty funny. Just a bit too much reflection in the label. It may have required shooting at a different time of day or blocking the bright sun a little. The branch is distracting, too.', '2002-05-08 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58874, 1466, 107, '<td valign="top">This photo has loads of humour appeal. Job well done.</td>', 'This photo has loads of humour appeal. Job well done.', '2002-05-09 06:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58875, 1466, 675, '<td valign="top">this is a really funny, cool idea, and the angle you shot at is perfect...maybe a little more light on the head next time?</td>', 'this is a really funny, cool idea, and the angle you shot at is perfect...maybe a little more light on the head next time?', '2002-05-09 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58876, 1466, 811, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious.  Excellent idea, it''s great.  Did you notice that it looks like the statue is drooling?</td>', 'This is hilarious.  Excellent idea, it''s great.  Did you notice that it looks like the statue is drooling?', '2002-05-09 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58877, 1466, 1378, '<td valign="top">This is very unique!  It looks so perfect!</td>', 'This is very unique!  It looks so perfect!', '2002-05-09 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58878, 1466, 1191, '<td valign="top">Great photo</td>', 'Great photo', '2002-05-10 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58879, 1466, 1554, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that Bill Hailey? Should of been titled ''''Pop around the clock'''' Love the composition and framed perfectly. Its a shame the face is not more illuminated, otherwise brilliant.<br/></td>', 'Isn''t that Bill Hailey? Should of been titled ''''Pop around the clock'''' Love the composition and framed perfectly. Its a shame the face is not more illuminated, otherwise brilliant.', '2002-05-10 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58880, 1466, 554, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. Lighting is a tad uneven for a 10 (label too bright and has streek and the face is too dark) Without adding lighting you did good. The angle is perfect.</td>', 'I really like this one. Lighting is a tad uneven for a 10 (label too bright and has streek and the face is too dark) Without adding lighting you did good. The angle is perfect.', '2002-05-11 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58881, 1466, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...Pepsi ad, or commentary on someone''s acting style...?</td>', 'Hmmm...Pepsi ad, or commentary on someone''s acting style...?', '2002-05-11 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58882, 1466, 1078, '<td valign="top">Really like the idea.  I see just a few minor problems: glare on the Pepsi bottle is too strong (maybe if you shot at a slightly different time of day to remove), the buildings in the background (a different angle to either make them a more or less prominent feature of the image), and the tree branch kind of looks like it''s balanced on top of his head (again, slightly different angle).</td>', 'Really like the idea.  I see just a few minor problems: glare on the Pepsi bottle is too strong (maybe if you shot at a slightly different time of day to remove), the buildings in the background (a different angle to either make them a more or less prominent feature of the image), and the tree branch kind of looks like it''s balanced on top of his head (again, slightly different angle).', '2002-05-12 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58883, 1466, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good composition and nice idea.</td>', 'Good composition and nice idea.', '2002-05-12 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58884, 1466, 587, '<td valign="top">My fave Pepsi ad. good job.</td>', 'My fave Pepsi ad. good job.', '2002-05-12 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58885, 1466, 2, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea.  The lighting seems a little off to me.  Maybe too bright in some spots while too dark in others.  Very cool shot.</td>', 'Very cool idea.  The lighting seems a little off to me.  Maybe too bright in some spots while too dark in others.  Very cool shot.', '2002-05-12 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58886, 1466, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, interesting statue...it seems it would look empty without the bottle there</td>', 'Nice picture, interesting statue...it seems it would look empty without the bottle there', '2002-05-12 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58887, 1466, 637, '<td valign="top">Clever.  Can''t imagine Pepsi using it, however.</td>', 'Clever.  Can''t imagine Pepsi using it, however.', '2002-05-12 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58888, 1466, 139, '<td valign="top">I am Coke man, myself, and really, really don''t enjoy drinking Pepsi, but this ad worked on me anyway.  Great job.</td>', 'I am Coke man, myself, and really, really don''t enjoy drinking Pepsi, but this ad worked on me anyway.  Great job.', '2002-05-12 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58889, 1466, 689, '<td valign="top">Cute idea .... a little too much glare on the label of the product .... not a good thing if you are trying to sell it!</td>', 'Cute idea .... a little too much glare on the label of the product .... not a good thing if you are trying to sell it!', '2002-05-13 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58890, 1466, 430, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of your comments!  Actually, I thought of this pic when I was walking down the street with my esteemed colleague Josh Li (the Kobe of dpchallenge), and I bumped into the statue of Fiorello LaGuardia.  It was perfect for an advertisement because of its facial expression and the position of its hand.  I was busy with finals, so I just used anything I had in my hand to take the picture, which in this case was a bottle of Pepsi.  It looked good so I submitted it.<br/><br/>1. I tried to get the best angle possible at the time, and this one happened to be the best.  There were trees and buildings all over, and this angle minimized the "busyness" of the background.<br/><br/>2. I used the maximum fill flash on my camera, which failed to eliminate the shadow on his face.  I didnt have time to come back on a different day or time.<br/><br/>3. I also tried to get an angle to minimize the suns glare off the bottleINSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(59006, 1469, 387, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, but IMO the shot does not stand on it''s own as an advertisement. To me it says "pretty scenery". had you submitted this for a pathways challenge I would have scored it very high.</td>', 'beautiful shot, but IMO the shot does not stand on it''s own as an advertisement. To me it says "pretty scenery". had you submitted this for a pathways challenge I would have scored it very high.', '2002-05-11 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59007, 1469, 1024, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what you are advertising, but this is a beautoiful photo.</td>', 'I am not sure what you are advertising, but this is a beautoiful photo.', '2002-05-12 06:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59008, 1469, 587, '<td valign="top">An ad for hayfever comes to mind.</td>', 'An ad for hayfever comes to mind.', '2002-05-12 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59009, 1469, 1, '<td valign="top">So what are you advertising?</td>', 'So what are you advertising?', '2002-05-12 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59010, 1469, 689, '<td valign="top">What is the ad for?</td>', 'What is the ad for?', '2002-05-13 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59011, 1472, 1360, '<td valign="top">Very well shot!</td>', 'Very well shot!', '2002-05-06 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59012, 1472, 142, '<td valign="top">Is this like Alka Seltzer?  I like the simplicity of the photo and your choice of lighting.  Good job.</td>', 'Is this like Alka Seltzer?  I like the simplicity of the photo and your choice of lighting.  Good job.', '2002-05-06 06:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59013, 1472, 472, '<td valign="top">nice simple clean image. good job.</td>', 'nice simple clean image. good job.', '2002-05-06 08:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59014, 1472, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nice timing, catching the fizz.</td>', 'Nice timing, catching the fizz.', '2002-05-06 09:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59015, 1472, 189, '<td valign="top">Action. Nice.</td>', 'Action. Nice.', '2002-05-06 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59016, 1472, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting in this shot!  The only thing I don''t like about this photo is that *I* think there is just a bit too much empty space on the top of the frame... just my humble opinion... I''m still giving a good score :)</td>', 'Nice lighting in this shot!  The only thing I don''t like about this photo is that *I* think there is just a bit too much empty space on the top of the frame... just my humble opinion... I''m still giving a good score :)', '2002-05-06 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59017, 1472, 1325, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2002-05-06 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59018, 1472, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good photo, advertises O.K.  Dribbled white stuff on the table, messy!  Maybe if there was a "spent" turkey husk in the background......Photo 10 Advert 8 total 9</td>', 'Good photo, advertises O.K.  Dribbled white stuff on the table, messy!  Maybe if there was a "spent" turkey husk in the background......Photo 10 Advert 8 total 9', '2002-05-06 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59019, 1472, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty good here.<br/>Maybe you could of spilled more salts and moved the can (product) forward to focus on it.</td>', 'Pretty good here.Maybe you could of spilled more salts and moved the can (product) forward to focus on it.', '2002-05-06 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59020, 1472, 878, '<td valign="top">Clean shot but the salts on the table are a bit distracting.  I love the "stop motion" of the product.</td>', 'Clean shot but the salts on the table are a bit distracting.  I love the "stop motion" of the product.', '2002-05-06 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59021, 1472, 428, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, I like the way you have captured the bubbles and the "steam" coming out of the glass. NIce crisp focusing.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, I like the way you have captured the bubbles and the "steam" coming out of the glass. NIce crisp focusing.', '2002-05-06 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59022, 1472, 459, '<td valign="top">Simple concept.  Good focus and pleasing background / foreground.  The power on the table isn''t appealing, though.  Still - Well done</td>', 'Simple concept.  Good focus and pleasing background / foreground.  The power on the table isn''t appealing, though.  Still - Well done', '2002-05-06 20:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59023, 1472, 352, '<td valign="top">I like the effervescence, but the spilled salts distract a little bit.</td>', 'I like the effervescence, but the spilled salts distract a little bit.', '2002-05-06 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59024, 1472, 509, '<td valign="top">I like how the base fades into the background, not too fond of the shadows, but eliminating them is hard to do.  Nice exposure</td>', 'I like how the base fades into the background, not too fond of the shadows, but eliminating them is hard to do.  Nice exposure', '2002-05-06 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59025, 1472, 686, '<td valign="top">Very good shot, except for the shadow right in the middle of the product you''re selling.</td>', 'Very good shot, except for the shadow right in the middle of the product you''re selling.', '2002-05-07 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59026, 1472, 1336, '<td valign="top">nice lighting.  good photo</td>', 'nice lighting.  good photo', '2002-05-07 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59027, 1472, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, although there''s a line of shadow right down the front of the tin. The lid is not on properly. There''s also little grains of the stuff on the table. I like the mist coming out of the top of the glass. <br/><br/>Conceptually, I don''t think this kind of photo suits the product. It gives the impression of something sophisticated and luxurious with such dark, strong colours, when for a medical product you tend to want an overall feel that''s lighter and more soothing.</td>', 'Nice lighting, although there''s a line of shadow right down the front of the tin. The lid is not on properly. There''s also little grains of the stuff on the table. I like the mist coming out of the top of the glass. Conceptually, I don''t think this kind of photo suits the product. It gives the impression of something sophisticated and luxurious with such dark, strong colours, when for a medical product you tend to want an overall feel that''s lighter and more soothing.', '2002-05-07 03:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59028, 1472, 446, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I wish the random grains of salt were not present or if desired maybe there could have been a small pile?  Photo could use some help in technique to avoid the harsh shadows and blown highlights.  Fine effort.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I wish the random grains of salt were not present or if desired maybe there could have been a small pile?  Photo could use some help in technique to avoid the harsh shadows and blown highlights.  Fine effort.', '2002-05-07 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59029, 1472, 301, '<td valign="top">love the way you caught the fizz in the glass.  I would have closed the tin properly and gotten rid of the salt spillage around the glass.  It''s probably harsh to mention the shadows (seeing as not everyone here [myself included] owns all the equipment necessary for professional set up shots such as this) but the shadow cast by the tumbler is quite distracting</td>', 'love the way you caught the fizz in the glass.  I would have closed the tin properly and gotten rid of the salt spillage around the glass.  It''s probably harsh to mention the shadows (seeing as not everyone here [myself included] owns all the equipment necessary for professional set up shots such as this) but the shadow cast by the tumbler is quite distracting', '2002-05-07 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59030, 1472, 651, '<td valign="top">Very nice.. I think the surface is a bit messy..</td>', 'Very nice.. I think the surface is a bit messy..', '2002-05-07 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59031, 1472, 813, '<td valign="top">good job catching the fizz at it''s peak, i want to see a spoon or something in the foreground</td>', 'good job catching the fizz at it''s peak, i want to see a spoon or something in the foreground', '2002-05-07 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59032, 1472, 656, '<td valign="top">good ''action'' in the fizz</td>', 'good ''action'' in the fizz', '2002-05-08 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59033, 1472, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, good DOF.</td>', 'Nice effect, good DOF.', '2002-05-08 03:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59034, 1472, 875, '<td valign="top">Nice fizz and good lighting!</td>', 'Nice fizz and good lighting!', '2002-05-08 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59035, 1472, 1209, '<td valign="top">I can hear the fizz! Beautiful color and sharpness.  Nice job.</td>', 'I can hear the fizz! Beautiful color and sharpness.  Nice job.', '2002-05-08 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59036, 1472, 675, '<td valign="top">that doesn''t look very gentle</td>', 'that doesn''t look very gentle', '2002-05-09 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59037, 1472, 1510, '<td valign="top">different color foreground woudl make this better something that works with your product.  shadows don''t work well and distract from your picture.  I keep looking to see what they are leading to.</td>', 'different color foreground woudl make this better something that works with your product.  shadows don''t work well and distract from your picture.  I keep looking to see what they are leading to.', '2002-05-09 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59038, 1472, 1031, '<td valign="top">It''s a good photo of fluid in motion, but it looks more like a drink served by the Addams Family than medicine...</td>', 'It''s a good photo of fluid in motion, but it looks more like a drink served by the Addams Family than medicine...', '2002-05-10 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59039, 1472, 554, '<td valign="top">one of the best ones ---one point off for salts on matt.</td>', 'one of the best ones ---one point off for salts on matt.', '2002-05-10 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59040, 1472, 749, '<td valign="top">Great colours &amp; lighting - the fade to black helps highlight the white bubbles. The only detractors are the spilt powder in the background, and the fact that the tin is open slightly! :o)</td>', 'Great colours & lighting - the fade to black helps highlight the white bubbles. The only detractors are the spilt powder in the background, and the fact that the tin is open slightly! :o)', '2002-05-11 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59041, 1472, 1202, '<td valign="top">Looks as though it came from a magazine to me.   Good job.</td>', 'Looks as though it came from a magazine to me.   Good job.', '2002-05-12 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59042, 1472, 587, '<td valign="top">need a spoon.</td>', 'need a spoon.', '2002-05-12 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59043, 1472, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and timing.  Maybe the left over plate of food with the said turkey could''ve helped sell the product more -- people could perhaps relate.</td>', 'Nice lighting and timing.  Maybe the left over plate of food with the said turkey could''ve helped sell the product more -- people could perhaps relate.', '2002-05-12 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
