(59130, 1479, 259, '<td valign="top">very nice crisp clean ad, but not very interesting</td>', 'very nice crisp clean ad, but not very interesting', '2002-05-06 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59131, 1479, 878, '<td valign="top">Good shot simple yet effective.  A couple downsides to the shot, the hole in the head and better beer glass could of been used (not an issue really).  Using a spray bottle with a mist setting could add better effect to the bottle and glass. <br/><br/></td>', 'Good shot simple yet effective.  A couple downsides to the shot, the hole in the head and better beer glass could of been used (not an issue really).  Using a spray bottle with a mist setting could add better effect to the bottle and glass. ', '2002-05-06 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59132, 1479, 1204, '<td valign="top">Technically flawless - but not very interesting.  8 for the technical performance, but 2 for creative and 5 for advertisement value.  That results in a 5.</td>', 'Technically flawless - but not very interesting.  8 for the technical performance, but 2 for creative and 5 for advertisement value.  That results in a 5.', '2002-05-06 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59133, 1479, 1233, '<td valign="top">The glass does not appeal me.  Nice clear picture though.</td>', 'The glass does not appeal me.  Nice clear picture though.', '2002-05-06 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59134, 1479, 933, '<td valign="top">While this may not be my beer of choice, it is an excellent technical shot.  Very Clear, great lighting, good composition.  Very nice work!</td>', 'While this may not be my beer of choice, it is an excellent technical shot.  Very Clear, great lighting, good composition.  Very nice work!', '2002-05-06 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59135, 1479, 1381, '<td valign="top">It''s miller time.  Love the lighting and the way the foamy head just reaches the top of the glass.</td>', 'It''s miller time.  Love the lighting and the way the foamy head just reaches the top of the glass.', '2002-05-06 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59136, 1479, 459, '<td valign="top">Good angle.  Good lighting, background, focus, etc.  Why is the glass not full???</td>', 'Good angle.  Good lighting, background, focus, etc.  Why is the glass not full???', '2002-05-06 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59137, 1479, 724, '<td valign="top">Great composition, good color, nice photo. Unfortunately, I don''t drink, so you didn''t sell me.  :(  ....8</td>', 'Great composition, good color, nice photo. Unfortunately, I don''t drink, so you didn''t sell me.  :(  ....8', '2002-05-06 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59138, 1479, 888, '<td valign="top">That is my biggest problem with America, Beer always has a huge head on it!!!<br/><br/>Just kidding, well, no I''m not, I hate big headed beer but I was just kidding about the stereoptyping bit.<br/><br/>Well taken but a little plain, pics of drinks look great with drips of water I think.<br/></td>', 'That is my biggest problem with America, Beer always has a huge head on it!!!Just kidding, well, no I''m not, I hate big headed beer but I was just kidding about the stereoptyping bit.Well taken but a little plain, pics of drinks look great with drips of water I think.', '2002-05-07 04:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59139, 1479, 436, '<td valign="top">spray glycerin on the outside of the glass for the cold sweat look</td>', 'spray glycerin on the outside of the glass for the cold sweat look', '2002-05-07 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59140, 1479, 651, '<td valign="top">This photo is great.. The hole in the foam bugs me..</td>', 'This photo is great.. The hole in the foam bugs me..', '2002-05-07 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59141, 1479, 1054, '<td valign="top">Looks good, but would be an even better advertisement if it were in a real beer glass.</td>', 'Looks good, but would be an even better advertisement if it were in a real beer glass.', '2002-05-07 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59142, 1479, 441, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna have to look round for some cheap soft boxes, great lighting, setup and angle.</td>', 'I''m gonna have to look round for some cheap soft boxes, great lighting, setup and angle.', '2002-05-07 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59143, 1479, 1211, '<td valign="top">Plain flat out great shot.  I like how the glass is just slightly behind the bottle.  Too bad the head in the glass was beginning to go away.</td>', 'Plain flat out great shot.  I like how the glass is just slightly behind the bottle.  Too bad the head in the glass was beginning to go away.', '2002-05-07 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59144, 1479, 280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Good sharp focus great composition, an excellent product shot.</td>', 'Nice shot! Good sharp focus great composition, an excellent product shot.', '2002-05-07 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59145, 1479, 661, '<td valign="top">Clean and crisp.</td>', 'Clean and crisp.', '2002-05-07 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59146, 1479, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing.  I am not a drinker,  but this looks like it could change my mind,  well until I tasted it.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice framing.  I am not a drinker,  but this looks like it could change my mind,  well until I tasted it.  Good job.', '2002-05-07 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59147, 1479, 813, '<td valign="top">beer is hard to photograph well, it almost always need a little light showing through it to make it eye appealing and the head needs to be caught when the bubbles are still rising, very nice composition though and good sharp focus</td>', 'beer is hard to photograph well, it almost always need a little light showing through it to make it eye appealing and the head needs to be caught when the bubbles are still rising, very nice composition though and good sharp focus', '2002-05-07 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59148, 1479, 215, '<td valign="top">Very professional. For these beverage shots, I always like to see the drink lit up from underneath... It gives it a certain glow. Maybe next time.</td>', 'Very professional. For these beverage shots, I always like to see the drink lit up from underneath... It gives it a certain glow. Maybe next time.', '2002-05-07 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59149, 1479, 536, '<td valign="top">This nice. pure. it seems technically flawless. But it isn''t interesting.</td>', 'This nice. pure. it seems technically flawless. But it isn''t interesting.', '2002-05-07 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59150, 1479, 656, '<td valign="top">higher points if it had been fat tire.  Lighting seems a bit ''lifeless''</td>', 'higher points if it had been fat tire.  Lighting seems a bit ''lifeless''', '2002-05-08 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59151, 1479, 527, '<td valign="top">It''s pretty ordinary but well done. Maybe you could have chilled the bottle in ice water first and then placed it next to the glass to show all of the water dropletts that make it look ice cold. This looks like it could easily be warm beer.</td>', 'It''s pretty ordinary but well done. Maybe you could have chilled the bottle in ice water first and then placed it next to the glass to show all of the water dropletts that make it look ice cold. This looks like it could easily be warm beer.', '2002-05-08 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59152, 1479, 875, '<td valign="top">I like the seamless background and positioning of the bottle and glass.</td>', 'I like the seamless background and positioning of the bottle and glass.', '2002-05-08 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59153, 1479, 675, '<td valign="top">just like miller, all head, no beer. great photo though</td>', 'just like miller, all head, no beer. great photo though', '2002-05-09 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59154, 1479, 142, '<td valign="top">Nice clean picture.  I would have done two things differently.  You need some condensation on the bottle and glass to convey a sense of ice cold.  Also, a more traditional style of glass or mug would look better than the one chosen.  I still like the picture and I applaud your choice of beers.</td>', 'Nice clean picture.  I would have done two things differently.  You need some condensation on the bottle and glass to convey a sense of ice cold.  Also, a more traditional style of glass or mug would look better than the one chosen.  I still like the picture and I applaud your choice of beers.', '2002-05-09 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59155, 1479, 543, '<td valign="top">Correctly exposed with no distracting reflections or background elements.  All in focus.  I guess an open bottle is more inviting (but then you''d have had to drink two after the shoot) and the hole in the foam isn''t pretty.  Overall, a solid image, but without any special appeal.</td>', 'Correctly exposed with no distracting reflections or background elements.  All in focus.  I guess an open bottle is more inviting (but then you''d have had to drink two after the shoot) and the hole in the foam isn''t pretty.  Overall, a solid image, but without any special appeal.', '2002-05-10 02:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59156, 1479, 554, '<td valign="top">nice arangement and angle</td>', 'nice arangement and angle', '2002-05-11 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59157, 1479, 1453, '<td valign="top">Good job, but the beer in the glass and the beer in the bottle (I think) should total one full beer.  Was it  too warm to get a little dewey on the bottle?</td>', 'Good job, but the beer in the glass and the beer in the bottle (I think) should total one full beer.  Was it  too warm to get a little dewey on the bottle?', '2002-05-11 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59158, 1479, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good clear shot but lacks story to sell product.   Does the bottle ever go dry?</td>', 'Good clear shot but lacks story to sell product.   Does the bottle ever go dry?', '2002-05-12 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59159, 1479, 587, '<td valign="top">1 frosty beer mug needed - maybe some foam running down the side - MAKE me thirsty.</td>', '1 frosty beer mug needed - maybe some foam running down the side - MAKE me thirsty.', '2002-05-12 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59160, 1479, 139, '<td valign="top">Great advertising shot!  I can''t think of any criticisms, it''s just a really good shot.</td>', 'Great advertising shot!  I can''t think of any criticisms, it''s just a really good shot.', '2002-05-12 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59161, 1480, 441, '<td valign="top">would have liked to see more of what I may buy,  great contrasts</td>', 'would have liked to see more of what I may buy,  great contrasts', '2002-05-06 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59162, 1480, 92, '<td valign="top">The lighting is perfect. The balance and colors just work. GREAT job !</td>', 'The lighting is perfect. The balance and colors just work. GREAT job !', '2002-05-06 06:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59163, 1480, 570, '<td valign="top">an ibanez would have been better....</td>', 'an ibanez would have been better....', '2002-05-06 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59164, 1480, 327, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tighter crop and some extra light around Jackson? It really doesn''t tell me much or make me think they are special. It is a nice photo.</td>', 'Maybe a tighter crop and some extra light around Jackson? It really doesn''t tell me much or make me think they are special. It is a nice photo.', '2002-05-06 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59165, 1480, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good photo, quality advert, low "gotcha" value.  Maybe the background could have more "interesting".  Photo 10 Advert 9 total 9</td>', 'Good photo, quality advert, low "gotcha" value.  Maybe the background could have more "interesting".  Photo 10 Advert 9 total 9', '2002-05-06 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59166, 1480, 259, '<td valign="top">what is it with guitars every week</td>', 'what is it with guitars every week', '2002-05-06 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59167, 1480, 1233, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I like it.</td>', 'Good shot, I like it.', '2002-05-06 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59168, 1480, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition.  Well done!', '2002-05-06 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59169, 1480, 189, '<td valign="top">THERE''s the guitar pic. I almost though for a second that someone wasn''t going to do one...but no.</td>', 'THERE''s the guitar pic. I almost though for a second that someone wasn''t going to do one...but no.', '2002-05-06 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59170, 1480, 459, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  One suggestion - If the light were brighter on the part of the instrument with your client''s name, and a bit darker in the scratched fret, you might sell more guitars with the ad.  Still very good.</td>', 'Very nice.  One suggestion - If the light were brighter on the part of the instrument with your client''s name, and a bit darker in the scratched fret, you might sell more guitars with the ad.  Still very good.', '2002-05-06 20:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59171, 1480, 1336, '<td valign="top">nice photo.  i would have liked to see the whole guitar though</td>', 'nice photo.  i would have liked to see the whole guitar though', '2002-05-07 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59172, 1480, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. The shapes are great, well framed, and the colour of the backdrop is daringly vivid :) I''m not sure how it sells the guitar, but it''s a cool photograph.</td>', 'I really like this one. The shapes are great, well framed, and the colour of the backdrop is daringly vivid :) I''m not sure how it sells the guitar, but it''s a cool photograph.', '2002-05-07 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59173, 1480, 813, '<td valign="top">beautiful color and good composition, would love to see a little more light on the label and a bit sharper focus, but all in al a nice shot</td>', 'beautiful color and good composition, would love to see a little more light on the label and a bit sharper focus, but all in al a nice shot', '2002-05-07 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59174, 1480, 446, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot.  Bordering on being over sharpened?  There appears to be a blue cast introduced on the subject from either the lighting, post processing, or a reflection?  Good effort though.</td>', 'Nice crisp shot.  Bordering on being over sharpened?  There appears to be a blue cast introduced on the subject from either the lighting, post processing, or a reflection?  Good effort though.', '2002-05-07 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59175, 1480, 656, '<td valign="top">clean product shot</td>', 'clean product shot', '2002-05-08 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59176, 1480, 1341, '<td valign="top">Great shot love the clarity, one of my highest ratings</td>', 'Great shot love the clarity, one of my highest ratings', '2002-05-08 07:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59177, 1480, 472, '<td valign="top">right on. im a musician too.  i play ibz and gibson. good technical pic.</td>', 'right on. im a musician too.  i play ibz and gibson. good technical pic.', '2002-05-08 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59178, 1480, 554, '<td valign="top">top 5  excellent!</td>', 'top 5  excellent!', '2002-05-08 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59179, 1480, 142, '<td valign="top">Very effective.  I like the way the light gets brighter to the right of the guitar.</td>', 'Very effective.  I like the way the light gets brighter to the right of the guitar.', '2002-05-09 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59180, 1480, 1510, '<td valign="top">picture is neat but boring. could have made better use of the angles in the product</td>', 'picture is neat but boring. could have made better use of the angles in the product', '2002-05-09 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59181, 1480, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear.  Slight blue cast on the fretboard.  Maybe a more interesting angle?</td>', 'Nice and clear.  Slight blue cast on the fretboard.  Maybe a more interesting angle?', '2002-05-10 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59182, 1480, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I would like to see the whole product rather than the headstock.</td>', 'Nice shot but I would like to see the whole product rather than the headstock.', '2002-05-10 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59183, 1480, 1031, '<td valign="top">A nice shot of an important functional difference in this brand (are those fine-tuning screws above the nut?) but not the overall design.<br/><br/>If I were doing the whole ad (I''ve done more design than photography), I''d probably use the two nice spaces you left to composite-in tiny images of the whole guitar (front/back/side) -- this is a very good base image.</td>', 'A nice shot of an important functional difference in this brand (are those fine-tuning screws above the nut?) but not the overall design.If I were doing the whole ad (I''ve done more design than photography), I''d probably use the two nice spaces you left to composite-in tiny images of the whole guitar (front/back/side) -- this is a very good base image.', '2002-05-11 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59184, 1480, 811, '<td valign="top">How do you get the blue background?  I like it.</td>', 'How do you get the blue background?  I like it.', '2002-05-12 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59185, 1480, 1202, '<td valign="top">Looks to me like you are selling guitars.   Good job.</td>', 'Looks to me like you are selling guitars.   Good job.', '2002-05-12 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59186, 1480, 587, '<td valign="top">Well? Does Jackson only make THAT part of the guitar? I find myself wanting to strain to see what the rest of the guitar looks like, if this was your intention - A+ :) good clarity, good lighting!!</td>', 'Well? Does Jackson only make THAT part of the guitar? I find myself wanting to strain to see what the rest of the guitar looks like, if this was your intention - A+ :) good clarity, good lighting!!', '2002-05-12 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59187, 1480, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice background, weird angle.  I think the whole guitar needs to be in view to really sell it.</td>', 'Nice background, weird angle.  I think the whole guitar needs to be in view to really sell it.', '2002-05-12 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59195, 1486, 772, '<td valign="top">The objects in the foreground of this photo being out of focus are very distracting...</td>', 'The objects in the foreground of this photo being out of focus are very distracting...', '2002-05-06 05:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59196, 1486, 862, '<td valign="top">"Uh-oh... Blast ''em!"  Great idea.  The blurry droid in the foreground is distracting.  I''d move him a little closer and increase the depth of field.</td>', '"Uh-oh... Blast ''em!"  Great idea.  The blurry droid in the foreground is distracting.  I''d move him a little closer and increase the depth of field.', '2002-05-06 08:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59197, 1486, 509, '<td valign="top">I think the battle droid in the immediate foreground should go.  My eyes are drawn to it, and it is out of focus.  Cool concept though.  Hopefully Episode II won''t be as bad as Episode I tho</td>', 'I think the battle droid in the immediate foreground should go.  My eyes are drawn to it, and it is out of focus.  Cool concept though.  Hopefully Episode II won''t be as bad as Episode I tho', '2002-05-06 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59198, 1486, 1024, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2002-05-06 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59199, 1486, 327, '<td valign="top">Your really on top of the trend. Very cute idea, and you did it well.<br/>Nice work.</td>', 'Your really on top of the trend. Very cute idea, and you did it well.Nice work.', '2002-05-06 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59200, 1486, 1005, '<td valign="top">So cute!  Somehow I don''t really like the blurry objects in the foreground, but it''s not all that bad of an effect.  Photo 9 Advert 10 Creativity 9 total 9</td>', 'So cute!  Somehow I don''t really like the blurry objects in the foreground, but it''s not all that bad of an effect.  Photo 9 Advert 10 Creativity 9 total 9', '2002-05-06 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59201, 1486, 259, '<td valign="top">not a fan of the picture the content or the graininess.</td>', 'not a fan of the picture the content or the graininess.', '2002-05-06 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59202, 1486, 1381, '<td valign="top">Hilarious. Go Qui Gon and Obi-wan!</td>', 'Hilarious. Go Qui Gon and Obi-wan!', '2002-05-06 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59203, 1486, 1336, '<td valign="top">pretty cool.  would have been better with the blurred (guy?) in the front further back and more in focus</td>', 'pretty cool.  would have been better with the blurred (guy?) in the front further back and more in focus', '2002-05-07 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59204, 1486, 1054, '<td valign="top">The out-of-focus lego in the lower left takes away from an otherwise good shot.</td>', 'The out-of-focus lego in the lower left takes away from an otherwise good shot.', '2002-05-07 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59205, 1486, 428, '<td valign="top">Great job! The crinkly paper in the background gives a good effect on this shot.</td>', 'Great job! The crinkly paper in the background gives a good effect on this shot.', '2002-05-07 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59206, 1486, 656, '<td valign="top">I''d have lost the droid at the front light that is very blurred.</td>', 'I''d have lost the droid at the front light that is very blurred.', '2002-05-08 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59207, 1486, 472, '<td valign="top">these guys are cool. the dof is very effective, as is the background which seems like a rock cliff.  a tilted angle might have given the image more movement to go with the battle scene.</td>', 'these guys are cool. the dof is very effective, as is the background which seems like a rock cliff.  a tilted angle might have given the image more movement to go with the battle scene.', '2002-05-08 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59208, 1486, 715, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement and the way you used a reflecting floor, but I think the unsharp Lego in the forground is too destracting.</td>', 'I like the arrangement and the way you used a reflecting floor, but I think the unsharp Lego in the forground is too destracting.', '2002-05-08 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59209, 1486, 1, '<td valign="top">Hehe, nicely setup here.  Good DOF, though it seems maybe a little over-sharpened.</td>', 'Hehe, nicely setup here.  Good DOF, though it seems maybe a little over-sharpened.', '2002-05-08 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59210, 1486, 661, '<td valign="top">Very creative and timely.  The out of focus figure in the left front detracts.</td>', 'Very creative and timely.  The out of focus figure in the left front detracts.', '2002-05-08 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59211, 1486, 813, '<td valign="top">cute, nice depth of field and angle, background is a little cheesy</td>', 'cute, nice depth of field and angle, background is a little cheesy', '2002-05-08 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59212, 1486, 269, '<td valign="top">foreground very bad out of focus. better off leaving them out.</td>', 'foreground very bad out of focus. better off leaving them out.', '2002-05-08 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(59213, 1486, 714, '<td valign="top">cool idea,  fun.</td>', 'cool idea,  fun.', '2002-05-09 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59214, 1486, 875, '<td valign="top">I love the idea!  I think the reflected light (or noise?) on the surface of the table is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I love the idea!  I think the reflected light (or noise?) on the surface of the table is a bit distracting.', '2002-05-09 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59215, 1486, 543, '<td valign="top">Since nothing is moving here, you could have stopped down and gotten more of the scene in focus.  Maybe this result was what you intended - it does look kind of cinematic, but that little guy at LL bugs me.  Nice work on the bg and icy ground.  Sharpened within an inch of it''s life.</td>', 'Since nothing is moving here, you could have stopped down and gotten more of the scene in focus.  Maybe this result was what you intended - it does look kind of cinematic, but that little guy at LL bugs me.  Nice work on the bg and icy ground.  Sharpened within an inch of it''s life.', '2002-05-10 02:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59216, 1486, 878, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and add, I would of placed the Lego box / logo somewhere in the shot.</td>', 'I like this shot and add, I would of placed the Lego box / logo somewhere in the shot.', '2002-05-10 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59217, 1486, 131, '<td valign="top">Your aperture setting is messed up</td>', 'Your aperture setting is messed up', '2002-05-10 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59218, 1486, 554, '<td valign="top">Nice shot,well arranged. I would have tried for more depth but this might be the best one could do.</td>', 'Nice shot,well arranged. I would have tried for more depth but this might be the best one could do.', '2002-05-11 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59219, 1486, 142, '<td valign="top">Funny.</td>', 'Funny.', '2002-05-11 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59220, 1486, 811, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but the blurry figure in the lower left and across the front kinda draws my eyes away from the action.  Good set up.</td>', 'Neat idea, but the blurry figure in the lower left and across the front kinda draws my eyes away from the action.  Good set up.', '2002-05-11 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59221, 1486, 835, '<td valign="top">better off removing the objects in front instead of them being out of focus.  I liked the title</td>', 'better off removing the objects in front instead of them being out of focus.  I liked the title', '2002-05-11 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59222, 1486, 1031, '<td valign="top">I dragged my five-year old son in here to look at the monitor and asked, "what''s that." He looked for a minute and grinned and said, "Star Wars Legos!"<br/><br/>I guess you made your sale...</td>', 'I dragged my five-year old son in here to look at the monitor and asked, "what''s that." He looked for a minute and grinned and said, "Star Wars Legos!"I guess you made your sale...', '2002-05-11 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59223, 1486, 1041, '<td valign="top">I used to love playing with Lego.  This is a really well done ad - good job!  One of my top 10.</td>', 'I used to love playing with Lego.  This is a really well done ad - good job!  One of my top 10.', '2002-05-11 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59224, 1486, 587, '<td valign="top">great job.</td>', 'great job.', '2002-05-12 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59225, 1486, 637, '<td valign="top">Cute and clever but I would''ve preferred if you had gone out on a limb and declared this an advertisement for something.</td>', 'Cute and clever but I would''ve preferred if you had gone out on a limb and declared this an advertisement for something.', '2002-05-12 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59226, 1486, 689, '<td valign="top">Nice use of depth of field ...</td>', 'Nice use of depth of field ...', '2002-05-13 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59227, 1486, 1078, '<td valign="top">For all of you who commented on the droid LL being way out of the focal plane -- you''re absolutely right and I appreciate the feedback.  It was intentional for two reasons -- first, I simply liked the way I felt it put the viewer more fully in the action -- like you''re part of a bunch of droids coming up on the scene.  Secondly, that corner was where I would have put some of my ad type -- price of the Lego set, or a logo, or a tag line, or whatever.  Yes, you want people to see the picture, but the written information is what you really want them to remember -- and if I can keep ''em looking down there at it...<br/><br/>At any rate, thank you for all the constructive comments.</td>', 'For all of you who commented on the droid LL being way out of the focal plane -- you''re absolutely right and I appreciate the feedback.  It was intentional for two reasons -- first, I simply liked the way I felt it put the viewer more fully in the action -- like you''re part of a bunch of droids coming up on the scene.  Secondly, that corner was where I would have put some of my ad type -- price of the Lego set, or a logo, or a tag line, or whatever.  Yes, you want people to see the picture, but the written information is what you really want them to remember -- and if I can keep ''em looking down there at it...At any rate, thank you for all the constructive comments.', '2002-05-13 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(59228, 1487, 1226, '<td valign="top">Ouch, nice layoiut... but it seems oversharpened a tad. Too many artifacts and hard edges.</td>', 'Ouch, nice layoiut... but it seems oversharpened a tad. Too many artifacts and hard edges.', '2002-05-06 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
