(59266, 1488, 446, '<td valign="top">I love the composition.  I think it would have made a great shot if the colors were more natural.  It appears that the white balance may be off?  Nice effort.</td>', 'I love the composition.  I think it would have made a great shot if the colors were more natural.  It appears that the white balance may be off?  Nice effort.', '2002-05-07 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59267, 1488, 536, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed the humor of this photo. That''s a BIG egg.  Made me look twice.  Most excellent.  I like the composition.  I think the choice to go with whites and not make the egg really stand out was a good choice.</td>', 'I enjoyed the humor of this photo. That''s a BIG egg.  Made me look twice.  Most excellent.  I like the composition.  I think the choice to go with whites and not make the egg really stand out was a good choice.', '2002-05-07 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59268, 1488, 2, '<td valign="top">The ISO on this shot seems a little high -- the photo is slightly grainy.  This seems pretty important, since the smoothness of the egg is lost.</td>', 'The ISO on this shot seems a little high -- the photo is slightly grainy.  This seems pretty important, since the smoothness of the egg is lost.', '2002-05-08 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59269, 1488, 811, '<td valign="top">Heck, this looks like it could be for lunch and supper, too!  On one hand, I kinda like all the light colors, but that makes the egg holder almost become the focal point of the picture.  I assume you were wanting the egg to be that.  Maybe if it had some more colors in it somewhere (the picture, not the egg).</td>', 'Heck, this looks like it could be for lunch and supper, too!  On one hand, I kinda like all the light colors, but that makes the egg holder almost become the focal point of the picture.  I assume you were wanting the egg to be that.  Maybe if it had some more colors in it somewhere (the picture, not the egg).', '2002-05-09 08:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59270, 1488, 675, '<td valign="top">good lord, why are you hiding the ostriches</td>', 'good lord, why are you hiding the ostriches', '2002-05-09 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59271, 1488, 142, '<td valign="top">What kind of egg is that supposed to be?  This is a very elegant setup.</td>', 'What kind of egg is that supposed to be?  This is a very elegant setup.', '2002-05-09 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59272, 1488, 813, '<td valign="top">i like the simplicity, the symmetry, and the colors, i wish to heck the horizon line was level, it''s off just enough to be disturbing, and not enough to look intentional :)</td>', 'i like the simplicity, the symmetry, and the colors, i wish to heck the horizon line was level, it''s off just enough to be disturbing, and not enough to look intentional :)', '2002-05-09 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59273, 1488, 875, '<td valign="top">Now, that''s a big egg!  I like the use of white and the black stand.  The photo seems to be a little bit tipped to the right.</td>', 'Now, that''s a big egg!  I like the use of white and the black stand.  The photo seems to be a little bit tipped to the right.', '2002-05-09 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59274, 1488, 543, '<td valign="top">That''s one big egg.  I think a hgher, more level camera position would have helped the composition.  My eyes get pulled away from the foreground, and I can''t remember the last time I saw a table setting from this low a perspective.  The glare from the window caused the interior to underexpose a little, and you got some noise on the egg and in the walls as a result.</td>', 'That''s one big egg.  I think a hgher, more level camera position would have helped the composition.  My eyes get pulled away from the foreground, and I can''t remember the last time I saw a table setting from this low a perspective.  The glare from the window caused the interior to underexpose a little, and you got some noise on the egg and in the walls as a result.', '2002-05-10 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59275, 1488, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I dont know if I would attempt to eat something that big but still a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot, I dont know if I would attempt to eat something that big but still a nice shot.', '2002-05-10 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
