(59385, 1494, 1175, '<td valign="top">At first glance its awesome.  After a few seconds I have to start questioning.  What''s the thing in the back on the left?  Is that a card board cutout?  I think lighting is such a difficult thing to set up and advertisements must have perfect lighting.  You''re lighting might have been too direct.  You would have benefitted from multiple lightsources indirectly lighting your subject.  Look at hte shadow behind the socks, look at the shadow on the shoes by the leaves.</td>', 'At first glance its awesome.  After a few seconds I have to start questioning.  What''s the thing in the back on the left?  Is that a card board cutout?  I think lighting is such a difficult thing to set up and advertisements must have perfect lighting.  You''re lighting might have been too direct.  You would have benefitted from multiple lightsources indirectly lighting your subject.  Look at hte shadow behind the socks, look at the shadow on the shoes by the leaves.', '2002-05-06 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59386, 1494, 472, '<td valign="top">this is cool.  i would have moved the camera more to the left to get more of the hat, and leave less space to the right of the boots.</td>', 'this is cool.  i would have moved the camera more to the left to get more of the hat, and leave less space to the right of the boots.', '2002-05-06 08:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
