(59396, 1494, 797, '<td valign="top">i like this shot. maybe because i''m a sucker for timberland. the tree bark in the background looks a bit faded at first, but it''s a nice touch. the bright grean maple (?) leaves adds interest. composition is somehow not striking enough to me.</td>', 'i like this shot. maybe because i''m a sucker for timberland. the tree bark in the background looks a bit faded at first, but it''s a nice touch. the bright grean maple (?) leaves adds interest. composition is somehow not striking enough to me.', '2002-05-07 05:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59397, 1494, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit cluttered and confusing, with the brand name repeated a few times but not emphasised as the subject of the photo, except maybe on the hat.</td>', 'It''s a bit cluttered and confusing, with the brand name repeated a few times but not emphasised as the subject of the photo, except maybe on the hat.', '2002-05-07 05:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59398, 1494, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent... one of the best this week.</td>', 'Excellent... one of the best this week.', '2002-05-07 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59399, 1494, 441, '<td valign="top">good composition,. would have liked to have seen it set up inreal outdoors but appreciate this would give you serious lighting probs!</td>', 'good composition,. would have liked to have seen it set up inreal outdoors but appreciate this would give you serious lighting probs!', '2002-05-07 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59400, 1494, 301, '<td valign="top">I like the earthy feel you''ve given this photo.  Goes very well with the Timberland products, but it all seems just a little too monotone for me.  The socks especially are almost camouflaged</td>', 'I like the earthy feel you''ve given this photo.  Goes very well with the Timberland products, but it all seems just a little too monotone for me.  The socks especially are almost camouflaged', '2002-05-08 06:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59401, 1494, 554, '<td valign="top">top 3</td>', 'top 3', '2002-05-08 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59402, 1494, 780, '<td valign="top">If it was a real tree instead of the box, this would be awesome.  I like the tag line and the rest of the composition - the box just looks too flat.</td>', 'If it was a real tree instead of the box, this would be awesome.  I like the tag line and the rest of the composition - the box just looks too flat.', '2002-05-08 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59403, 1494, 675, '<td valign="top">timberlands rule! nice job, i could maybe see this in a catalogue if it were arranged a little differently</td>', 'timberlands rule! nice job, i could maybe see this in a catalogue if it were arranged a little differently', '2002-05-09 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59404, 1494, 715, '<td valign="top">Very good picture and nice arrangement. Displaying used shoes instead of new ones gives a good impression of the quality. I think the carton-board tree is disturbing though.</td>', 'Very good picture and nice arrangement. Displaying used shoes instead of new ones gives a good impression of the quality. I think the carton-board tree is disturbing though.', '2002-05-09 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59405, 1494, 813, '<td valign="top">nice layout, needs a little more contrast and better focus, but good art direction</td>', 'nice layout, needs a little more contrast and better focus, but good art direction', '2002-05-09 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59406, 1494, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2002-05-09 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59407, 1494, 543, '<td valign="top">Too many elements / logos, IMO.  Looks more like a shop window display than an ad photo.  Toss the box and sox for sure.  Those boots have loads of character.  Maybe getting in close on them with the needles and leaves for a bg would have been more effective.  Not bad, but could be better.</td>', 'Too many elements / logos, IMO.  Looks more like a shop window display than an ad photo.  Toss the box and sox for sure.  Those boots have loads of character.  Maybe getting in close on them with the needles and leaves for a bg would have been more effective.  Not bad, but could be better.', '2002-05-10 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59408, 1494, 674, '<td valign="top">A very pleasing composition, well thought out</td>', 'A very pleasing composition, well thought out', '2002-05-10 05:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59409, 1494, 1191, '<td valign="top">Really well thought out.</td>', 'Really well thought out.', '2002-05-10 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59410, 1494, 446, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Well exposed (slightly bright).  Caption is very fitting with the scene.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Well exposed (slightly bright).  Caption is very fitting with the scene.  Good job.', '2002-05-10 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59411, 1494, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, and detail.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, and detail.', '2002-05-11 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59412, 1494, 1041, '<td valign="top">You need to sell this one to Timberland - it''s awesome!  In my top three!</td>', 'You need to sell this one to Timberland - it''s awesome!  In my top three!', '2002-05-11 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1);
