(59414, 1494, 1202, '<td valign="top">The Timbeerland people should like this one.   Good job.</td>', 'The Timbeerland people should like this one.   Good job.', '2002-05-12 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59415, 1494, 587, '<td valign="top">Now THIS is an advertisement!! great photo.</td>', 'Now THIS is an advertisement!! great photo.', '2002-05-12 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59416, 1497, 142, '<td valign="top">So cute!  I get the feeling anybody touching that bear will get scratched.</td>', 'So cute!  I get the feeling anybody touching that bear will get scratched.', '2002-05-06 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59417, 1497, 117, '<td valign="top">cats eyes</td>', 'cats eyes', '2002-05-06 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59418, 1497, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a great expression on your cat''s face!</td>', 'What a great expression on your cat''s face!', '2002-05-06 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59419, 1497, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  I love cats and I photograph mine all the time.  In this shot, I don''t get the *feel* that someone is trying to sell me something....</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  I love cats and I photograph mine all the time.  In this shot, I don''t get the *feel* that someone is trying to sell me something....', '2002-05-06 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59420, 1497, 327, '<td valign="top">Very cute photo and nicely done.<br/></td>', 'Very cute photo and nicely done.', '2002-05-06 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59421, 1497, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cat shots, you can''t go tooo wrong!  Nice photo, but (same as me....) what are you advertising?  Photo 10 Advert 5 Creativity 6 total 7</td>', 'Cat shots, you can''t go tooo wrong!  Nice photo, but (same as me....) what are you advertising?  Photo 10 Advert 5 Creativity 6 total 7', '2002-05-06 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59422, 1497, 156, '<td valign="top">this is a riot, would make me buy one...rather than take his</td>', 'this is a riot, would make me buy one...rather than take his', '2002-05-06 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59423, 1497, 459, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what you are selling, but the cat is not scary.</td>', 'Don''t know what you are selling, but the cat is not scary.', '2002-05-06 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59424, 1497, 671, '<td valign="top">Are you selling the cat?  If the product is the bear, the focus should be the bear.</td>', 'Are you selling the cat?  If the product is the bear, the focus should be the bear.', '2002-05-06 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59425, 1497, 1336, '<td valign="top">pretty good.  you captured the right expression on the cat''s face, but it would have been better without the back of the chair in the background.</td>', 'pretty good.  you captured the right expression on the cat''s face, but it would have been better without the back of the chair in the background.', '2002-05-06 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59426, 1497, 656, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get what is being advertised here.</td>', 'Not sure I get what is being advertised here.', '2002-05-08 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59427, 1497, 472, '<td valign="top">what''s a Gund? cute cat.</td>', 'what''s a Gund? cute cat.', '2002-05-08 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59428, 1497, 1209, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, both the picture and the cat!</td>', 'Nicely composed, both the picture and the cat!', '2002-05-09 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59429, 1497, 811, '<td valign="top">I''m not going to mess with that cat.  He (?) has definitely claimed the bear as his.  the wooden slats (I assume a headboard) are a little distracting, though--it kinda makes it look like they are in a cell or crib, etc</td>', 'I''m not going to mess with that cat.  He (?) has definitely claimed the bear as his.  the wooden slats (I assume a headboard) are a little distracting, though--it kinda makes it look like they are in a cell or crib, etc', '2002-05-09 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59430, 1497, 554, '<td valign="top">this is a really nice photo but I can''t be influenced by the title--sorry</td>', 'this is a really nice photo but I can''t be influenced by the title--sorry', '2002-05-10 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59431, 1497, 446, '<td valign="top">Well exposed shot.  The lighting on the bear seems a little harsh.  The background doesn''t seem to belong?  Nice sharp focus on the cat''s face.  Nice effort.</td>', 'Well exposed shot.  The lighting on the bear seems a little harsh.  The background doesn''t seem to belong?  Nice sharp focus on the cat''s face.  Nice effort.', '2002-05-10 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59432, 1497, 1031, '<td valign="top">A friend just wrote me about her cat who has the "Dave Stewart scowl" (former Oakland pitcher). There''s quite a few pretty talented modelling cats out there among this group.</td>', 'A friend just wrote me about her cat who has the "Dave Stewart scowl" (former Oakland pitcher). There''s quite a few pretty talented modelling cats out there among this group.', '2002-05-11 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59433, 1497, 1, '<td valign="top">The cat doesn''t do much for the selling of the bear.</td>', 'The cat doesn''t do much for the selling of the bear.', '2002-05-12 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59434, 1497, 139, '<td valign="top">Selling the bear?  It doesn''t seem like much of an ad to me.  Sorry.</td>', 'Selling the bear?  It doesn''t seem like much of an ad to me.  Sorry.', '2002-05-12 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59435, 1497, 1707, '<td valign="top">A Gund is the name brand for the teddy bear!  Good quality toys.  I like your photographs, but probably would make a better postcard or notecard than an advertisement.</td>', 'A Gund is the name brand for the teddy bear!  Good quality toys.  I like your photographs, but probably would make a better postcard or notecard than an advertisement.', '2002-05-19 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(59436, 1498, 156, '<td valign="top">in real life the mouse would be clean but this is really good!</td>', 'in real life the mouse would be clean but this is really good!', '2002-05-06 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59437, 1498, 889, '<td valign="top">Your going to get so many complaints that  this is fake it just blows the mind. nice printer by the way. How did gou get such and even white spot? backlighting a sheet?</td>', 'Your going to get so many complaints that  this is fake it just blows the mind. nice printer by the way. How did gou get such and even white spot? backlighting a sheet?', '2002-05-06 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59438, 1498, 205, '<td valign="top">Unless you printed those out on a paper than wrapped it around the bottle I think this will get disqualified other than that it gets a 9 due to spacing issues</td>', 'Unless you printed those out on a paper than wrapped it around the bottle I think this will get disqualified other than that it gets a 9 due to spacing issues', '2002-05-06 03:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59439, 1498, 92, '<td valign="top">I''ll take a dozen ! Need my address? Too cool !</td>', 'I''ll take a dozen ! Need my address? Too cool !', '2002-05-06 06:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59440, 1498, 1128, '<td valign="top">Very creative (and hard work, I''m sure...) I wish the mouse was a little cleaner...</td>', 'Very creative (and hard work, I''m sure...) I wish the mouse was a little cleaner...', '2002-05-06 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59441, 1498, 472, '<td valign="top">cool idea. this must have taken you forever!  and thanks for having my photo in the middle (the curlicue)!  i''m going to be very interested to find out how you lit this.  also feels slightly tilted to the right.  And there''s some rough stuff on the left tabletop that kind of detracts.  still a great image</td>', 'cool idea. this must have taken you forever!  and thanks for having my photo in the middle (the curlicue)!  i''m going to be very interested to find out how you lit this.  also feels slightly tilted to the right.  And there''s some rough stuff on the left tabletop that kind of detracts.  still a great image', '2002-05-06 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59442, 1498, 1024, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  Sorry I do not have any constructive critisisms.</td>', 'I really like this one.  Sorry I do not have any constructive critisisms.', '2002-05-06 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59443, 1498, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great idea!</td>', 'Wow!  Great idea!', '2002-05-06 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59444, 1498, 327, '<td valign="top">Clever! Made me smile .....and that''s good. This fits with their ads and it''s on target.</td>', 'Clever! Made me smile .....and that''s good. This fits with their ads and it''s on target.', '2002-05-06 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59445, 1498, 835, '<td valign="top">Creative and well done.  I like the back lighting.</td>', 'Creative and well done.  I like the back lighting.', '2002-05-06 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59446, 1498, 718, '<td valign="top">Creative, but absolutely breaks the rules!</td>', 'Creative, but absolutely breaks the rules!', '2002-05-06 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59447, 1498, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great feedback.  I love this picture!  I think the vodka got slighted, but otherwise GREAT!  Photo 10 Advert 6 Creativity 10 total 9</td>', 'Wow!  Great feedback.  I love this picture!  I think the vodka got slighted, but otherwise GREAT!  Photo 10 Advert 6 Creativity 10 total 9', '2002-05-06 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59448, 1498, 616, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea, nice and sharp focus...i see my pic</td>', 'Very cool idea, nice and sharp focus...i see my pic', '2002-05-06 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59449, 1498, 724, '<td valign="top">You put my "INVERTIGO" photo on the top!! Excellent placement, thats where I thought it should go all along :) HA HA  Great Concept Idea!<br/><br/>My 2 cents, I think you needed to give this just a bit more head room, and maybe a cleaner mouse.  Still great photo! ...8</td>', 'You put my "INVERTIGO" photo on the top!! Excellent placement, thats where I thought it should go all along :) HA HA  Great Concept Idea!My 2 cents, I think you needed to give this just a bit more head room, and maybe a cleaner mouse.  Still great photo! ...8', '2002-05-06 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59450, 1498, 1483, '<td valign="top">It''s really a ten but I took a point of for the dirty mouse</td>', 'It''s really a ten but I took a point of for the dirty mouse', '2002-05-06 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59451, 1498, 210, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea, but I think the dirtiness of the mouse really hurt the overall effect.</td>', 'Very creative idea, but I think the dirtiness of the mouse really hurt the overall effect.', '2002-05-06 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59452, 1498, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely done -- did you ask everyone''s permission?  :)  The dirty mouse doesn''t help too much, you shoulda gotten a nice new shiny one.</td>', 'Nicely done -- did you ask everyone''s permission?  :)  The dirty mouse doesn''t help too much, you shoulda gotten a nice new shiny one.', '2002-05-06 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59453, 1498, 772, '<td valign="top">This is nice!  I like the creativity here.  The only thing I think would have made it better is if the mouse would have gotten a ''spot'' of windex before the shot :)  You also could have used some of *MY* photos when making this project ;)  Excellent work!</td>', 'This is nice!  I like the creativity here.  The only thing I think would have made it better is if the mouse would have gotten a ''spot'' of windex before the shot :)  You also could have used some of *MY* photos when making this project ;)  Excellent work!', '2002-05-06 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59454, 1498, 1204, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2002-05-06 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59455, 1498, 459, '<td valign="top">Very Creative!  You, obviously put a lot of work into this.  Why a dirty mouse?</td>', 'Very Creative!  You, obviously put a lot of work into this.  Why a dirty mouse?', '2002-05-06 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59456, 1498, 1336, '<td valign="top">this would have been good if my photo was in it :-)  but seriously, very unique and creative...</td>', 'this would have been good if my photo was in it :-)  but seriously, very unique and creative...', '2002-05-06 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59457, 1498, 1066, '<td valign="top">Very eye catching.  Is this a projected image or did you past a proof sheet on the bottle?<br/><br/>I like this photo</td>', 'Very eye catching.  Is this a projected image or did you past a proof sheet on the bottle?I like this photo', '2002-05-07 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59458, 1498, 245, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is amazing!</td>', 'Wow, this is amazing!', '2002-05-07 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59459, 1498, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and a very nice photo... the mouse is a bit grimey though, ick!</td>', 'Interesting concept and a very nice photo... the mouse is a bit grimey though, ick!', '2002-05-07 07:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59460, 1498, 689, '<td valign="top">Interesting ... not sure if you are a brown-noser or not though! Nice pic ... clean your mouse though.</td>', 'Interesting ... not sure if you are a brown-noser or not though! Nice pic ... clean your mouse though.', '2002-05-07 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59461, 1498, 888, '<td valign="top">nice, how''d you get the spotlight effect, is it with light or with a "real" absolut ad behind it?</td>', 'nice, how''d you get the spotlight effect, is it with light or with a "real" absolut ad behind it?', '2002-05-07 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59462, 1498, 1054, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this took quite some time to put together.  I''m impressed.</td>', 'I''m sure this took quite some time to put together.  I''m impressed.', '2002-05-07 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59463, 1498, 441, '<td valign="top">interesting submission, must have been a hell of a job wrapping that bottle!</td>', 'interesting submission, must have been a hell of a job wrapping that bottle!', '2002-05-07 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59464, 1498, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  Great photo.  Would be a ten if it wasn''t as grainy.</td>', 'Great concept.  Great photo.  Would be a ten if it wasn''t as grainy.', '2002-05-07 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59465, 1498, 748, '<td valign="top">I really like the originality, and the shot is great too.  Congrats on this effort.</td>', 'I really like the originality, and the shot is great too.  Congrats on this effort.', '2002-05-07 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59466, 1498, 536, '<td valign="top">very interesting idea. I''m not sure the light behind works well. Would a softer light be better? Think cleaning the mouse would have been a good idea. That is a nit pick. Overall - I really like it. Creative.</td>', 'very interesting idea. I''m not sure the light behind works well. Would a softer light be better? Think cleaning the mouse would have been a good idea. That is a nit pick. Overall - I really like it. Creative.', '2002-05-07 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59467, 1498, 446, '<td valign="top">I like your creativity here in "wrapping the bottle".  I also like the effect ot the light behind the bottle, though it might work better if balanced left to right.  The inclusion of the mouse is icing on the cake.  The bottle appears tilted about 2 degrees clockwise, though that may have been your intent?  The shot appears quite noisy for some reason?  High ISO?  Long exposure?  Over sharpened in post processing?  The colors appear quite saturated, though it seems to work for this shot.  Excellent effort.</td>', 'I like your creativity here in "wrapping the bottle".  I also like the effect ot the light behind the bottle, though it might work better if balanced left to right.  The inclusion of the mouse is icing on the cake.  The bottle appears tilted about 2 degrees clockwise, though that may have been your intent?  The shot appears quite noisy for some reason?  High ISO?  Long exposure?  Over sharpened in post processing?  The colors appear quite saturated, though it seems to work for this shot.  Excellent effort.', '2002-05-07 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59468, 1498, 875, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, beautiful colors, but it''s a little noisy for my taste.</td>', 'Nice idea, beautiful colors, but it''s a little noisy for my taste.', '2002-05-08 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59469, 1498, 656, '<td valign="top">I claim copyright violation - you never asked me if you could use my pictures :)  Very creative absolut advert.    The white background (light? printout?) shows a lot of dithering</td>', 'I claim copyright violation - you never asked me if you could use my pictures :)  Very creative absolut advert.    The white background (light? printout?) shows a lot of dithering', '2002-05-08 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59470, 1498, 1341, '<td valign="top">My absoulte Favorite (next to mine, lol).......This one looks like it took lots of work. Great Job..........</td>', 'My absoulte Favorite (next to mine, lol).......This one looks like it took lots of work. Great Job..........', '2002-05-08 07:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59471, 1498, 862, '<td valign="top">Interesting, very interesting.</td>', 'Interesting, very interesting.', '2002-05-08 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59472, 1498, 527, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I don''t like the mouse though. I know it seems trivial but I think it should have been cleaner and maybe even a different color. An absolut great idea.</td>', 'Very creative. I don''t like the mouse though. I know it seems trivial but I think it should have been cleaner and maybe even a different color. An absolut great idea.', '2002-05-08 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59473, 1498, 554, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I love this shot........and it has one of my pics too!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-29 19:30:44.</i></td>', 'Great idea, I love this shot........and it has one of my pics too!', '2002-05-08 18:13:00.000000', '2005-01-29 19:30:44.000000', 1),
(59474, 1498, 661, '<td valign="top">Interesting selection of photos.  Clear shot and I liked the reflection.</td>', 'Interesting selection of photos.  Clear shot and I liked the reflection.', '2002-05-08 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59475, 1498, 813, '<td valign="top">clever idea, wish the bottle wasn''t leaning slightly, imagine how cool this could look with photoshop work on it to make the pictures appear to be insided the bottle, just a thought</td>', 'clever idea, wish the bottle wasn''t leaning slightly, imagine how cool this could look with photoshop work on it to make the pictures appear to be insided the bottle, just a thought', '2002-05-08 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
