(59478, 1498, 142, '<td valign="top">Good advertisement for the site.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Good advertisement for the site.  Nicely done.', '2002-05-09 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59479, 1498, 1042, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea.....</td>', 'Very clever idea.....', '2002-05-09 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59480, 1498, 1191, '<td valign="top">Amazing.......how did you do it??</td>', 'Amazing.......how did you do it??', '2002-05-10 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59481, 1498, 1141, '<td valign="top">woohoo!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'woohoo!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2002-05-11 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59482, 1498, 543, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but you could have followed through a bit better in the execution.  Getting the photos stuck on the bottle was probably work, but I''d have tried to do a neater job if I were going to bother.  Your mouse is nearly as dirty as mine.  The devil''s in the details, ain''t it?</td>', 'Good concept, but you could have followed through a bit better in the execution.  Getting the photos stuck on the bottle was probably work, but I''d have tried to do a neater job if I were going to bother.  Your mouse is nearly as dirty as mine.  The devil''s in the details, ain''t it?', '2002-05-11 05:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59483, 1498, 1041, '<td valign="top">Did you get copyright permission to use my photo??? J/K.  Awesome idea AND implementation.  One of my top three!</td>', 'Did you get copyright permission to use my photo??? J/K.  Awesome idea AND implementation.  One of my top three!', '2002-05-11 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59484, 1498, 1202, '<td valign="top">I know its a digital photo because I am at the dpchallenge site.   If I were not aware of the site would I know that this was an advertisement?</td>', 'I know its a digital photo because I am at the dpchallenge site.   If I were not aware of the site would I know that this was an advertisement?', '2002-05-12 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59485, 1498, 1580, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  I imagine it took some time to prepare that bottle too.  Clever.  I might have used a cleaner mouse though.</td>', 'Very creative.  I imagine it took some time to prepare that bottle too.  Clever.  I might have used a cleaner mouse though.', '2002-05-12 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59486, 1498, 139, '<td valign="top">Great work, and I''m quite flattered to have my photo appear.</td>', 'Great work, and I''m quite flattered to have my photo appear.', '2002-05-12 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59487, 1498, 1584, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2002-05-13 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59488, 1498, 2, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even see my pic in there!  weeeee!   Seriously, though ... congrats and well done.</td>', 'I didn''t even see my pic in there!  weeeee!   Seriously, though ... congrats and well done.', '2002-05-13 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(59489, 1498, 255, '<td valign="top">Whew! It sure was tough being quiet this week!:)<br/><br/>First of all I would like to issue a formal apology to those that I offended by using your pictures. When I first read the challenge criteria, I focused on the "advertisement" and "appeal to the users of DPChallenge". Since I love the Absolut ads, this was the only way I could think of to make it work. Then I started reading the copyright infringement posts. Here was the problem I faced--should I email the 25 or so users and ask--thereby risking about an 1/8th of the voters pretty much knowing which picture was which----or preserve anonymity? Very hard decision--but I decided to just wait and see what happened. Perhaps I made the wrong decision--and I apologize. I meant no harm. <br/><br/>The original (fair!) picture layout consisted of taking the top three winners from every challenge. Then I had lots of trouble getting them laid out, so I just started grabbing pictures and printing them horizontally and vertically. So, just because you don''t see your picture doesn''t mean it''s not there---it might be just hidden or on the other side of the bottle!<br/><br/>The mouse, oh the agony. I can''t even look at this picture without cringing! Let me just say to all--if you keep a box of old but seemingly useful stuff that you think you might ever need---throw it away! Far, far away! That crappy mouse (circa 1996?) still worked so I kept it for an *emergency*--? Needless to say, this project was done at night, and with all the other issues, I never even really looked at the dirty guy. Well, believe me I have learned that lesson! No more pack rat--all brand new stuff for me!:) What a great excuse to shop!<br/><br/>Thanks again for all the comments--you guys rock!</td>', 'Whew! It sure was tough being quiet this week!:)First of all I would like to issue a formal apology to those that I offended by using your pictures. When I first read the challenge criteria, I focused on the "advertisement" and "appeal to the users of DPChallenge". Since I love the Absolut ads, this was the only way I could think of to make it work. Then I started reading the copyright infringement posts. Here was the problem I faced--should I email the 25 or so users and ask--thereby risking about an 1/8th of the voters pretty much knowing which picture was which----or preserve anonymity? Very hard decision--but I decided to just wait and see what happened. Perhaps I made the wrong decision--and I apologize. I meant no harm. The original (fair!) picture layout consisted of taking the top three winners from every challenge. Then I had lots of trouble getting them laid out, so I just started grabbing pictures and printing them horizontally and vertically. So, just because you don''t see your picture doesn''t mean it''s not there---it might be just hidden or on the other side of the bottle!The mouse, oh the agony. I can''t even look at this picture without cringing! Let me just say to all--if you keep a box of old but seemingly useful stuff that you think you might ever need---throw it away! Far, far away! That crappy mouse (circa 1996?) still worked so I kept it for an *emergency*--? Needless to say, this project was done at night, and with all the other issues, I never even really looked at the dirty guy. Well, believe me I have learned that lesson! No more pack rat--all brand new stuff for me!:) What a great excuse to shop!Thanks again for all the comments--you guys rock!', '2002-05-13 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(59490, 1498, 656, '<td valign="top">in case it wasn''t obvious - I was only joking about the copyright thing :)  Great picture, crudy mouse, can''t believe you got 4 votes of 1.</td>', 'in case it wasn''t obvious - I was only joking about the copyright thing :)  Great picture, crudy mouse, can''t believe you got 4 votes of 1.', '2002-05-14 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
