(59506, 1499, 1037, '<td valign="top">Fruit flavours for popcorn? If I didn''t know it was apple flavoured, I think those piles of popcorn would look tempting :). I don''t know that the black backdrop really works though, especially since the pot that the popcorn is in is also black, and the lighting seems not to have caught the box the right way. My eyes are drawn more to that hand than to the box.</td>', 'Fruit flavours for popcorn? If I didn''t know it was apple flavoured, I think those piles of popcorn would look tempting :). I don''t know that the black backdrop really works though, especially since the pot that the popcorn is in is also black, and the lighting seems not to have caught the box the right way. My eyes are drawn more to that hand than to the box.', '2002-05-07 02:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
