(59512, 1499, 811, '<td valign="top">Being able to see the creases in and the edge of your black cloth is a little distracting.  Also, the popcorn in front is a little washed out, so someof the detail is lost.  I like the hand in the picture for some reason.  Adds another element to the picture  I guess.</td>', 'Being able to see the creases in and the edge of your black cloth is a little distracting.  Also, the popcorn in front is a little washed out, so someof the detail is lost.  I like the hand in the picture for some reason.  Adds another element to the picture  I guess.', '2002-05-09 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
