(59519, 1499, 446, '<td valign="top">I like the idea (and I love popcorn).  The mood set by the photo is great.  The picture seems to suffer due to the strong light reflected on the thumb and index finger on the hand, the harsh reflections on the pot handle,  and the strong reflection on the top edge of the box.  I can appreciate the difficulty of lighting such a scene.  The colors do not appear natural.  White balance issue?  There appear to be severe artifacts from in camera or post processing?  The popcorn should be more in focus for my tastes.  With all of this said, I still think it is a fine effort, and please take my comments in the spirit of constructive criticism.</td>', 'I like the idea (and I love popcorn).  The mood set by the photo is great.  The picture seems to suffer due to the strong light reflected on the thumb and index finger on the hand, the harsh reflections on the pot handle,  and the strong reflection on the top edge of the box.  I can appreciate the difficulty of lighting such a scene.  The colors do not appear natural.  White balance issue?  There appear to be severe artifacts from in camera or post processing?  The popcorn should be more in focus for my tastes.  With all of this said, I still think it is a fine effort, and please take my comments in the spirit of constructive criticism.', '2002-05-12 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
