(59567, 1502, 428, '<td valign="top">Oooh we used to get these all the time! The only thing I would change is to make these int he front closer together so you can''t see the table under.</td>', 'Oooh we used to get these all the time! The only thing I would change is to make these int he front closer together so you can''t see the table under.', '2002-05-06 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
