(59577, 1502, 472, '<td valign="top">i like this. i did a pic similar that i didnt enter, wtih batteries.  one thing i found effective was to use a big aperature to limit focus to onlyone of the batteries so the rest blurred into the distance.  check it out:  //www.pbase.com/image/1941284</td>', 'i like this. i did a pic similar that i didnt enter, wtih batteries.  one thing i found effective was to use a big aperature to limit focus to onlyone of the batteries so the rest blurred into the distance.  check it out:  //www.pbase.com/image/1941284', '2002-05-08 09:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59578, 1502, 715, '<td valign="top">Mmm I like these pops. Nice setup and and a colorfull picture. The unsharpness at the bottom  is kinda disturbing though.</td>', 'Mmm I like these pops. Nice setup and and a colorfull picture. The unsharpness at the bottom  is kinda disturbing though.', '2002-05-08 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59579, 1502, 1, '<td valign="top">The layout is good, but It looks like your camera blocked some of your light creating a distracting shadow on the bottom/right.</td>', 'The layout is good, but It looks like your camera blocked some of your light creating a distracting shadow on the bottom/right.', '2002-05-08 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59580, 1502, 862, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement; however, it is slightly out of focus and the glare along the left side detracts from the picture.  Increase depth of field.</td>', 'Nice arrangement; however, it is slightly out of focus and the glare along the left side detracts from the picture.  Increase depth of field.', '2002-05-08 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59581, 1502, 1523, '<td valign="top">Great colors in this shot. My favorite one !</td>', 'Great colors in this shot. My favorite one !', '2002-05-08 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59582, 1502, 527, '<td valign="top">The closest Otter Pop should be brighter like the others. It''s a pretty cool picture, though.</td>', 'The closest Otter Pop should be brighter like the others. It''s a pretty cool picture, though.', '2002-05-08 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59583, 1502, 889, '<td valign="top">difficult focus choice.</td>', 'difficult focus choice.', '2002-05-08 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59584, 1502, 675, '<td valign="top">if only the one closest to the camera was in focus...</td>', 'if only the one closest to the camera was in focus...', '2002-05-09 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59585, 1502, 280, '<td valign="top">It may have helped if you had put them on a white background.</td>', 'It may have helped if you had put them on a white background.', '2002-05-09 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59586, 1502, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice and colorful.  I also like the way the eye is drawn upwards and over.  I think it would have been better if you had cut/tore the individual ones apart so that it was color to color without the table (?) showing.</td>', 'Nice and colorful.  I also like the way the eye is drawn upwards and over.  I think it would have been better if you had cut/tore the individual ones apart so that it was color to color without the table (?) showing.', '2002-05-09 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59587, 1502, 554, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a bit greater depth but thats just personal pref.</td>', 'I would have liked a bit greater depth but thats just personal pref.', '2002-05-10 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59588, 1502, 1031, '<td valign="top">I haven''t had one of those in a looonnnng time...</td>', 'I haven''t had one of those in a looonnnng time...', '2002-05-11 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59589, 1502, 446, '<td valign="top">Very colorful.  As an ad it would seem you would want a greater depth of field so that all of the products are in focus (though I understand this may not have been your intended effect)?  The blown highlights on the left side of the photo should have been avoided with a different lighting effect.  Good effort.</td>', 'Very colorful.  As an ad it would seem you would want a greater depth of field so that all of the products are in focus (though I understand this may not have been your intended effect)?  The blown highlights on the left side of the photo should have been avoided with a different lighting effect.  Good effort.', '2002-05-12 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59590, 1502, 2, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this shot, but I wish the ones closer to us were more vibrant.  Maybe lower the lighting to the side so they looked like they were glowing more than reflecting.</td>', 'I love the colors in this shot, but I wish the ones closer to us were more vibrant.  Maybe lower the lighting to the side so they looked like they were glowing more than reflecting.', '2002-05-12 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59591, 1502, 139, '<td valign="top">Good advertisement, it makes me want some! I think I would have placed the dark color in the back.</td>', 'Good advertisement, it makes me want some! I think I would have placed the dark color in the back.', '2002-05-12 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59592, 1502, 689, '<td valign="top">watch the glare on the packages ...</td>', 'watch the glare on the packages ...', '2002-05-13 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59593, 1503, 1204, '<td valign="top">Simple idea but quite catching!</td>', 'Simple idea but quite catching!', '2002-05-06 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59594, 1503, 117, '<td valign="top">sm with a touch of cream</td>', 'sm with a touch of cream', '2002-05-06 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59595, 1503, 142, '<td valign="top">This is a great ad.  We probably will never see anything like it in print but it''s still great.  Your lighting and placement a perfect.</td>', 'This is a great ad.  We probably will never see anything like it in print but it''s still great.  Your lighting and placement a perfect.', '2002-05-06 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
