(59606, 1503, 715, '<td valign="top">Very good picture and like it says: original!<br/>I always wondered why they never made advertisements for whipcream this way :-)</td>', 'Very good picture and like it says: original!I always wondered why they never made advertisements for whipcream this way :-)', '2002-05-06 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
