(59609, 1503, 718, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh, ok.</td>', 'Ahhhh, ok.', '2002-05-06 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59610, 1503, 772, '<td valign="top">I really wish this company would use this type of advertising... I can''t recall buying this stuff to actually prepare a dessert with in my past :)  Nice composition here!  There is a little bit of yellow tungsten tinting on the left of the can.. Also, are those cuffs chrome or black?  I have found that chrome is particularly difficult to photograph when it''s not in sunlight... good shot!</td>', 'I really wish this company would use this type of advertising... I can''t recall buying this stuff to actually prepare a dessert with in my past :)  Nice composition here!  There is a little bit of yellow tungsten tinting on the left of the can.. Also, are those cuffs chrome or black?  I have found that chrome is particularly difficult to photograph when it''s not in sunlight... good shot!', '2002-05-06 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
