(59617, 1503, 1336, '<td valign="top">creative.  i like it</td>', 'creative.  i like it', '2002-05-06 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59618, 1503, 1066, '<td valign="top">Such a cheap and dirty way to get votes......I like it!!!!</td>', 'Such a cheap and dirty way to get votes......I like it!!!!', '2002-05-07 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59619, 1503, 1485, '<td valign="top">I like this a LOT.  very creative... but something is off.. maybe not enough light..  I think I''m bothered by the lack of crisp, sharp colors.</td>', 'I like this a LOT.  very creative... but something is off.. maybe not enough light..  I think I''m bothered by the lack of crisp, sharp colors.', '2002-05-07 07:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59620, 1503, 888, '<td valign="top">Really nice idea, I''m not going to ask why you have a whip and handcuffs "lying around"</td>', 'Really nice idea, I''m not going to ask why you have a whip and handcuffs "lying around"', '2002-05-07 07:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59621, 1503, 729, '<td valign="top">humor sells!</td>', 'humor sells!', '2002-05-07 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59622, 1503, 1054, '<td valign="top">Oh, that''s just *wrong.*  I love it!</td>', 'Oh, that''s just *wrong.*  I love it!', '2002-05-07 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59623, 1503, 813, '<td valign="top">I love the humor, and the photo''s not bad either, good lighting and composition, but the can being tipped is a bit tense, maybe that''s good for this subject</td>', 'I love the humor, and the photo''s not bad either, good lighting and composition, but the can being tipped is a bit tense, maybe that''s good for this subject', '2002-05-07 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59624, 1503, 446, '<td valign="top">I like your creativity.  However the white balance appears to be way off on this shot and it appears to suffer from over processing</td>', 'I like your creativity.  However the white balance appears to be way off on this shot and it appears to suffer from over processing', '2002-05-07 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59625, 1503, 301, '<td valign="top">Don''t think I want to ask where you got the stuff for this shot :)  great idea. I''m not sure whether its the the red background or the lighting has caused the whip to look really dark on the right, but I''d prefer to see a little bit more detail there.  That''s being picky tho ... overall, I think this has been done well</td>', 'Don''t think I want to ask where you got the stuff for this shot :)  great idea. I''m not sure whether its the the red background or the lighting has caused the whip to look really dark on the right, but I''d prefer to see a little bit more detail there.  That''s being picky tho ... overall, I think this has been done well', '2002-05-08 05:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59626, 1503, 1341, '<td valign="top">Someone has a little "freak" in them, lol..........Love the idea</td>', 'Someone has a little "freak" in them, lol..........Love the idea', '2002-05-08 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59627, 1503, 472, '<td valign="top">LOL, this is awesome. I love the concept behind this pic.  hmm, so you own a whip and handcuffs eh?  but of courzse you only bought them for this challenge.. right? ;)</td>', 'LOL, this is awesome. I love the concept behind this pic.  hmm, so you own a whip and handcuffs eh?  but of courzse you only bought them for this challenge.. right? ;)', '2002-05-08 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59628, 1503, 527, '<td valign="top">This is great! No title even neccessary. Great composition and colors.</td>', 'This is great! No title even neccessary. Great composition and colors.', '2002-05-08 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59629, 1503, 884, '<td valign="top">VERY kinky, I love it. The handcuffs and whip should have been a little more visible, but other than that, great job!</td>', 'VERY kinky, I love it. The handcuffs and whip should have been a little more visible, but other than that, great job!', '2002-05-09 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59630, 1503, 544, '<td valign="top">Very sexy - the red felt or whathaveyou for the background gives the whole photo a nice warm feel to it, as well as a red influence throughout... great detail on the can, and nice props... i might have given this a perfect score if the whip was a little better lit (blurry is good here), and you captured just an eensy bit more of the texture in the whip handle. nice job.</td>', 'Very sexy - the red felt or whathaveyou for the background gives the whole photo a nice warm feel to it, as well as a red influence throughout... great detail on the can, and nice props... i might have given this a perfect score if the whip was a little better lit (blurry is good here), and you captured just an eensy bit more of the texture in the whip handle. nice job.', '2002-05-09 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59631, 1503, 1510, '<td valign="top">excellent!  idea and photo work well I like how you wrapped the "toys" around the whipped cream</td>', 'excellent!  idea and photo work well I like how you wrapped the "toys" around the whipped cream', '2002-05-09 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59632, 1503, 543, '<td valign="top">So... didja buy the cuffs and cat-o-nine-tails especially for this image, or were they already in the nightstand?  Very clever, and nicely laid out.  Exposure is a bit dark and shows a little color cast and shadow at the top of the bottle, but not too far off.  Nice work.</td>', 'So... didja buy the cuffs and cat-o-nine-tails especially for this image, or were they already in the nightstand?  Very clever, and nicely laid out.  Exposure is a bit dark and shows a little color cast and shadow at the top of the bottle, but not too far off.  Nice work.', '2002-05-10 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59633, 1503, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... (inflection varies)</td>', 'Hmmmm... (inflection varies)', '2002-05-10 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59634, 1503, 1191, '<td valign="top">Well thought out image that I''m sure would get backing commercially</td>', 'Well thought out image that I''m sure would get backing commercially', '2002-05-10 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59635, 1503, 554, '<td valign="top">this is great, even without the title. Are we having fun yet?</td>', 'this is great, even without the title. Are we having fun yet?', '2002-05-10 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59636, 1503, 210, '<td valign="top">Props for creative thinking.</td>', 'Props for creative thinking.', '2002-05-10 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(59637, 1503, 901, '<td valign="top">whip it</td>', 'whip it', '2002-05-10 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
