it happens. Your choice of backgrounds compliments the bottle and the coloring of the perfume.  The texture adds a softness.  I''m not sure about the empty space to the right.  At first glance it would seem like poor composition. But it seems to intentional to be that so I''m not going to assume.  I ran auto levels on the image and it really balanced out the colors well and provided a more expensive look. Did you not like that look? Good job on meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Handsome bottle and rather difficult to shoot. It looks like you had a little problem with lighting but wellit happens. Your choice of backgrounds compliments the bottle and the coloring of the perfume.  The texture adds a softness.  I''m not sure about the empty space to the right.  At first glance it would seem like poor composition. But it seems to intentional to be that so I''m not going to assume.  I ran auto levels on the image and it really balanced out the colors well and provided a more expensive look. Did you not like that look? Good job on meeting the challenge.', '2002-05-07 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58030, 1424, 2, '<td valign="top">My two suggestions are first that the "L" in realm is lost a little on the lighting, and the company might not like that.  Second, did you try ruffling the background up at all?  I like the spots where it''s rougher, and I think that might have looked cool if it were done with all the fabric.</td>', 'My two suggestions are first that the "L" in realm is lost a little on the lighting, and the company might not like that.  Second, did you try ruffling the background up at all?  I like the spots where it''s rougher, and I think that might have looked cool if it were done with all the fabric.', '2002-05-08 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58031, 1424, 656, '<td valign="top">great use of negative space for ''copy'' room.  Top is a bit overexposed, but hard to light well.</td>', 'great use of negative space for ''copy'' room.  Top is a bit overexposed, but hard to light well.', '2002-05-08 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58032, 1424, 472, '<td valign="top">very cool.  great composition, framing. simplicity at it''s best.  i wonder why the letters are gone? eiuther your lighting wasnt set up to really bring the letters out. or you lost them to compression artifacts.  that would be a number one priority though: having a clear name. still, a great shot.</td>', 'very cool.  great composition, framing. simplicity at it''s best.  i wonder why the letters are gone? eiuther your lighting wasnt set up to really bring the letters out. or you lost them to compression artifacts.  that would be a number one priority though: having a clear name. still, a great shot.', '2002-05-08 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58033, 1424, 527, '<td valign="top">The name needs to be better lit. I think the background needs to be darker.</td>', 'The name needs to be better lit. I think the background needs to be darker.', '2002-05-08 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58034, 1424, 269, '<td valign="top">cant read whole name on item</td>', 'cant read whole name on item', '2002-05-08 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58035, 1424, 554, '<td valign="top">wish I could read the label</td>', 'wish I could read the label', '2002-05-08 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58036, 1424, 875, '<td valign="top">I like the light coming through the bottle and the fact that you left room for ad text, but I think that the text on the bottle is too hard to read and the photo is a little noisy.</td>', 'I like the light coming through the bottle and the fact that you left room for ad text, but I think that the text on the bottle is too hard to read and the photo is a little noisy.', '2002-05-08 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58037, 1424, 1510, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this at all but it fits with most perfume ads. Perfume and nothing else.  Overused.</td>', 'I don''t like this at all but it fits with most perfume ads. Perfume and nothing else.  Overused.', '2002-05-09 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58038, 1424, 811, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.  Very crisp, well lit, good color choice for the backdrop, I like the empty space on the right.  VERY WELL DONE!!  (Does it smell good?)</td>', 'One of my favorites.  Very crisp, well lit, good color choice for the backdrop, I like the empty space on the right.  VERY WELL DONE!!  (Does it smell good?)', '2002-05-09 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58039, 1424, 714, '<td valign="top">I need to see more of the word on the bottle.  Other wise very nice.</td>', 'I need to see more of the word on the bottle.  Other wise very nice.', '2002-05-09 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58040, 1424, 543, '<td valign="top">"Ream Womin"?  The composition is okay, except that the bottle really ought to face into the frame instead of out.  Lighting could be much better - the cap is just a mess of reflections and hotspots.  This kind of thing - chrome and glass -  is very hard to do, but I think you could do better than this even without studio gear.  Try some white foam core to take control of the light and reflections next time.  Also seems oversharpened.</td>', '"Ream Womin"?  The composition is okay, except that the bottle really ought to face into the frame instead of out.  Lighting could be much better - the cap is just a mess of reflections and hotspots.  This kind of thing - chrome and glass -  is very hard to do, but I think you could do better than this even without studio gear.  Try some white foam core to take control of the light and reflections next time.  Also seems oversharpened.', '2002-05-10 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58041, 1424, 131, '<td valign="top">the straw ruins the picture</td>', 'the straw ruins the picture', '2002-05-10 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
