(58124, 1428, 772, '<td valign="top">I''d rather have seen the girl in focus... I don''t care much about the camera.. umm.. well, I guess the girl isnt for sale :)  Ok.. This is a very nice shot.  One of my favorites for this challenge !!  Good job...</td>', 'I''d rather have seen the girl in focus... I don''t care much about the camera.. umm.. well, I guess the girl isnt for sale :)  Ok.. This is a very nice shot.  One of my favorites for this challenge !!  Good job...', '2002-05-06 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58125, 1428, 459, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and pretty lady.  Something is wrong, though.  I know you wanted the lense in focus and the lady out, but it makes me feel like I''ll take pictures that look like she does if I buy your lense.</td>', 'Nice idea and pretty lady.  Something is wrong, though.  I know you wanted the lense in focus and the lady out, but it makes me feel like I''ll take pictures that look like she does if I buy your lense.', '2002-05-06 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
