(58127, 1428, 1336, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2002-05-06 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58128, 1428, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but the connection between the zoom lens and the woman with the flower is a bit tentative. Is she intended to be the subject of a photo? The depth of field is  really effective though, as well as the purple reflection in the lens. I like it :)</td>', 'Nice photo, but the connection between the zoom lens and the woman with the flower is a bit tentative. Is she intended to be the subject of a photo? The depth of field is  really effective though, as well as the purple reflection in the lens. I like it :)', '2002-05-07 03:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58129, 1428, 446, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I think the title works perfectly with the model in the background.  The short depth of field keeps the focus (no pun intended) on the primary subject.  Nice composition, lighting, and exposure.  I rate this photo a 10,</td>', 'Nice idea.  I think the title works perfectly with the model in the background.  The short depth of field keeps the focus (no pun intended) on the primary subject.  Nice composition, lighting, and exposure.  I rate this photo a 10,', '2002-05-07 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58130, 1428, 1054, '<td valign="top">Could you have shown more of the camera here?</td>', 'Could you have shown more of the camera here?', '2002-05-07 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58131, 1428, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Well executed.</td>', 'Great idea. Well executed.', '2002-05-07 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58132, 1428, 748, '<td valign="top">I love the DOF.  I think this is AD quality!</td>', 'I love the DOF.  I think this is AD quality!', '2002-05-07 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58133, 1428, 301, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one.  Was it done in a mirror? cos if you look closely at the edge of the lens there seems to be a ghost lens ... I would have moved the camera across ever so slightly and gotten rid of the edge of the lens coming back on the right hand side. I would also have moved the girl (if it isn''t yourself) over a little more to get the whole face (or at least both eyes) and close the gap in the middle. Oh and there''s a very small bit of camera at about 8 o''clock.  Geez I''m being picky ... sorry ... I still like the photo ... honest :)</td>', 'I really liked this one.  Was it done in a mirror? cos if you look closely at the edge of the lens there seems to be a ghost lens ... I would have moved the camera across ever so slightly and gotten rid of the edge of the lens coming back on the right hand side. I would also have moved the girl (if it isn''t yourself) over a little more to get the whole face (or at least both eyes) and close the gap in the middle. Oh and there''s a very small bit of camera at about 8 o''clock.  Geez I''m being picky ... sorry ... I still like the photo ... honest :)', '2002-05-08 05:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58134, 1428, 472, '<td valign="top">nice shot, and pretty girl!  a couple comments.  if the lens could be brighter, would be great, and also your depth of field is just a little too shallow- at min the whole lens shoud be in focus.  im giving this an 8.</td>', 'nice shot, and pretty girl!  a couple comments.  if the lens could be brighter, would be great, and also your depth of field is just a little too shallow- at min the whole lens shoud be in focus.  im giving this an 8.', '2002-05-08 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58135, 1428, 527, '<td valign="top">Very nice and the lens is cool too. I can definitely see this in an ad.</td>', 'Very nice and the lens is cool too. I can definitely see this in an ad.', '2002-05-08 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58136, 1428, 813, '<td valign="top">interesting idea that could be improved by having more light on the product, as it is my eye darts back and vorth between the girl and the lens, by emphasizing the lens more with better light, that might not be a problem</td>', 'interesting idea that could be improved by having more light on the product, as it is my eye darts back and vorth between the girl and the lens, by emphasizing the lens more with better light, that might not be a problem', '2002-05-08 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
