(58138, 1428, 875, '<td valign="top">I like the use of color contrasts - the red rose with the blue reflection on the lens and the black lens with the light background.</td>', 'I like the use of color contrasts - the red rose with the blue reflection on the lens and the black lens with the light background.', '2002-05-09 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
