(58143, 1428, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d have just titled it "Canon photography..." as thre''s nothing distinctly "digital" shown. And I''d maye have tightened it up a little so as to not have to crop through her eye -- but that''s just my cropping style...</td>', 'I''d have just titled it "Canon photography..." as thre''s nothing distinctly "digital" shown. And I''d maye have tightened it up a little so as to not have to crop through her eye -- but that''s just my cropping style...', '2002-05-11 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
