(58145, 1428, 544, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - very colorful and nice focus... The lighting itself of the camera, though, is a little too dark - just a touch. The way the lighting in the shot is, though, it would probably be difficult to get better lighting on the camera. A nice shot overall, and deserving of a high score.</td>', 'Nice shot - very colorful and nice focus... The lighting itself of the camera, though, is a little too dark - just a touch. The way the lighting in the shot is, though, it would probably be difficult to get better lighting on the camera. A nice shot overall, and deserving of a high score.', '2002-05-12 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58146, 1428, 1202, '<td valign="top">A subtle sales pitch that works for me,</td>', 'A subtle sales pitch that works for me,', '2002-05-12 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58147, 1428, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the model and rose just doesn''t do much to sell the shot.  I think camera ads typically feature crisp photos... and while the lens is crisp, the mode/flower are not.</td>', 'Nice shot, but the model and rose just doesn''t do much to sell the shot.  I think camera ads typically feature crisp photos... and while the lens is crisp, the mode/flower are not.', '2002-05-12 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58148, 1428, 2, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  I just love the flower, and the girl looks so happy.  I think my eye wants to look at both as the dominant subject... and in this case, that''s good.  The product and what the product do!</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  I just love the flower, and the girl looks so happy.  I think my eye wants to look at both as the dominant subject... and in this case, that''s good.  The product and what the product do!', '2002-05-12 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58149, 1428, 139, '<td valign="top">Great use of the focus, and excellent title.   I think the lighting could have been done better.  I feel like the shadows take something away from the image.   She''s the background, but I think this is closer to portrait lighting.  I guess I just think that more color would have added to the photo (but I really do like it nonetheless).  Nice touch with the rose.</td>', 'Great use of the focus, and excellent title.   I think the lighting could have been done better.  I feel like the shadows take something away from the image.   She''s the background, but I think this is closer to portrait lighting.  I guess I just think that more color would have added to the photo (but I really do like it nonetheless).  Nice touch with the rose.', '2002-05-12 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58150, 1428, 637, '<td valign="top">Wish the beauty were sharper</td>', 'Wish the beauty were sharper', '2002-05-12 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58151, 1428, 446, '<td valign="top">Very surprisng to me that you placed no higher than 15th?  In my view the model adds to the enjoyment of the shot.  Keeping her out of focus keeps the attention on the product, but her presence adds to the enjoyment of the ad and grabs your attention amongst all of the clutter in the advertising world.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Very surprisng to me that you placed no higher than 15th?  In my view the model adds to the enjoyment of the shot.  Keeping her out of focus keeps the attention on the product, but her presence adds to the enjoyment of the ad and grabs your attention amongst all of the clutter in the advertising world.  Keep up the good work.', '2002-05-13 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
