(58893, 1467, 1, '<td valign="top">Impressive focal point.  You''ve focused on exactly what the subject is.  I think rotating it 90cw would make it even better.</td>', 'Impressive focal point.  You''ve focused on exactly what the subject is.  I think rotating it 90cw would make it even better.', '2002-05-06 08:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
