(58911, 1467, 543, '<td valign="top">Just so fine, but you know that.  Might have been more effective cropped top, bottom and left to remove the lighting glare and airspace in the bottle - would have tightened everything up a bit for better or worse, but them''s pretty small pomme de terre.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Just so fine, but you know that.  Might have been more effective cropped top, bottom and left to remove the lighting glare and airspace in the bottle - would have tightened everything up a bit for better or worse, but them''s pretty small pomme de terre.  Congratulations!', '2002-05-09 05:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
