(58956, 1468, 472, '<td valign="top">mmhmm.  makes me wanna drink it up.  good use of red stripes to add visual interest and complement the pepsi colors.  a cute blonde always helps, too : )</td>', 'mmhmm.  makes me wanna drink it up.  good use of red stripes to add visual interest and complement the pepsi colors.  a cute blonde always helps, too : )', '2002-05-08 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(58957, 1468, 933, '<td valign="top">Good pose, well lit subject.  Though the lighting is a bit strong, creating a shadow on her shirt.  Also, and these are merely very minor details, but her shirt seems to have some spots on it, and her forhead is a bit sweaty.  But these very minor distractions aside, this is a nice photo.  Good work!</td>', 'Good pose, well lit subject.  Though the lighting is a bit strong, creating a shadow on her shirt.  Also, and these are merely very minor details, but her shirt seems to have some spots on it, and her forhead is a bit sweaty.  But these very minor distractions aside, this is a nice photo.  Good work!', '2002-05-08 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
