(58970, 1468, 1580, '<td valign="top">Amazing colors.  Bright.  Beautiful.  There is something about her eyes and smile that is infectious.  Stunning.  I can''t help but smile... and want a Pepsi.</td>', 'Amazing colors.  Bright.  Beautiful.  There is something about her eyes and smile that is infectious.  Stunning.  I can''t help but smile... and want a Pepsi.', '2002-05-12 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
